window.TMD=window.TMD||{};TMD["S04"]=[{"z":"致老师","t":"To The Teachers","k":"text","p":[2,3],"b":[["h2","To The Teachers","致老师",0],["p","Being prepared can make all the difference in teaching. No matter how many years you've been teaching, you should know that every class is different. Make sure to write a lesson plan for every class. Good preparation makes for a good class. If you're having difficulty with the students, it may be that you are not adequately prepared. Observe the students' progress and make changes when you find that something isn't working. You should spend at least 30 minutes preparing for each class. Then watch how smoothly the class can go.","做好准备，教学效果就会完全不同。不论您教了多少年，都应该知道每个班级都不一样。每堂课都一定要写教案，好的准备成就好的课堂。如果您觉得学生难带，可能是准备得不够充分。观察学生的进步，发现某些做法没用时就加以调整。每堂课至少花 30 分钟准备，您会发现课堂进行得非常顺利。",0],["h2","How To Teach S4","如何教 S4",0],["h3","● Teaching Materials Introduction","● 教材介绍",0],["p","There are two series, the S Series (See It and Say It) and the EEC Series (Easy English Conversation). They are designed to help students learn English with confidence. Here are the S4 teaching materials:","本课程有两套系列：S 系列（See It and Say It）和 EEC 系列（Easy English Conversation），目的是帮助学生有自信地学习英语。以下是 S4 的教材：",0],["h2","S Series","S 系列",0],["h3","● Student's Books","● 学生用书",0],["p","Classroom Readers 4 Classroom Activities 4A and 4B Homework Exercises 4A and 4B","Classroom Readers 4、Classroom Activities 4A 和 4B、Homework Exercises 4A 和 4B",0],["h3","● Progress Report Book","● 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["p","Today's Lesson Evaluation Sheet","今日课程（Today's Lesson）、评估表（Evaluation Sheet）",0],["h3","● VCD/MP3",null,0],["p","S SeriesClassroom Readers, Classroom Activities, Homework Exercises","S 系列 Classroom Readers、Classroom Activities、Homework Exercises",0],["h3","EEC",null,0],["h3","● Evaluation Sheets","● 评估本",0],["p","Listening labs Quizzes Tests Activity Sheets S4 consist of five books: Classroom Reader 4, Classroom Activities 4A and 4B, (used in the classroom), and Homework Exercises 4A and 4B, (intended for home use). S4 has a three-month (24 sessions) time span in which to be completed. There are twelve lessons in the Classroom Readers, fifteen lessons in the Classroom Activities Book, three Test Days, three Activity Days, and three Review Days. This teacher's manual gives teachers a clear presentation for each lesson and informs teachers of the pace, grammar, communication, and phonetic objectives. Each lesson, time permitting, should include some type of game/exercise based on that day's lesson or as a review of previous lessons. It is important to read this section of the book thoroughly before teaching.","听力练习、小测验、测验、活动单。S4 包含五本书：Classroom Reader 4、Classroom Activities 4A 和 4B（课堂上使用），以及 Homework Exercises 4A 和 4B（在家使用）。S4 预计在三个月（24 堂课）内完成，包含 Classroom Readers 十二课、Classroom Activities 十五课、三次测验日、三次活动日和三次复习日。本教师手册为每一课提供清楚的教学呈现，并告诉老师教学进度，以及语法、沟通和发音的目标。时间允许的话，每堂课都应加入一些以当天课程为主，或复习之前课程的游戏／练习。教学前务必详读本书这个部分。",0],["h3","● Classroom Readers: CR","● Classroom Readers：CR",0],["p","This book includes short stories and vocabulary. In S4, the students are going to learn English from stories! The S4 Classroom Reader is designed in dialogue form to help students get used to reading and speaking. They will get to know \"Mike Monkey\" and his family's life from each story. Then, they will learn more English in the Classroom Activities book; for example, sentence patterns. The teacher can see all of S4 on Jordan's Website, a good resource for teaching and a fun way of learning English. The students will be very interested in learning from digital teaching, because it is animated and the sound effects are cool!","这本书收录短篇故事和单词。在 S4，学生要从故事中学英语！S4 的 Classroom Reader 以对话形式设计，帮助学生习惯阅读和口语。学生会从每个故事中认识“Mike Monkey”和他一家人的生活，接着在 Classroom Activities 中学到更多英语，例如句型。老师可以在乔登网站上看到 S4 的所有内容，网站是很好的教学资源，也是学英语的有趣方式。学生会对数字教学非常有兴趣，因为有动画，音效也很酷！",0],["h3","● Classroom Activities: CA","● Classroom Activities：CA",0],["p","There are two Classroom Activities books: 4A and 4B. They provide a variety of activities to strengthen conversation skills and reinforce sentence patterns. There is also a strong emphasis on phonetics and pronunciation to help students develop good reading and speaking habits. With the exception of matching exercises, puzzles, and phonetic activities, this book should be used as an ORAL guide to stimulate English communication. It is NOT intended as a reader or a workbook. The blank portions are necessary so that the language is produced orally and not simply read by the students. The exercises are also intended as a guide for teachers to emphasize key Grammar/Sentence/Question Patterns. Since students will learn verbs in S4, the teacher will use a lot of body language to help the students understand the verbs.","Classroom Activities 共有两本：4A 和 4B，提供各种活动来加强会话能力并巩固句型。本书也非常重视发音，帮助学生养成良好的阅读和口语习惯。除了配对练习、拼图和发音活动之外，这本书应作为“口语”引导，用来激发英语沟通。它“不是”读本，也不是作业本。书中的空白部分是为了让学生用口语产出语言，而不只是照着念。这些练习也是老师用来强调重点语法／句型／问句句型的指引。由于学生在 S4 会学到动词，老师要多用肢体语言帮助学生理解动词。",0],["h3","● Homework Exercises: HE","● Homework Exercises：HE",0],["p","The HE book is divided into two volumes: 3A and 3B. The students can work on one of the books while the teacher is correcting the other one. Using these books gives the students a great chance to practice what they have learned. And, the teacher will understand the students' progress by correcting them. The students will get practice in forming sentences while doing their HE books. Correcting their HE books helps you understand your students and their progress.","作业本分为两册（4A 和 4B）。学生可以写其中一本，老师同时批改另一本。使用这些作业本让学生有很好的机会练习学过的内容，老师批改时也能了解学生的进度。学生写作业时会练习造句；批改作业能帮助您了解学生和他们的进步。",0],["h2","Progress Report Book: PRB","学习进度手册：PRB",0],["h3","● Teaching Syllabus/ Today's Homework","● 教学进度／今日作业",0],["p","There are in total twenty four spaces for the students and teachers to record the rate of progress for each class. The teacher is responsible for helping the students fill out the Teaching Syllabus and Today's Homework forms. Please record the students' progress in the Teaching Syllabus book. As to Today's Homework, please remind the students to:","学生和老师共有二十四个栏记录每堂课的进度。老师负责协助学生填写“教学进度”和“今日作业”表格。请在“教学进度”中记录学生的进度；在“今日作业”中，请提醒学生：",0],["li","1. Do Homework Exercises,","1. 写 Homework Exercises，",0],["li","2. Review the lesson using the MP3, OR","2. 用 MP3 复习课程，或",0],["li","3. Go to the website; www.jordan.com.tw to review the lesson. These forms (Teaching Syllabus and Today's Homework) are located in the Progress Report Book that each student should have. Check each student's book after they finish filling out the form, and record their progress. The teacher should record supplementary items used, or homework assigned, in the space marked \"others\"","3. 上网站 www.jordan.com.tw 复习课程。这些表格（教学进度和今日作业）都在每位学生的学习进度手册里。学生填写完表格后，请检查每位学生的手册，并记录他们的进度。老师应在“其他（others）”栏记录使用的补充教材或指派的作业。",0],["h3","● Performance","● 学习表现",0],["p","Some specific items of learning contents are listed in this area for the teacher to check teaching points and for parents to know clearly what their kids have learned from the class. The teacher can note supplementary items used, or homework assigned, in the space marked \"Others.\" Put a tick in the squares for \"Excellent, \" \"Good\" or \"Try Harder,\" according to their performance. \"Excellent\" means students understand all the contents and are able to get use of them; \"Good\" means students can almost understand what they learned in class but not good at performing; \"Try Harder\" means students need more help with the lesson, and have their parents pay more attention to their kids.","这一栏列出一些具体的学习内容，让老师检查教学重点，也让家长清楚知道孩子在课堂上学到了什么。老师可以在“其他（Others）”栏记录使用的补充教材。依照学生的表现，在“Excellent（优秀）”、“Good（良好）”或“Try Harder（再加油）”的方格中打钩。“Excellent”表示学生了解所有内容并能运用；“Good”表示学生大致了解上课内容，但运用还不够熟练；“Try Harder”表示学生在这一课需要更多协助，也请家长多关心孩子。",0],["h3","● Teacher's and Parent's Comments","● 老师与家长意见",0],["p","This section is for the teacher and parents to communicate with each other. Also, the teacher may use this space for recording the date time, and content of make-up classes.","这一栏让老师和家长互相沟通。老师也可以在这里记录补课的日期、时间和内容。",0],["h3","● Quiz Grade","● 小测验成绩",0],["p","The teacher may write quiz grades in this space.","老师可以在这里写上小测验成绩。",0],["h3","● Evaluation Sheets","● 评估本",0],["p","There are in total three evaluation sheets, which should be completed in Class 8, Class 16, and Class 24 of the term. These evaluation sheets, which are for students to evaluate themselves, will help the parents to understand how much the children have learned from the English course and also about their participation in class. Before they start, explain the sheet as clearly as possible. After finishing the explanation, the students should check the appropriate space according to their perception of their performances. Example: Good Fair Try Harder","本学期共有三张评估表，分别在第 8 课、第 16 课和第 24 课填写。这些评估表是让学生自我评估用的，可以帮助家长了解孩子在英语课学到多少，以及上课的参与情况。开始前，请尽量清楚地说明表格内容。说明完后，学生依照自己对表现的感受，在适当的栏打钩。例如：好（Good）、普通（Fair）、再加油（Try Harder）",0],["h2","VCD/MP3",null,0],["p","The contents of S4 VCD/MP3 are:","S4 VCD/MP3 的内容包括：",0],["h3","Animation","动画",0],["li","● Classroom Reader 4",null,0],["li","● Classroom Activities 4A and 4B","● Classroom Activities 4A 和 4B",0],["h3","Sounds","音档",0],["li","● Classroom Readers 4",null,0],["li","● Classroom Activities 4A and 4B","● Classroom Activities 4A 和 4B",0],["li","● Homework Exercises 4A and 4B","● Homework Exercises 4A 和 4B",0],["li","● EEC Book 2 Lesson 7-Lesson 12 The teacher should introduce the new lesson or review the lesson that has been taught using the MP3. This will help the student to become familiar with different ways of learning. Also, please encourage the students to review or preview the lesson using the MP3 or Jordan's Website.","● EEC Book 2 Lesson 7–Lesson 12。老师应使用 MP3 介绍新课或复习已教过的课程，这能帮助学生熟悉不同的学习方式。也请鼓励学生用 MP3 或乔登网站复习或预习课程。",0],["h2","Evaluation Volume","评估本",0],["p","Review lessons will always precede test days. The reviews are designed to cover key grammar and communication points as well as vocabulary to be tested. Always follow the exercise with a game/ activity of your own that addresses the material you want to emphasize. Quizzes should be given after attendance taking. It is up to the teacher to decide whether or not the students will need a quick review before a quiz. If a student scores less than 85% on a test or quiz, he will be required to take it again after class.","测验日之前一定会有复习课。复习课的设计涵盖重要的语法和沟通重点，以及要考的单词。练习之后，一定要接着进行您自己设计、针对想强调内容的游戏／活动。小测验应在点名后进行。是否需要在小测验前快速复习，由老师决定。学生测验或小测验分数低于 85% 时，必须在下课后重考。",0],["h3","● Spelling Quiz","● 拼写小测验",0],["p","Give a spelling quiz covering the words taught in previous lessons during warm-ups. Have the students write the quiz words in their notebooks or Progress Report Books. Before the quiz, the teacher may review the vocabulary that the quiz will cover.","在热身时间针对之前教过的单词进行拼写小测验，请学生把小测验的单词写在笔记本或学习进度手册上。小测验前，老师可以先复习小测验范围的单词。",0],["h3","● Quiz","● 小测验",0],["p","There are three quizzes in this term. They occur in Class 6, Class 14, and Class 22. The quizzes prepare the students for the coming test. The students can find their mistakes from their own learning and have a chance to improve. And as well, the teachers can realize the weakest learning area of each student and strengthen it.","本学期共有三次小测验，分别在第 6 课、第 14 课和第 22 课。小测验是为之后的测验做准备。学生可以从中找出自己的错误，有机会进步；老师也能了解每位学生最弱的学习部分，并加强它。",0],["h3","● Listening Lab","● 听力练习（Listening Lab）",0],["p","There are three listening lab tests in this term, which always come on the formal quiz days in Class 6, Class 14, and Class","本学期共有三次听力测验，都在正式小测验日，也就是第 6 课、第 14 课和第",0],["li","22. It's a great chance to improve the students' listening comprehension by using the Listening Lab Tape. Please notice your students' reaction while taking this test. If they have difficulty understanding the questions, please play it again. Don't let your students feel frustrated and fail. Building their confidences is the most important mission.","22 课进行。这是运用听力练习录音带提升学生听力理解的好机会。测验时请留意学生的反应；如果他们听不懂题目，请再播放一次。不要让学生感到挫折或失败。建立他们的自信是最重要的任务。",0],["h3","● Test","● 测验",0],["p","There are in total three tests in this term. They are in Class 7, Class 15 and Class 23. The teacher can measure the students' achievement using the tests. This is one of the most important standards for students whether they can promote to the highest level or not. Record the students' responses as you give the oral test, and encourage them to speak up. You may also record some words of encouragement for them.","本学期共有三次测验，分别在第 7 课、第 15 课和第 23 课。老师可以用测验衡量学生的学习成果，这也是学生能否升上更高级别的最重要标准之一。进行口语测验时录下学生的回答，并鼓励他们勇敢大声说出来；也可以录一些鼓励的话给学生。",0]],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0},{"z":"教学技巧","t":"Teaching Skills","k":"text","p":[4,5],"b":[["h3","● Activity Sheet","● 活动单",0],["p","These are a good resource for teachers. Of course, students can play games or activities by using these sheets through group works, and practice what they have learned form today's lesson as well. Furthermore, parents can easily know about the students' performances in class.","活动单是老师很好的资源。学生可以通过分组合作，用活动单玩游戏或进行活动，同时练习当天学到的内容。此外，家长也能轻松了解孩子在课堂上的表现。",0],["h2","EEC Series","EEC 系列",0],["h2","Easy English Conversation: EEC",null,0],["p","Book 2 Easy English Conversation Book 2 Lesson 7- 12 Compact Disk Basically, there are six books in the EEC series. The idea of using the EEC series along with the S series is to enhance the students' speaking and listening abilities. Indeed, they are good and useful conversation books. Like EEC 1, EEC 2 is focused on teaching children a very basic level of English. For each lesson, there is a detailed explanation about how to teach dialogues, vocabulary, and activities in the Teacher's Manual. The daily dialogues are designed to teach mannerisms and speech in a western style according to the student's level. EEC Book Two also contains three sections: Let's See and","Book 2：Easy English Conversation Book 2 Lesson 7–12、CD。EEC 系列基本上共有六本，与 S 系列搭配使用的目的是加强学生的口语和听力能力，是非常好又实用的会话书。和 EEC 1 一样，EEC 2 着重于教孩子基础的英语。教师手册中每一课都详细说明如何教对话、单词和活动。日常对话依照学生的程度设计，用来教导西方的礼仪与说话方式。EEC Book Two 也包含三个部分：Let's See and",0],["h3","Say, Let's Check, and What Can I Do?","Say、Let's Check 和 What Can I Do?",0],["p","Each section has specific learning objectives.","每个部分都有特定的学习目标。",0],["h3","●Let's See And Say","● Let's See And Say",0],["p","This section contains a dialogue and a main picture.The teacher can explain the dialog with the help of the picture.","这个部分包含一段对话和一张主图，老师可以借由图片说明对话。",0],["h3","●Let's Check","● Let's Check",0],["p","This section contains listening comprehension and writing activities. They are designed to show what the students have learned from the unit. The listening comprehension exercises are for reviewing the dialogue and sequence of each unit.The writing exercises enhance the students' ability to learn vocabulary.","这个部分有听力理解和书写活动，目的是呈现学生在这个单元学到了什么。听力理解练习用来复习每个单元的对话和顺序；书写练习则加强学生学习单词的能力。",0],["h3","●What Can I Do?","● What Can I Do?",0],["p","This section is the student's self-evaluation. Before the end of the class,the teacher should have the students open their books and finish the evaluation. First read and explain each item. Then have the students check the appropriate space according to their perception of their performance. Also, they can explain the meaning of the list to their parents at home. Example: Good Fair Try Harder What Can I Do? (From Lesson 7) Try I CAN Good Fair Harder I can start a conversation I can ask \" Do you play baseball ?\" I can say what's cool I can be nice to my friends I can invite friends to join the team","这个部分是学生的自我评估。下课前，老师应请学生打开课本完成评估。先念出并解释每个项目，再请学生依照自己对表现的感受，在适当的栏打钩。学生回家后也可以向家长解释清单的意思。例如：好（Good）、普通（Fair）、再加油（Try Harder）。What Can I Do?（第 7 课）：I can start a conversation. / I can ask \"Do you play baseball?\" / I can say \"That's cool.\" / I can be nice to my friends. / I can invite friends to join the team.",0],["h2","Teaching Skills","教学技巧",0],["h3","● Storytelling","● 说故事",0],["p","Storytelling is a good way to get your students involved in learning. Especially when using the Classroom Readers, consider these suggestions:","说故事是让学生投入学习的好方法，特别是使用 Classroom Readers 时，可以参考以下建议：",0],["li","1. Introduce the story. Show the cover of the book and teach key words in the title of the story.","1. 介绍故事：展示书的封面，教故事标题中的关键字。",0],["li","2. Tell the story using mime and gesture. Since the students are low- level learners, they will understand more of the story from your gestures.","2. 用动作和手势说故事。学生程度还不高，通过您的手势能理解更多故事内容。",0],["li","3. A picture is worth a thousand words. Let the pictures help you tell the story. After the story, do some practice to help the students learn the sentence patterns, colors, numbers, nouns, actions or animals from the story book.","3. 一张图胜过千言万语，让图片帮您说故事。说完故事后做一些练习，帮助学生学会故事书中的句型、颜色、数字、名词、动作或动物。",0],["li","4. Using \"Finger Reading\" to lead students focus on the story and learning the words of the book.","4. 用“手指指读”引导学生专注在故事上，学习书中的单词。",0],["li","5. When you read or tell the story, always refer to the written text in the book.","5. 念或说故事时，一定要对照书中的文字。",0],["li","6. Read the story more than once. If you read the story then the children will always hear exactly the same text and this will help them to predict what is to come.","6. 故事要念不只一次。如果是照书念，孩子每次都会听到完全相同的文字，这能帮助他们预测接下来的内容。",0],["li","7. The teacher must be careful not to read too quickly. Written text is usually very precise, economical, and unrepeatable. That means that listening is a fairly demanding task.","7. 老师要注意不要念得太快。书面文字通常非常精确、精简、不重复，这表示聆听是相当吃力的任务。",0],["li","8. Storybooks can be about the contents that you want to teach in the semester. When students listen to the story, the material will also relate to the lessons of the textbook and it will help the students to understand.","8. 故事书的内容可以是您这学期想教的内容。学生听故事时，内容也和课本的课程相关，能帮助学生理解。",0],["h3","● Spelling","● 拼写",0],["p","As they continue to learn phonics, the students will spell and pronounce English words more easily. Sometimes they can spell the words phonetically then pronounce them but have no idea about the meaning. Teachers don't have to care about how many words the students have remembered or understood, but teachers have to care that their students can spell the words by listening or try to pronounce the words that they haven't learned before. A good method to use is to follow these procedures EACH time a new word is introduced:","随着继续学习自然拼读，学生拼写和念英文单词会越来越容易。有时学生能用发音拼出单词并念出来，却不知道意思。老师不必在意学生记住或理解了多少单词，但要在意学生能不能听音拼写，或试着念出没学过的单词。一个好方法是：“每次”介绍新单词时，都依照以下步骤进行：",0],["li","1. Say the word and spell it, with the students repeating. Do this several times.","1. 念出单词并拼出来，让学生跟着复诵。重复几次。",0],["li","2. Write the word on the board. Introduce it phonetically, especially for the vowels. Point to a student to say the first letter. Point to another student to say the next letter. Point to students randomly. Keep them on their toes. Spell out the word like this, then start over again. Keep going until everyone has said a letter. This should be done very fast almost as if you are spelling the word yourself. Point to the student rather than calling them by name. It is faster and you aren't interrupting the spelling.","2. 把单词写在黑板上，用自然拼读介绍它。指一位学生说出第一个字母，再指另一位学生说下一个字母。随机指学生，不要照座位顺序，让大家随时保持专注。用这种方式拼完整个字，再从头开始，直到每个人都说过一个字母。速度要非常快，就像您自己在拼写一样。用手指学生而不是叫名字，这样比较快，也不会打断拼写。",0],["h3","● Eclectic Teaching For S4","● S4 综合教学法",0],["li","1. T.P.R. (Total Physical Response) TPR will be used often in S4. The teacher should think of specific and easily-remembered actions for each verb to help the students remember the verb.","1. T.P.R.（全肢体反应教学法）：S4 会经常使用 TPR。老师应为每个动词想出具体、容易记住的动作，帮助学生记住动词。",0],["li","2. V.A.C. (Visual Aids Concept) A good way to help students understand English is to use pictures and objects. These items will heighten students' interest in learning. For preparing those materials, the teacher can have the students bring them to school; this is not only convenient for teachers but also can have students be more involved in learning English. Teachers can also use our website. It will spark the students' learning interest as well.","2. V.A.C.（视觉辅助概念）：帮助学生理解英语的好方法是使用图片和实物，这些东西能提高学生的学习兴趣。准备这些教材时，老师可以请学生把东西带到学校，这不但对老师方便，也能让学生更投入英语学习。老师也可以使用我们的网站，同样能激发学生的学习兴趣。",0],["h3","3. Repetition","3. 重复练习",0],["p","Using dice for this drill will be a lot of fun. The teacher rolls the dice and has the student say the word the number of times that the dice show.","用骰子进行这个练习会很有趣。老师掷骰子，骰子显示几点，学生就把单词说几次。",0],["d","noodles","T",0],["d","noodles T (Rolls the dice): Number 5","Ss",0],["d","noodles, noodles, noodles, noodles, noodles","Ss",0],["h3","4. Chain Drill","4. 接龙练习",0],["p","Have the students practice sentence patterns in turns while passing the flashcards.","让学生传单词卡，轮流练习句型。",0],["d","Are they playing?","T",0],["d","Yes, they are. They are playing.","Ss",0],["d","Are they playing?","S1",0],["d","Yes, they are. They are playing.","S2",0],["d","Are they playing?","S3",0],["h3","5. Ball Drill","5. 传球练习",0],["p","The teacher throws the ball to the students and plays music. The students pass the ball to the music. Once the music stops, everyone has to stop passing the ball and look at the teacher. The teacher shows a flashcard or points to the monitor. The student with the ball in his hand must say the sentence. This activity can also be done with two balls. Have two teams compete; it's more exciting.","老师把球丢给学生并播放音乐，学生随着音乐传球。音乐一停，大家都要停止传球并看着老师。老师展示一张单词卡或指着屏幕，拿着球的学生必须说出句子。这个活动也可以用两颗球进行，让两队比赛会更刺激。",0],["h3","6. Chart Drill","6. 图表练习",0],["p","eating drinking playing Jenny",null,0],["li","● Sophia John Use a sticky ball. Have a student throw it at any square, and then make a sentence according to the square.","● 给学生一颗黏黏球，请一位学生把球丢到任一格，再依照那一格的内容造句。",0],["d","What is Jenny doing?","T",0],["d","She is drinking.","S",0],["h3","7. Substitution Drill","7. 替换练习",0],["p","Write a sentence pattern on the board. For example: These are . T (show one of the flashcards: shirts, and have Ss finish the sentence)","在黑板上写一个句型，例如：These are ___. T（展示一张单词卡：shirts，请学生完成句子）",0],["d","They are shirts.","Ss",0],["h3","8. Role Play","8. 角色扮演",0],["p","Divide the students into many groups and have them practice the dialogue or conversation. Classroom Activities Lesson 13 \"Peter's Family\" is a suitable topic for role-play.","- 把学生分成许多组练习对话。Classroom Activities 第 13 课“Peter's Family”很适合做角色扮演。",0],["li","9. Cloze Eliminate some key words from the sentences and have the students fill in the blanks. Cloze is often used to practice the verb \"to be.\" (For example: I Am, He is, You are).","9. 克漏字：把句子中的一些关键字去掉，请学生填空。克漏字常用来练习 be 动词（例如：I am、He is、You are）。",0],["h3","10. Question & Answer","10. 问与答",0],["p","You can do a bit of Question & Answer at the beginning of each class for 5-10 minutes. You may also ask students some questions while using the Classroom Readers. Try to be a storyteller, and have the students enjoy your story. After the story, ask them some questions to make sure they understand.","每堂课开始时可以进行 5–10 分钟的问与答。使用 Classroom Readers 时也可以问学生一些问题。试着当一位说故事的人，让学生享受您的故事；讲完故事后问学生一些问题，确认他们都懂了。",0],["li","11. Matching Classroom Activities Lesson 11 is just right to practice Matching. After talking about the characters, the teacher can choose one of the characters, and have the students make sentences about the character's facial features, etc, For example:","11. 配对：Classroom Activities 第 11 课很适合练习配对。谈完角色后，老师可以选一个角色，请学生描述这个角色的五官等特征并造句。例如：",0],["d","Mike Monkey.","T",0],["d","Mike Monkey's eyes are blue.","Ss",0],["h3","12. Expansion Drill","12. 扩展练习",0],["p","This is an effective way to practice English. The students will learn about food items in this level. The teacher can let the students come up with many foods according to a topic. For example:","这是练习英语的有效方法。学生在这一级会学到食物，老师可以请学生依照主题想出很多食物。例如：",0],["d","Let's think of some words that are related to fast food.","T",0],["d","sandwich, hamburger, apple pie....","Ss",0],["p","The teacher can find some related resources in Jordan's website.","老师可以在乔登网站上找到一些相关资源。",0]],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0},{"z":"班级管理","t":"Classroom Management","k":"text","p":[6,7],"b":[["h3","13. Transformation","13. 句型转换",0],["p","This drill is good for practicing tenses. Since the students have learned the present tense and the present continuous tense, the teacher can say a sentence and have the students change the tense.","这个练习很适合练习时态。学生已经学过现在时和现在进行时，老师可以说一个句子，请学生改变它的时态。",0],["d","I am playing in the park.","T",0],["d","You play in the park.","S",0],["h3","14. Situational Practice","14. 情境练习",0],["p","Create different kinds of situations depending on the contents of the lessons to help students understand the meaning of English exactly and also enjoy learning English.","依照课程内容设计各种情境，帮助学生确实了解英语的意思，也享受学英语的乐趣。",0],["h3","● Digital Teaching: www.jordan.com.tw","● 数字教学：www.jordan.com.tw",0],["p","All the contents of S4 are on Jordan's Website. They include Classroom Readers, Classroom Activities, Homework Exercises, and EEC Book 2. Students will have a lot of fun learning English while watching and working with the animated pictures on this web site. Please encourage the students to practice English with the MP3 in class as well as at home. Preview, Assist, and Review are three important aspects of digital teaching. It is a high-technology multimedia, but it is easy to use.","S4 的所有内容都在乔登网站上，包括 Classroom Readers、Classroom Activities、Homework Exercises 和 EEC Book 2。学生通过观看网站上的动画并和它们互动，能非常愉快地学英语。请鼓励学生在课堂上和在家用 MP3 练习英语。预习、辅助、复习是数字教学的三大重点。这是高科技的多媒体教材，但使用很简单。",0],["h3","● How to visit Jordan's WebSite","● 如何使用乔登网站",0],["p","www.jordan.com.tw ▼ 乔登美语教学网 ▼","www.jordan.com.tw ▼ 乔登美语教学网 ▼",0],["h3","e-Learning",null,0],["p","▼ e-Learning白金会员 ▼","▼ e-Learning 白金会员 ▼",0],["h3","Enter the password","输入密码",0],["p","▼ Big Kid大儿童学习区 ▼ Lesson IV儿童进阶 ▼","▼ 大儿童学习区 Big Kid ▼ 儿童进阶 Lesson IV ▼",0],["h3","S4",null,0],["h2","Classroom Language","课堂用语",0],["p","It's best for the students if the teachers can speak as much English as possible. Repetition is the key to improving the students' English. Here are some basics that everybody should know:","老师尽量多说英语，对学生最好。重复是提升学生英语能力的关键。以下是每个人都应该知道的一些基本用语：",0],["p","English please. One more time Stand up Please put away your____. Please sit down. Please go to. Please raise your hand. Please pay attention! Listen carefully.",null,0],["h2","Discipline","秩序管理",0],["p","A class with discipline will make your teaching much easier. It is the key to teaching effectively. Teachers must know how to control the students and not let them take over a class. Rewards and punishments are the easiest way to control a class. Compliment the students when they do something good, but also punish them when they do something bad. Know when to push them, and when to go easy on them. But remember that they are kids. Try to keep it light and fun.","有纪律的班级会让教学轻松很多，这是有效教学的关键。老师必须知道如何掌控学生，不能让学生主导课堂。奖励和处罚是管理班级最简单的方法：学生表现好时称赞他们，表现不好时也要处罚。知道什么时候该推他们一把，什么时候该放松一点。但请记住他们还是孩子，尽量保持轻松有趣。",0],["h2","A Reminder to the teachers","给老师的提醒",0],["p","Patience is a virtue! Don't lose yours. If you do, things may definitely take a turn for the worse. When you don't understand why some students do things that bother you, try to think like a kid. It may give you some fresh insight into their behavior.","耐心是一种美德！不要失去耐心，否则情况一定会变得更糟。当您不明白为什么有些学生会做出让您困扰的事时，试着用孩子的角度思考，可能会让您对他们的行为有新的理解。",0],["h2","New Students in Your Class","班上的新同学",0],["p","There will always be new students transferring into your class. No matter where they are from, try to help them adapt. Here are some tips:","班上总会有转进来的新同学。不论他们来自哪里，都要尽量帮助他们适应。以下是一些建议：",0],["p","Introduce them to the class Help them make up the lessons until they can catch up with the others. Pay attention to their learning attitude and help them solve problems immediately.","向全班介绍新同学；帮助他们补课，直到跟上全班进度；留意他们的学习态度，并立即协助解决问题。",0],["h3","●Homework And Grading","● 作业与评分",0],["p","Establish from the first day of class that students need to turn in homework in a timely fashion. You must let students know you want their homework EVERY time the class meets. The homework helps to reinforce key lesson concepts and without completing it prior to the next class the student may begin to fall behind. Be very firm about making sure they turn it in on time! Correct the homework exercises carefully, This is a very important process for the very beginner. Be strict! That will help them in cultivating a good habit to write clearly and neatly.","从第一天上课就要让学生知道，作业必须准时缴交。您要让学生知道，“每次”上课都要交作业。作业能帮助巩固课程的重要观念，如果下次上课前没有完成，学生可能会开始落后。务必坚持要求准时交作业！仔细批改作业，这对初学者是非常重要的过程。要严格！这能帮助他们养成书写清楚整齐的好习惯。",0],["h3","To help beginners do homework successfully, here are","以下是帮助初学者顺利完成作业的",0],["h3","some tips","一些秘诀：",0],["p","1.Make full use of the Reinforcement section of the lesson plan for each class. Have the students open the Homework Exercises book to preview all the items in today's lesson. 2.Help them understand today's Homework Exercises. Ask them to practice some exercises to make sure they understand. Grading of homework and tests should be consistent between the FT and the CT. A good rule of thumb to follow when grading homework is to subtract two points for a missing or incorrect word and one point for a missing or incorrect letter. If you are using letter grades (A, B, C, etc.) convert the number total to a letter grade as follows:","1. 充分利用每堂课教案中的“Reinforcement（加强复习）”部分，请学生打开 Homework Exercises，预习今天课程的所有题目。2. 帮助学生了解今天的 Homework Exercises，并请他们先练习几题，确认他们都懂了。外籍老师（FT）和中籍老师（CT）批改作业和测验的标准要一致。批改作业有个好用的原则：漏写或写错一个字扣两分，漏写或写错一个字母扣一分。如果您用等第（A、B、C 等），请依照以下方式把分数换算成等第：",0],["p","90-100 A 70-80 C 80-90 B 60-70 D",null,0],["h2","Telephone Teaching","电话教学",0],["p","As teachers, we are not only concerned with students' achievements in class, but also concerned with their study habits while they are at home. Therefore, we've designed Ttelephone teaching material (TTM) to help students review English at home by answering some questions on the phone and let the parents know about their kids' ability in speaking English. The teacher should:","身为老师，我们不只关心学生在课堂上的表现，也关心他们在家的学习习惯。因此我们设计了电话教学教材（TTM），让学生在电话中回答问题，在家复习英语，也让家长了解孩子的英语口语能力。老师应该：",0],["p","Give each student a letter grade (A-B-C-D) Write comments in the Teacher's Handbook Give them reward cards according to their performance during the following class. So that they do well on telephone teaching, have the students study the questions in class. When you call them at home, give them 2 or 3 attempts to answer each question. Be sure to greet the students at the beginning of the conversation and give the students some encouragement after they answer each question. Procedure:","给每位学生一个等第（A-B-C-D）；在教师手册中写下评语；下次上课时依照表现发奖励卡。为了让学生在电话教学中表现好，请在课堂上先让学生准备这些问题。打电话到学生家时，每题给学生 2 到 3 次回答机会。对话开始时一定要先问候学生，学生每回答一题后也要给予鼓励。步骤：",0],["p","1.Greetings: Say hello to the students and to their family. Let them know you want to talk to the student.","1. 问候：向学生或家人问好，让他们知道您想跟学生说话。",0],["h3","Suggestions","建议用语",0],["li","(1) Good afternoon, good evening.",null,0],["li","(2) Hello! (Student's name), this is (teacher's name). How are you today? 90-100 A 70-80 C 80-90 B 60-70 D","(2) Hello! (Student's name), this is (teacher's name). How are you today?　评分：90–100 A、80–90 B、70–80 C、60–70 D",0],["h3","2. Questions and Answers","2. 问与答",0],["p","Try to encourage the students to answer with complete sentences.","尽量鼓励学生用完整的句子回答。",0],["h3","Suggestions","建议用语",0],["li","(1) I know you knew that, try again!",null,0],["li","(2) Good! Very good! You did a good job! Wonderful! Very nice! Good boy! Good girl!",null,0],["li","3. Ending:","3. 结尾：",0],["p","Continue to encourage the students again and remind them of something if needed:","再次鼓励学生，需要的话提醒他们一些事情：",0],["h3","Suggestions","建议用语",0],["li","(1) You are very good. Please finish your homework.",null,0],["li","(2) Don't forget to let your parent sign the \"Progress Report Book.\"",null,0],["li","(3) You are a good boy/girl. Did you prepare for the quiz/test next class?",null,0],["li","(4) You always do a great job! Is your daddy or mommy home? Please ask him/her to come to the phone, thank you.",null,0]],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0},{"z":"课程大纲","t":"Syllabus","k":"img","p":[8],"b":[],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0},{"z":"学习目标","t":"Learning Goals","k":"text","p":[9],"b":[["h2","Learning Goals","学习目标",0],["h2","A) Grammar Goals","A) 语法目标",0],["li","1. Able to make sentences using the possessive, adjectives, positive sentences, questions, and negative sentences.","1. 能用所有格、形容词造肯定句、问句和否定句。",0],["li","2. Able to use \"where\" + \"doing to\" to ask and answer questions.","2. 能用 \"where\" ＋ \"going to\" 问答。",0],["li","3. Able to use \"what\" + \"doing\" to ask and answer questions.","3. 能用 \"what\" ＋ \"doing\" 问答。",0],["li","4. Able to recognize \"this/ that\" and \"these/ those\" and use positive sentences.","4. 能认识 \"this/that\" 和 \"these/those\"，并用在肯定句中。",0],["li","5. Able to use \"There is/ are\" for questions, positive sentences and negative sentences.","5. 能用 \"There is/are\" 造问句、肯定句和否定句。",0],["li","6. Able to use \"who\" + present continuous to ask and answer questions.","6. 能用 \"who\" ＋现在进行时问答。",0],["li","7. Able to use \"behind,\" \"in front of\" and \"between\".","7. 能使用 \"behind\"、\"in front of\" 和 \"between\"。",0],["li","8. Able to use \"How much\" to ask and answer the questions.","8. 能用 \"How much\" 问答。",0],["li","9. Able to use the imperative \"Please\" and \"Don't\".","9. 能使用祈使句 \"Please\" 和 \"Don't\"。",0],["h2","B) Communicative Goals","B) 沟通目标",0],["li","1. Able to use adjectives to describe body parts.","1. 能用形容词描述身体部位。",0],["li","2. Able to use place names or explanation.","2. 能使用地名或加以说明。",0],["li","3. Able to describe the actions that one does in the morning.","3. 能描述早上会做的动作。",0],["li","4. Able to use colors to describe singular and plural nouns.","4. 能用颜色描述单数和复数名词。",0],["li","5. Able to recognize and use countable and uncountable nouns.","5. 能认识并使用可数和不可数名词。",0],["li","6. Able to use the names of different foods and drinks.","6. 能说出各种食物和饮料的名称。",0],["li","7. Able to say the names of different fruits.","7. 能说出各种水果的名称。",0],["li","8. Able to use many prepositions.","8. 能使用许多介词。",0],["li","9. Able to say the numbers from 11-60. 10.Able to ask the prices of goods. 11.Able to say 20 new verb phrases.","9. 能说出 11–60 的数字。10. 能询问商品的价格。11. 能说出 20 个新的动词短语。",0],["h2","C) Vocabulary Goals","C) 单词目标",0],["p","Class 1: wave, feet, teeth, sharp Class 3: church, handsome, bicycle, come, movie(s), post office, supermarket, shop Class 4: do, fall down, wash, brush, take a shower, isn't. Class 5: walk, market, hold, box, color, help, purple, orange, pink Class 9: comic, English Class 10: there, stone, water, really, cake, soda, juice, ice cream, candy Class 11: how, today, fine, guava, grape(s), watermelon, pineapple Class 12: sell, fruit, bread, lemonade, cookies, doughnut(s) Class 17: twelve, thirteen, fourteen, fifteen, sixteen, eighteen, nineteen, give Class 18: dollar(s), again, twenty, thirty, forty, fifty, dollar Class 19: laugh, stand up, sit down, pick up, close, spell, word Class 20: swim, mud, can, can't, cymbals, trumpet, guitar","第 1 课：wave, feet, teeth, sharp　第 3 课：church, handsome, bicycle, come, movie(s), post office, supermarket, shop　第 4 课：do, fall down, wash, brush, take a shower, isn't　第 5 课：walk, market, hold, box, color, help, purple, orange, pink　第 9 课：comic, English　第 10 课：there, stone, water, really, cake, soda, juice, ice cream, candy　第 11 课：how, today, fine, guava, grape(s), watermelon, pineapple　第 12 课：sell, fruit, bread, lemonade, cookies, doughnut(s)　第 17 课：twelve, thirteen, fourteen, fifteen, sixteen, eighteen, nineteen, give　第 18 课：dollar(s), again, twenty, thirty, forty, fifty, dollar　第 19 课：laugh, stand up, sit down, pick up, close, spell, word　第 20 课：swim, mud, can, can't, cymbals, trumpet, guitar",0]],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0},{"z":"第 1 课","t":"Class 1","k":"class","p":[10,11,12,13],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["li","- To correctly use possessive pronouns","- 能正确使用所有格代词",1],["li","- To describe physical features using adjectives","- 能用形容词描述外貌特征",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","Flashcards, sticky ball, digital equipment","单词卡、黏黏球、数字教学设备",1],["h3","Classroom Activities 2A Lesson 1","Classroom Activities 2A 第 1 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Review names of body parts & different adjectives","复习身体部位名称和各种形容词",1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","Review several sentence patterns","复习几个句型",1],["h3","Phonics","自然拼读",1],["p","Long vowels \"A\", \"I\", and \"O\" Classroom Reader Lesson 1 New Words Foot, feet, tooth, teeth, sharp, wave, waving","长元音“A”“I”“O”。Classroom Reader 第 1 课新单词：foot, feet, tooth, teeth, sharp, wave, waving",1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","Review several sentence patterns","复习几个句型",1],["h3","EEC 2 Lesson 7","EEC 2 第 7 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","Mustard, olive oil, mayonnaise, ketchup, pepper, salt",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["p","See And Say",null,1],["d","This is delicious!","A",1],["d","Don't do that, Mike!","B",1],["d","But my napkin is wet","A",1],["d","Use your napkin, please","B",1],["d","Uh - Oh....like this?","A",1],["d","Yes. That is good table manners.","B",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["li","(1) If this is a new class, take some time to get to know all the students. Ask them to stand in front of the class and introduce themselves.","(1) 如果是新班级，花点时间认识所有学生，请他们站到全班面前自我介绍。",0],["li","(2) Review some key grammar points from level 3, as well as the vocabulary.","(2) 复习第 3 级的一些重要语法和单词。",0],["li","(3) You may give a small pop quiz to see how much they remember from the last level.","(3) 可以进行一个小小的突击测验，看看学生还记得多少上一级的内容。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (55 mins) Lesson 1: My Nose is Big","Classroom Activities（55 mins）第 1 课 My Nose Is Big 我的鼻子很大",0],["h2","1.1",null,0],["li","(1) Display the vocabulary using the touchscreen all-in-one and ask the students to listen carefully.","(1) 用触控一体机展示单词，请学生仔细听。",0],["li","(2) Ask the students to repeat the vocabulary.","(2) 请学生复诵单词。",0],["li","(3) Draw pictures on the board or use the Body Parts flashcards. Practice the sentence pattern without looking at the monitor or the book.","(3) 在黑板上画图或使用身体部位单词卡，不看屏幕或课本练习句型。",0],["li","(4) Divide the class into 3 or 4 teams depending on the size of your class (it is more competitive for students to play games with more than 2 teams). Also remind them they will be on the same team for the entire class. (This should help them learn to work as a team).","(4) 依班级人数把全班分成 3 或 4 队（超过 2 队玩游戏比较有竞争感），并提醒学生整堂课都在同一队，这能帮助他们学会团队合作。",0],["li","(5) Vocabulary Game - Each student must choose a picture or flashcard and describe it as in the exercise. When they say it correctly, they may throw the sticky ball to the corre sponding picture or flashcard. If the target is hit, then points may be given to the team. Each team takes turns for a few rounds.","(5) 单词游戏：每位学生选一张图片或单词卡，照练习的方式描述它，说对后可以把黏黏球丢向对应的图片或单词卡，丢中就为队伍得分。各队轮流进行几轮。",0],["h2","1.2",null,0],["li","(1) Follow the same steps as in 1.1 to introduce and practice the sentence patterns.","(1) 依照 1.1 的步骤介绍并练习句型。",0],["h2","1.3",null,0],["li","(1) Display the examples using the monitor. Practice one question with the students to make sure they understand the sentence structure.","(1) 用屏幕展示例句，和学生一起练习一题，确认他们了解句子结构。",0],["li","(2) With the same teams from previous exercises ask them to have a race to see which team can finish the rest of the questions first without a mistake. Points may be given to the teams in the order that they finish.","(2) 用之前练习的同样分队，请各队比赛看哪一队能最先全部答对其余的题目，依完成顺序给分。",0],["li","(3) Show the answers using the monitor and ask the students to repeat after you. (3A) Activity Sheet 1:","(3) 用屏幕展示答案，请学生跟着您复诵。(3A) 活动单 1：",0],["p","Pass out Activity Sheet 1. Have the students draw pictures and write sentences about their friends and family. Put the students into groups or pairs, and have them ask and answer questions about the pictures and sentences.","发下活动单 1，请学生画出朋友和家人并写句子，再把学生分组或两两一组，针对图片和句子互相问答。",0],["li","(4) Acting Game - Each team has to think of some sentences to act out for the other team.","(4) 表演游戏：每队想一些句子演给其他队看。",0],["d","(Pointing to himself saying that his eyes are brown).","Team A",0],["p","Team B or C: These are Kevin's eyes. His eyes are brown. or He is Kevin. His eyes are brown. Kevin's eyes are brown. Each team takes turn to act and answer, but points are only given to the teams that answer correctly.","B 队或 C 队：These are Kevin's eyes. His eyes are brown. 或 He is Kevin. His eyes are brown. Kevin's eyes are brown. 各队轮流表演和回答，只有答对的队伍才能得分。",0],["h2","1.4",null,0],["li","(1) Play the sounds on the touchscreen all-in-one and ask the students to listen carefully. Ask if they can tell the difference between long vowels.","(1) 用触控一体机播放发音，请学生仔细听，问他们能不能分辨长元音的差别。",0],["li","(2) Practice pronunciation. It will be better if you can come up with more words to let the students practice.","(2) 练习发音。如果能想出更多单词让学生练习会更好。",0],["li","(1) Play the sounds on the touchscreen all-in-one and ask them to fill out the long vowels.","(1) 用触控一体机播放发音，请学生填入长元音。",0],["li","(2) Use the touchscreen all-in-one to display the answers and practice pronouncing every word with the students.","(2) 用触控一体机展示答案，和学生一起练习念每个字。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (20 mins)","Classroom Readers（20 mins）",0],["h2","Lesson 1: Meeting Randy and Lily","第 1 课 Meeting Randy and Lily 认识 Randy 和 Lily",0],["li","(1) Use the monitor to introduce the characters in the book.","(1) 用屏幕介绍书中的角色。",0],["li","(2) Click on the snail to let it introduce the story.","(2) 点击蜗牛，让它介绍故事。",0],["li","(3) Use the monitor to introduce the new words. Ask the students to repeat.","(3) 用屏幕介绍新单词，请学生复诵。",0],["li","(4) First play the entire story using the touchscreen all-in-one and ask the students to listen. Play it a second time, but this time stop after every sentence and ask the students to practice the sentence.","(4) 先用触控一体机播放整个故事让学生听；播放第二次时，每句停下来请学生练习。",0],["li","(5) Use the translation on the touchscreen all-in-one to explain the sentence structure.","(5) 用触控一体机上的翻译说明句子结构。",0],["li","(6) Ask each team to read the lesson together. Points may be given to the team that reads the best.","(6) 请每队一起朗读这一课，念得最好的队伍可以得分。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Motivation","导入（Motivation）",0],["p","This is the time to warm the class up by providing the students with a general picture of the lesson that they are going to learn today. Make sure all the students have a general idea about today's lesson before going to the next part of Let's See And Say. Let's See And Say","这是让全班热身的时间，让学生对今天要学的课程有整体的概念。进入“Let's See & Say”之前，请确认所有学生对今天的课程都有大致的了解。Let's See And Say：",0],["li","Step 1:","步骤 1：",0],["p","Introduction:","引导：",0],["p","The teacher introduces the lesson by having the students listen to the monolog.You can either read the monolog, or use the MP3. Let's See And Say: Monolog Table manners are important for us to know. Do you know what table manners are? Let's learn with Mike.","老师让学生听独白介绍本课，可以自己念，或使用 MP3。Let's See And Say 独白：Table manners are important for us to know. Do you know what table manners are? Let's learn with Mike.",0],["li","Step 2:","步骤 2：",0],["p","Have the class guess and predict about the theme and the words that relate to this lesson based on the monolog that they have listened to. Encourage the students to use their imagination and give them a chance to share their ideas. Write the students' ideas on the board and add the points you also want to emphasize. Then play the dialog to the class for the first time.","请全班根据刚听到的独白，猜测并预测与本课相关的主题和单词。鼓励学生发挥想象力，并给他们机会分享自己的想法。把学生的想法写在黑板上，并补充您想在本课强调的重点。接着第一次播放对话。",0],["li","Step 3:","步骤 3：",0],["p","Continue to play the dialog to the class for the second time and have the students repeat after the narrator. Remind the students to listen carefully to the narrator's pronunciation and intonation while practicing each sentence of the dialogue. The teacher also needs to listen carefully to the students' pronunciation and intonation and give help if necessary.","第二次播放对话，请学生跟着录音复诵。提醒学生练习每一句对话时，仔细听录音的发音和语调。老师也要仔细听学生的发音和语调，必要时给予协助。",0],["li","Step 4:","步骤 4：",0],["p","Introduce the theme of the lesson to the class again by combining the dialog that the students have practiced and the core vocabulary of this lesson. (The teacher can play or read the dialogue to the class again if necessary.) Make sure all the students are familiar with the dialogue and vocabulary and able to do the conversation with each other. At this stage, the teacher may also tell the students about real-life situations where they can apply this type of conversation.","结合学生刚练习过的对话和本课的核心单词，再次向全班介绍本课主题。（必要时老师可以再播放或念一次对话。）确认所有学生都熟悉对话和单词，并能互相进行对话。这个阶段老师也应该告诉学生，在现实生活中有哪些情境可以用到这类对话。",0],["li","Step 5:","步骤 5：",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group practice the conversation for a comprehension check.","让学生两两一组，各组练习对话，检查理解程度。",0],["li","Step 6:","步骤 6：",0],["p","Remind the students to review the lesson at home by listening to the MP3 and encourage them to practice the dialog with their family or friends before coming to the next class.","提醒学生回家听 MP3 复习本课，并鼓励他们在下次上课前和家人或朋友练习对话。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["p","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review today's lesson using the books.","(1) 用课本复习今天的课程。",0],["li","(2) Review today's lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。",0],["h3","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Write a few examples on the board so that they understand.","利用这段时间预习作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生了解。",0],["h3","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have the students write them down in their Progress Report Books.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually. Write some comments or encouragement. This is a good time to give the students reward cards according to their team's performance.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，写一些评语或鼓励。这是依照各队表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","(3) Remind the students to bring some photos of their relatives for the next class, especially grandparents, parents, uncle, aunt, etc.","(3) 提醒学生下次上课带一些亲戚的照片，特别是祖父母、父母、叔叔阿姨等。",0]],"g":[[31,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 4","Classroom Activities","Lesson 1","Part 1","1.1 Vocabulary"]],[37,["Part 2","1.2","Part 3","1.3","Part 4","1.4","Part 5","1.5"]],[53,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 4","Classroom Readers","Lesson 1","Cast","Talking","New Words","Learning & Playing","Translation"]],[76,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["My Nose is Big","Meeting Randy and Lily"],"bd":"","m":110},{"z":"第 2 课","t":"Class 2","k":"class","p":[14,15,16,17],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["li","- To understand and be able to use possessive pronouns","- 了解并能使用所有格代词",1],["li","- To know a person's family tree","- 认识一个人的家族树",1],["li","- To ask and answer questions with \"who\" and \"where\"","- 能用 \"who\" 和 \"where\" 问答",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","Flashcards, photos of relatives, digital equipment","单词卡、亲戚照片、数字教学设备",1],["h3","Classroom Activities 4A Lesson 2","Classroom Activities 4A 第 2 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","Possessive pronouns: his / her / my / your / our / their, names of family members, prepositions:near/behind/beside /in front of.","所有格代词：his/her/my/your/our/their；家庭成员名称；介词：near/behind/beside/in front of",1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","Ask and answer questions using \"who\" and \"where\"","用 \"who\" 和 \"where\" 问答",1],["h3","Phonics","自然拼读",1],["p","Review the long vowels \"A\" and \"O\" \"y,\" long \"I,\" \"nk\" and \"ng\"","复习长元音“A”“O”、“y”、长元音“I”、“nk”和“ng”",1],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson 2","Classroom Readers 第 2 课",1],["p","New Words Talk, talking, where, walk, walking","新单词：talk, talking, where, walk, walking",1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","Present continuous","现在进行时",1],["h3","EEC 2 Lesson 7","EEC 2 第 7 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","Mustard, olive oil, mayonnaise, ketchup, pepper, salt See It and Say It: Dialogue","mustard, olive oil, mayonnaise, ketchup, pepper, salt。See It and Say It：对话",1],["d","This is delicious!","A",1],["d","Don't do that, Mike!","B",1],["d","But my napkin is wet","A",1],["d","Use your napkin, please","B",1],["d","Uh - Oh....like this?","A",1],["d","Yes. That is good table manners.","B",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["li","(1) Review the last class using the digital equipment. Have the students look at the touchscreen all-in-one and repeat the sentences.","(1) 用数字教学设备复习上一堂课，请学生看触控一体机并复诵句子。",0],["li","(2) Review the vocabulary from the last class.","(2) 复习上一堂课的单词。",0],["li","(3) Spelling quiz.","(3) 拼写小测验。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (55 mins) Lesson 2: Family Tree","Classroom Activities（55 mins）第 2 课 Family Tree 家族树",0],["h2","2.1",null,0],["li","(1) First review the pronouns with the students, then display them on the monitor.","(1) 先和学生复习代词，再在屏幕上展示。",0],["li","(2) Listen to the touchscreen all-in-one and let the students fill in the blanks on their own.","(2) 听触控一体机，让学生自己填空。",0],["li","(3) Go over the answers on the touchscreen all-in-one and ask the students to repeat after the touchscreen all-in-one.","(3) 在触控一体机上核对答案，请学生跟着触控一体机复诵。",0],["li","(4) Explain how to use pronouns to make sure the students fully understand.","(4) 说明代词的用法，确认学生完全理解。",0],["h2","2.2",null,0],["li","(1) Ask the students to take out the photos they've brought to class. Use magnets to put up some photos on the board and try to create a family tree using a student's photos.","(1) 请学生拿出带来的照片，用磁铁把一些照片贴在黑板上，试着用一位学生的照片建立家族树。",0],["li","(2) Use the touchscreen all-in-one to display all the names in a family. Then, together with the students, fill in the names of the family tree you have created for the students.","(2) 用触控一体机展示家族中所有成员的称呼，再和学生一起把名称填入您建立的家族树。",0],["li","(3) Also practice possessive pronouns using the family tree. Example: He is a grandfather. He is your grandfather.","(3) 也用家族树练习所有格代词。例如：He is a grandfather. He is your grandfather.",0],["h2","2.3",null,0],["li","(1) Use the touchscreen all-in-one to practice asking and answering using \"who\" and \"where\" questions. Display the questions on the monitor by clicking \"A\" and randomly select questions for students to answer. Ask them to click \"B\" for the answer. If answered correctly, give a reward card.","(1) 用触控一体机练习用 \"who\" 和 \"where\" 问答。点击“A”在屏幕上显示问题，随机选题请学生回答，再请他们点击“B”看答案，答对就给一张奖励卡。",0],["li","(2) Try to let everyone have a chance to come up and practice asking and answering questions. When they seem to understand, ask the students to write down the answer according to what they have just practiced.","(2) 尽量让每个人都有机会上台练习问答。学生似乎懂了之后，请他们依照刚练习的内容写下答案。",0],["li","(3) Go over all the questions together to make sure everyone understands.","(3) 一起把所有题目核对一遍，确认每个人都懂了。",0],["h2","2.4 A",null,0],["li","(1) Review the long vowels sounds.","(1) 复习长元音的音。",0],["li","(2) Ask the students to come up and use the touchscreen all-in-one for this exercise.","(2) 请学生上台用触控一体机做这个练习。",0],["li","(3) Read every word out loud and ask the students to circle the correct spelling.","(3) 大声念出每个字，请学生圈出正确的拼法。",0],["li","(4) Go over the answer with the students.","(4) 和学生一起核对答案。",0],["h2","2.4 B",null,0],["li","(1) Follow the same steps as in 2.4 A","(1) 依照 2.4 A 的步骤进行。",0],["h2","2.4 C",null,0],["li","(1) Follow the same steps as in 2.4 A","(1) 依照 2.4 A 的步骤进行。",0],["h2","2.5",null,0],["li","(1) Introduce and practice saying all the body parts.","(1) 介绍并练习说出所有身体部位。",0],["li","(2) Ask the students to close their eyes and listen to the song played on the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 请学生闭上眼睛，听触控一体机播放的歌曲。",0],["li","(3) Practice singing the song together. When the students can sing the song start adding some movements to the song. (e.g. touching your head, touching your shoulder, etc.)","(3) 一起练习唱这首歌。学生会唱之后，开始加入一些动作（例如摸头、摸肩膀等）。",0],["li","(4) Sing together with the movements and try to sing faster and faster until someone can't keep up with it. See who can last the longest.","(4) 一起边唱边做动作，越唱越快，直到有人跟不上，看谁撑得最久。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (20 mins)","Classroom Readers（20 mins）",0],["h2","Lesson 2: Hello, Randy and Lily","第 2 课 Hello, Randy and Lily 你好，Randy 和 Lily",0],["li","(1) Click on the snail to let it introduce the story.","(1) 点击蜗牛，让它介绍故事。",0],["li","(2) Use the monitor to introduce the new words. Ask the students to repeat.","(2) 用屏幕介绍新单词，请学生复诵。",0],["li","(3) First play the entire story on the touchscreen all-in-one and ask the students to listen. Play it a second time, but this time stop after every sentence and ask the students to practice the sentence.","(3) 先用触控一体机播放整个故事让学生听；播放第二次时，每句停下来请学生练习。",0],["li","(4) Do Role playing - Assign 3 teams to be Randy, Mike, and the narrator. Have the students read their own parts and then alternate until all the teams have done all 3 parts. Some reward cards may be given to the team that reads the best.","(4) 角色扮演：指定 3 队分别扮演 Randy、Mike 和旁白，请学生念自己的部分，再轮换，直到每队都念过 3 个角色。念得最好的队伍可以得到奖励卡。",0],["li","(5) Use the translation on the touchscreen all-in-one to explain the sentence structure.","(5) 用触控一体机上的翻译说明句子结构。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["p","Let's See And Say",null,0],["li","Step 1:","步骤 1：",0],["p","Context Introduction:","情境介绍：",0],["p","Introduce the lesson by having the students listen to the monolog. The teacher can either read the monolog, or use the MP 3. Let's See And Say-Monolog Table manners are important for us to know. Do you know what table manners are? Let's learn with Mike.","让学生听独白介绍本课，老师可以自己念，或使用 MP3。Let's See And Say 独白：Table manners are important for us to know. Do you know what table manners are? Let's learn with Mike.",0],["li","Step 2:","步骤 2：",0],["p","Have the class guess and predict about the theme and the words that relate to this lesson based on the monolog they have listened to. Encourage the students to use their imagination and share their ideas. Write the students' ideas on the board and add the points you also want to emphasize. Then play the dialog for the first time.","请全班根据刚听到的独白，猜测并预测与本课相关的主题和单词。鼓励学生发挥想象力并分享想法。把学生的想法写在黑板上，并补充您想强调的重点。接着第一次播放对话。",0],["li","Step 3:","步骤 3：",0],["p","Continue to play the dialog to the class for the second time and have the students repeat after the narrator. Remind the students to listen carefully to the narrator's pronunciation and intonation while practicing each sentence of the dialogue. The teacher also needs to listen carefully to the students' pronunciation and intonation and give help if it's necessary.","第二次播放对话，请学生跟着录音复诵。提醒学生练习每一句对话时，仔细听录音的发音和语调。老师也要仔细听学生的发音和语调，必要时给予协助。",0],["li","Step 4:","步骤 4：",0],["p","Introduce the theme of the lesson to the class again by combining the dialog that the students have practiced and the core vocabulary of this lesson. (The teacher can play or read the dialogue to the class again if it's necessary.) Make sure all the students are familiar with the dialogue and vocabulary and able to do the conversation with each other. At this stage, the teacher should also tell the students about some real-life situations where they can use this kind of conversation.","结合学生刚练习过的对话和本课的核心单词，再次向全班介绍本课主题。（必要时老师可以再播放或念一次对话。）确认所有学生都熟悉对话和单词，并能互相进行对话。这个阶段老师也应该告诉学生，在现实生活中有哪些情境可以用到这类对话。",0],["li","Step 5:","步骤 5：",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group practice the conversation for a comprehension check.","让学生两两一组，各组练习对话，检查理解程度。",0],["li","Step 6:","步骤 6：",0],["p","Remind the students to review the lesson at home by listening to the MP3 and encourage them to practice the dialog with their family or friends before coming to the next class.","提醒学生回家听 MP3 复习本课，并鼓励他们在下次上课前和家人或朋友练习对话。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h3","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review today's lesson using the books.","(1) 用课本复习今天的课程。",0],["li","(2) Review today's lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。",0],["h3","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Write a few examples on the board so that they understand.","利用这段时间预习作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生了解。",0],["h3","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have the students write them down in their Progress Report Book.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually. Write some comments or encouragement. It is a good time to give the students reward cards according to their performance.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，写一些评语或鼓励。这是依照学生表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 1","电话教学教材 1",0],["p","This is a good way to reinforce the previous lessons. It also gives your students a to speak English out of the classroom setting (the parents seem to like this a lot). are some suggested questions you can use.","这是加强之前课程的好方法，也让学生有机会在教室以外说英语（家长似乎很喜欢）。以下是一些建议的问题。",0],["li","1. Please make a sentence using body parts","1. 请用身体部位造一个句子。",0],["li","2. Please make a sentence using names of a family member","2. 请用家庭成员的称呼造一个句子。",0],["li","3. Please open your Reader to lesson 2 and look at page 2. Who are they? Where they? chance Below are","3. 请打开读本第 2 课第 2 页：Who are they? Where are they?",0]],"g":[[27,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 4","Classroom Activities","Classroom Readers","Lesson 1","大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 4"]],[37,["Classroom Activities","Lesson 2","Part 1","2.1","Part 2","2.2","Part 3","2.3","Part 4","2.4 A","2.4 B","2.4 C","Part 5","2.5"]],[60,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 4","Classroom Readers","Lesson 2","Talking","New Words","Learning & Playing","Translation"]],[81,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["Family Tree","Hello, Randy and Lily"],"bd":"","m":110},{"z":"第 3 课","t":"Class 3","k":"class","p":[18,19,20],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["li","- To be able to name different places","- 能说出不同地方的名称",1],["li","- To ask and answer questions about where people are going","- 能问答有关某人要去哪里的问题",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","Flashcards, sticky ball, digital equipment","单词卡、黏黏球、数字教学设备",1],["h3","Classroom Activities 4A Lesson 3","Classroom Activities 4A 第 3 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Movie(s), post office, supermarket, book shop",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","Where is + verb + ing?","Where is ＋ 动词 ＋ ing?",1],["h3","Phonics","自然拼读",1],["p","\"ur\" and \"ir\"","“ur”和“ir”",1],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson 3","Classroom Readers 第 3 课",1],["p","New Words Church, handsome, bicycle, come, coming, look out","新单词：church, handsome, bicycle, come, coming, look out",1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","Present continuous","现在进行时",1],["h3","EEC 2 Lesson 7","EEC 2 第 7 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","Mustard, olive oil, mayonnaise, ketchup, pepper, salt",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","This is delicious!","A",1],["d","Don't do that, Mike!","B",1],["d","But my napkin is wet","A",1],["d","Use your napkin, please","B",1],["d","Uh - Oh....like this?","A",1],["d","Yes. That is good table manners.","B",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["li","(1) Review the last class using the digital teaching equipment. Have the students watch the touchscreen all-in-one and repeat the sentences.","(1) 用数字教学设备复习上一堂课，请学生看触控一体机并复诵句子。",0],["li","(2) Review the vocabulary from the last class.","(2) 复习上一堂课的单词。",0],["li","(3) Spelling quiz.","(3) 拼写小测验。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (55 mins) Lesson 3: Going Places","Classroom Activities（55 mins）第 3 课 Going Places 去各个地方",0],["h2","3.1",null,0],["li","(1) Display the vocabulary using the touchscreen all-in-one and ask the students to listen carefully.","(1) 用触控一体机展示单词，请学生仔细听。",0],["li","(2) Introduce the vocabulary on the monitor. Ask the students to repeat after the teacher.","(2) 在屏幕上介绍单词，请学生跟着老师复诵。",0],["li","(3) Draw pictures on the board or use flashcards to practice the sentence patterns without looking at the monitor or the book.","(3) 在黑板上画图或使用单词卡，不看屏幕或课本练习句型。",0],["h2","3.2 A",null,0],["li","(1) Display the sentences on the monitor and ask the students to listen, and then repeat the sentences.","(1) 在屏幕上展示句子，请学生先听再复诵。",0],["li","(2) Ask the students to look at the picture in the book. Randomly choose some students to ask or answer the questions. (2A) Activity Sheet 2:","(2) 请学生看课本上的图片，随机选几位学生提问或回答。(2A) 活动单 2：",0],["p","Put the students into pairs or groups. Have them trace the squiggly lines on Activity Sheet 2, and then write sentences about where the characters are going. Then let them ask and answer questions with each other about where the characters are going.","把学生两两一组或分组，请他们描出活动单 2 上的弯曲线条，再写句子说明角色要去哪里，接着互相问答角色要去哪里。",0],["h3","(3) Play Shooting The Pig using the sticky ball","(3) 用黏黏球玩“射小猪”",0],["li","- Separate the class into 3 or 4 teams depending on the size of your class. Tell them that they will stay with the same team for the entire class.","- 依班级人数把全班分成 3 或 4 队，告诉学生整堂课都在同一队。",0],["li","- Try to draw a funny looking pig with all the body parts. Assign different points to the different body parts. Other white areas on the board can be negative points just to make the game more interesting.","- 尽量画一只有各个身体部位、样子好笑的猪，不同的身体部位给不同的分数。黑板上其他空白处可以是负分，让游戏更有趣。",0],["li","- Ask each team questions that are related to the target sentence pattern. The team that answers the question correctly gets a chance to throw the sticky ball at the pig. The team gets certain points according to the area of the pig that they hit.","- 问每队和目标句型相关的问题，答对的队伍有机会把黏黏球丢向小猪，依照丢中的部位得分。",0],["li","- You can also ask the teams to ask each other questions.","- 也可以让各队互相问问题。",0],["h2","3.2 B",null,0],["li","(1) Use the touchscreen all-in-one. Practice asking and answering questions using the sentence patterns. Display the questions on the monitor by clicking \"A\" and randomly pick students to answer them. Ask them to click \"B\" for the answer.","(1) 用触控一体机练习用句型问答。点击“A”在屏幕上显示问题，随机选学生回答，再请他们点击“B”看答案。",0],["li","(2) Ask the same teams to have a race to see who can finish writing the exercise in the book first without making a mistake.","(2) 请同样的分队比赛，看哪一队最先全部答对写完课本上的练习。",0],["h2","3.3",null,0],["li","(1) Introduce the new phonics sounds \"ur\" and \"ir\". These two sounds are very easy to mix up because they sound alike. The \"ur\" sound comes from the back of the throat and the lips are rounded a bit. The \"ir\" comes from the middle/upper part of the mouth with the lips rounded as well. Make sure to explain the difference so that they don't confuse the two sounds.","(1) 介绍新的发音“ur”和“ir”。这两个音听起来很像，很容易混淆：“ur”从喉咙后方发出，嘴唇稍微圆起来；“ir”从口腔中上方发出，嘴唇也是圆的。一定要说明两者的差别，避免学生混淆。",0],["li","(2) Ask the students to come up and use the touchscreen all-in-one for this exercise.","(2) 请学生上台用触控一体机做这个练习。",0],["li","(3) Read every word out loud and ask the students to repeat.","(3) 大声念出每个字，请学生复诵。",0],["h2","3.4",null,0],["li","(1) Play the sounds on the touchscreen all-in-one and ask the students to fill out the answers as a team.","(1) 用触控一体机播放发音，请各队一起填写答案。",0],["li","(2) Check the answers of every team. If it is correct then more points may be given to the team. Go over the answers together and practice pronouncing the words as a class.","(2) 检查每队的答案，答对可以多得分。一起核对答案，全班一起练习念这些字。",0],["li","(3) You can also think of some other words with \"ur\" and \"ir,\" and let the students practice.","(3) 也可以想一些其他有“ur”和“ir”的单词让学生练习。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (20 mins)","Classroom Readers（20 mins）",0],["h2","Lesson 3: Hello, Randy and Lily","第 3 课 Hello, Randy and Lily 你好，Randy 和 Lily",0],["li","(1) Use the monitor to introduce the new words. Ask the students to repeat.","(1) 用屏幕介绍新单词，请学生复诵。",0],["li","(2) First, play the entire story on the touchscreen all-in-one and ask the students to listen. Play it a second time but this time stop after every sentence and ask the students to practice the sentence.","(2) 先用触控一体机播放整个故事让学生听；播放第二次时，每句停下来请学生练习。",0],["li","(3) Use the translation on the touchscreen all-in-one to explain the sentence structure.","(3) 用触控一体机上的翻译说明句子结构。",0],["li","(4) Ask the same teams to do a short play from this lesson. Give each team some time to practice the play. Ask them to perform in front of the class. The teacher will be the judge and will decide how many points may be given for the best performance.","(4) 请同样的分队把这一课演成短剧，给每队一些时间练习，再请他们在全班面前表演。由老师当评审，决定表现最好的队伍得几分。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["p","What Can I do?","What Can I Do?",0],["li","Step 1:","步骤 1：",0],["p","Play the dialog using the MP3 as a quick review.","用 MP3 播放对话，作为快速复习。",0],["li","Step 2:","步骤 2：",0],["p","Explain the meaning of each topic in \"What Can I do?\" and let them check the appropriate box. Allow five minutes for the students to do the exercise and select a few students to report their self-evaluation to the class.","解释“What Can I Do?”中每个项目的意思，让学生在适当的方格打钩。给学生五分钟做这个练习，再选几位学生向全班报告自己的自我评估。",0],["li","Step 3:","步骤 3：",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group do a mini role-play of the dialog. Each group needs to demonstrate in front of the class, and the teacher needs to make sure everyone can do the conversation with ease. Also, pay attention to the students' pronunciation and intonation.","让学生两两一组，各组进行本单元对话的小型角色扮演。每一组都要到全班面前表演，老师要确认每个人都能轻松进行对话，同时注意学生的发音和语调。",0],["h2","Reinforcement","加强复习 Reinforcement",0],["h3","(10 mins)","（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review today's lesson using the books.","(1) 用课本复习今天的课程。",0],["li","(2) Review today's lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Write a few examples on the board so that they understand.","利用这段时间预习作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生了解。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have the students write them down in their Progress Report Book.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually. Write some comments or encouragement. It is a good time to give students reward cards according to their teams' performance.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，写一些评语或鼓励。这是依照各队表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0]],"g":[[27,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 4","Classroom Activities","Classroom Readers","Lesson 2","大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 4","Classroom Activities","Lesson 3"]],[36,["Part 1","3.1","Part 2","3.2 A","3.2 B","Part 3","3.3","Part 4","3.4"]],[57,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 4","Classroom Readers"]],[57,["Lesson 3","New Words","Learning & Playing","Translation"]],[70,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["Going Places","Hello, Randy and Lily"],"bd":"","m":100},{"z":"第 4 课","t":"Class 4","k":"class","p":[21,22,23,24],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["li","- To be able to use present continuous using different verbs","- 能用不同的动词使用现在进行时",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","Flashcards, digital equipment","单词卡、数字教学设备",1],["h3","Classroom Activities 4A Lesson 4","Classroom Activities 4A 第 4 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Wash, brush, comb, take a shower",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","What is + verb + ing?","What is ＋ 动词 ＋ ing?",1],["h3","Phonics","自然拼读",1],["p","\"j\"",null,1],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson 4","Classroom Readers 第 4 课",1],["p","New Words Do, doing, fall down, falling down, sorry, isn't = is not","新单词：do, doing, fall down, falling down, sorry, isn't = is not",1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","Present continuous, What is + verb + ing?","现在进行时，What is ＋ 动词 ＋ ing?",1],["h3","EEC 2 Lesson 8","EEC 2 第 8 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","Plate, spoon, fork, knife, bowl, jar.",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","Do you want soup?","A",1],["d","Yes, mom.","B",1],["d","Don't drink out of the bowl","A",1],["d","Oh, no?","B",1],["d","Use your spoon, dear.","A",1],["d",":OK","B",1],["d","And don't be noisy.","A",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["li","(1) Review the last class using the digital equipment. Have the students look at the touchscreen all-in-one and repeat the sentences.","(1) 用数字教学设备复习上一堂课，请学生看触控一体机并复诵句子。",0],["li","(2) Review the vocabulary from the last class.","(2) 复习上一堂课的单词。",0],["li","(3) Do a pop phonics quiz to see how much they remember.","(3) 进行突击发音小测验，看学生还记得多少。",0],["li","(4) Review all the previous phonics.","(4) 复习之前所有的发音。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (55 mins) Lesson 4: Going Places","Classroom Activities（55 mins）第 4 课",0],["h2","4.1",null,0],["li","(1) Display the vocabulary using the touchscreen all-in-one and ask the students to listen carefully.","(1) 用触控一体机展示单词，请学生仔细听。",0],["li","(2) Introduce the vocabulary on the monitor. Ask the students to repeat.","(2) 在屏幕上介绍单词，请学生复诵。",0],["li","(3) Draw pictures on the board or use flashcards to practice the sentence pattern without looking at the monitor or the book.","(3) 在黑板上画图或使用单词卡，不看屏幕或课本练习句型。",0],["h2","4.2 A",null,0],["li","(1) Display the sentences on the monitor and ask the students to listen. Repeat the sentences.","(1) 在屏幕上展示句子，请学生听并复诵。",0],["li","(2) Ask the students to look at the picture in the book. Randomly pick out some students to ask or answer the questions.","(2) 请学生看课本上的图片，随机选几位学生提问或回答。",0],["li","(3) Play the \"movie stars\" game:","(3) 玩“电影明星”游戏：",0],["p","Divide the class into 3 or 4 teams. Then pick some sentences relating to the goal sentence structure and ask each team to act out the sentence and let other teams guess what they are doing. Points may be given to the team that can correctly guess the sentence.","把全班分成 3 或 4 队，挑一些和目标句型相关的句子，请每队表演句子，让其他队猜他们在做什么，猜对的队伍可以得分。",0],["li","(4) Play for a few rounds until they seem to understand the concept.","(4) 玩几轮，直到学生似乎懂了这个概念。",0],["h2","4.2 B",null,0],["li","(1) Use the touchscreen all-in-one to practice asking and answering questions about sentence patterns. Display the questions on the monitor by clicking \"A\" and randomly pick students to answer them. Ask them to click \"B\" for the answer.","(1) 用触控一体机练习用句型问答。点击“A”在屏幕上显示问题，随机选学生回答，再请他们点击“B”看答案。",0],["li","(2) With the same teams ask them to have a race to see who can finish writing the exercise in the book without a mistake first. Points will be given to the fastest team.","(2) 请同样的分队比赛，看哪一队最先全部答对写完课本上的练习，最快的队伍得分。",0],["h2","4.3",null,0],["li","(1) Introduce the new phonic \"j\". This is a relatively easy sound to pronounce. Ask the students to repeat.","(1) 介绍新的发音“j”，这个音相对容易发。请学生复诵。",0],["li","(2) Ask the students to come up and use the touchscreen all-in-one for this exercise.","(2) 请学生上台用触控一体机做这个练习。",0],["li","(3) Read every word out loud and ask the students to repeat.","(3) 大声念出每个字，请学生复诵。",0],["h2","4.4",null,0],["li","(1) Play the sounds on the touchscreen all-in-one and ask the students to fill out the correct answers as a team.","(1) 用触控一体机播放发音，请各队一起填写正确答案。",0],["li","(2) Check the answers of every team. If correct then more points may be given to the team. Go over the answers together and practice pronouncing the words as a class.","(2) 检查每队的答案，答对可以多得分。一起核对答案，全班一起练习念这些字。",0],["li","(3) You can also think of some other words with \"j\" to let the students practice.","(3) 也可以想一些其他有“j”的单词让学生练习。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (20 mins)","Classroom Readers（20 mins）",0],["h2","Lesson 4: It's Peter Pig!","第 4 课 It's Peter Pig! 是小猪 Peter！",0],["li","(1) Use the monitor to introduce the new words. Ask the students to repeat after the teacher.","(1) 用屏幕介绍新单词，请学生跟着老师复诵。",0],["li","(2) First play the entire story on the touchscreen all-in-one and ask the students to listen. Play it a second time, but this time stop after every sentence and ask the students to practice the sentence.","(2) 先用触控一体机播放整个故事让学生听；播放第二次时，每句停下来请学生练习。",0],["li","(3) Use the translation on the touchscreen all-in-one to explain the sentence structure.","(3) 用触控一体机上的翻译说明句子结构。",0],["li","(4) Prepare about 5 reading comprehension questions. The students have to discuss and write down the answers on a piece of paper with the same teams. Points will be given to the team(s) that can answer correctly.","(4) 准备大约 5 题阅读理解问题，学生要和同队讨论并把答案写在纸上，答对的队伍得分。",0],["li","(5) Go over all the answers together and answer any questions students might have.","(5) 一起核对所有答案，回答学生可能有的问题。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Motivation","导入（Motivation）",0],["p","This is the time to warm the class up by providing the students with a general picture of the lesson that they are going to learn today. Make sure all the students have a general idea about today's lesson before going to the next part of Let's See And Say.","这是让全班热身的时间，让学生对今天要学的课程有整体的概念。进入“Let's See & Say”之前，请确认所有学生对今天的课程都有大致的了解。",0],["h3","Let's See and Say",null,0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Introduction:","引导：",0],["p","Introduce the lesson to the class by having the students listen to the monolog. You can either read the monolog aloud, or use the MP 3. Let's See And Say-Monolog Now we know what table manners are. How are your table manners? Let's listen to the conversation and learn table manners with the girl.","让学生听独白，向全班介绍本课。可以大声念出独白，或使用 MP3。Let's See And Say 独白：Now we know what table manners are. How are your table manners? Let's listen to the conversation and learn table manners with the girl.",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Have the class guess and predict about the theme and the words that relate to this lesson based on the the monolog they have listened to. Encourage the students to use their imagination and share their ideas. Write the students' ideas on the board and add the points you also want to emphasize. Then play the dialog for the first time.","请全班根据刚听到的独白，猜测并预测与本课相关的主题和单词。鼓励学生发挥想象力并分享想法。把学生的想法写在黑板上，并补充您想强调的重点。接着第一次播放对话。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the dialog to the class for the second time and have the students repeat after the narrator. Remind the students to listen carefully to the narrator's pronunciation and intonation while practicing each sentence of the dialog. The teacher also needs to listen carefully to the students' pronunciation and intonation and give help if it's necessary.","第二次播放对话，请学生跟着录音复诵。提醒学生练习每一句对话时，仔细听录音的发音和语调。老师也要仔细听学生的发音和语调，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Introduce the theme of the lesson to the class again by combining the dialog that the students have practiced and the core vocabulary of this lesson. (The teacher can play or read the dialogue to the class again if necessary.) Make sure all the students are familiar with the dialog and vocabulary and able to do the conversation with each other. At this stage, the teacher should also tell the students about real-world situations where they can use this kind of conversation.","结合学生刚练习过的对话和本课的核心单词，再次向全班介绍本课主题。（必要时老师可以再播放或念一次对话。）确认所有学生都熟悉对话和单词，并能互相进行对话。这个阶段老师也应该告诉学生，在现实生活中有哪些情境可以用到这类对话。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group practice the conversation for a comprehension check.","让学生两两一组，各组练习对话，检查理解程度。",0],["h3","Step 6","步骤 6",0],["p","Remind the students to review the lesson at home by listening to the MP3 and encourage them to practice the dialog with their family or friends before coming to the next class.","提醒学生回家听 MP3 复习本课，并鼓励他们在下次上课前和家人或朋友练习对话。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review today's lesson using the books.","(1) 用课本复习今天的课程。",0],["li","(2) Review today's lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Write a few examples on the board so that they understand.","利用这段时间预习作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生了解。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have the students write them down in their Progress Report Book.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually. Write some comments or encouragement. It is a good time to give students reward cards according to their teams' performance.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，写一些评语或鼓励。这是依照各队表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 2","电话教学教材 2",0],["li","1. Please make a sentence using \"going to\" and \"a place\"","1. 请用 \"going to\" 和一个地方造句。",0],["li","2. What are you doing?",null,0],["li","3. Please make a sentence using \"washing\" or \"taking\"","3. 请用 \"washing\" 或 \"taking\" 造句。",0],["li","4. Ask the students to identify different phonics sounds from previous lessons.","4. 请学生辨认之前课程学过的不同发音。",0]],"g":[[27,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 4","Classroom Activities","Classroom Readers","Lesson 3","大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 4"]],[37,["Classroom Activities","Lesson 4","Part 1","4.1","Part 2","4.2 A","4.2 B","Part 3","4.3","Part 4","4.4"]],[55,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 4","Classroom Readers","Lesson 4","New Words","Learning & Playing","Translation"]],[79,["● Follow the same","steps above"]]],"tp":["Going Places","It's Peter Pig!"],"bd":"","m":110},{"z":"第 5 课","t":"Class 5","k":"class","p":[25,26,27,28],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["li","- To identify colors","- 能说出颜色",1],["li","- To ask and answer questions about the color(s) of objects","- 能问答有关物品颜色的问题",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","Flashcards, digital equipment","单词卡、数字教学设备",1],["h3","Classroom Activities 4A Lesson 5","Classroom Activities 4A 第 5 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","White, purple, orange, pink, brown",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","What color is/are ______?",null,1],["h3","Phonics","自然拼读",1],["p","\"x\"",null,1],["h3","Classroom Reader Lesson 5","Classroom Reader 第 5 课",1],["p","New Words Walk to, walking to, market, hold, holding, box, color, help, helping","新单词：walk to, walking to, market, hold, holding, box, color, help, helping",1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","Present continuous, What color is/are ______?","现在进行时，What color is/are ___?",1],["h3","EEC 2 Lesson 8","EEC 2 第 8 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","Plate, spoon, fork, knife, bowl, jar.",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","Do you want soup?","A",1],["d","Yes, mom.","B",1],["d","Don't drink out of the bowl","A",1],["d","Oh, no?","B",1],["d","Use your spoon, dear.","A",1],["d",":OK","B",1],["d","And don't be noisy.","A",1],["h2","Warm Up Lesson 5: At the Snack Bar (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up 第 5 课（10 mins）",0],["li","(1) Review the last class using the digital equipment. Have the students look at the touchscreen all-in-one and repeat the sentences.","(1) 用数字教学设备复习上一堂课，请学生看触控一体机并复诵句子。",0],["li","(2) Review the vocabulary from the last class.","(2) 复习上一堂课的单词。",0],["li","(3) Spelling Quiz.","(3) 拼写小测验。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities",null,0],["h2","Lesson 5: At the Flower Shop (55 mins)","第 5 课 At the Flower Shop 在花店（55 mins）",0],["h2","5.1",null,0],["li","(1) Display the vocabulary from the touchscreen all-in-one and ask the students to listen carefully.","(1) 用触控一体机展示单词，请学生仔细听。",0],["li","(2) Introduce the vocabulary using the monitor. Ask the students to repeat after the teacher.","(2) 用屏幕介绍单词，请学生跟着老师复诵。",0],["li","(3) Draw pictures on the board or use flashcards to practice the sentence patterns without looking at the monitor or the book.","(3) 在黑板上画图或使用单词卡，不看屏幕或课本练习句型。",0],["h2","5.2 A",null,0],["li","(1) Display the sentences using the monitor and ask the students to listen, then repeat the sentences.","(1) 用屏幕展示句子，请学生先听再复诵。",0],["li","(2) Ask students to look at the picture in the book and randomly pick some students to ask or answer the questions.","(2) 请学生看课本上的图片，随机选几位学生提问或回答。",0],["li","(3) Play Go Fish:","(3) 玩“钓鱼配对（Go Fish）”：",0],["li","- Divide the class into 3 or 4 teams. Buy a box of blank cards. On each card draw an object that the students can recognize in English. Then, color the object with one of the five colors taught in this lesson. For every object you must make 2 matching cards.","- 把全班分成 3 或 4 队。买一盒空白卡片，在每张卡片上画一样学生会用英语说的东西，再用本课教的五种颜色之一着色。每样东西都要做 2 张一样的卡片。",0],["li","- With all the cards facing down, each team has to find 2 cards that look exactly the same. When a team flips up a card, the team must describe it in a sentence. Example: These pencils are blue.","- 所有卡片背面朝上，各队要找出 2 张完全一样的卡片。翻开一张卡片时，该队要用一个句子描述它，例如：These pencils are blue.",0],["li","- The game is finished when all the cards are picked up and points will be given according to the number of cards each team has in their hands.","- 所有卡片都被拿走后游戏结束，依照各队手上的卡片数量给分。",0],["h2","5.2 B",null,0],["li","(1) Use the touchscreen all-in-one to practice asking and answering questions using the sentence patterns. Display the questions on the monitor by clicking \"A\" and randomly pick out students to answer them. Ask them to click \"B\" for the answer.","(1) 用触控一体机练习用句型问答。点击“A”在屏幕上显示问题，随机选学生回答，再请他们点击“B”看答案。",0],["li","(2) With the same team ask them to have a race to see who will be the first to finish writing the exercise in the book without a mistake. Points will be given to the fastest team.","(2) 请同样的分队比赛，看哪一队最先全部答对写完课本上的练习，最快的队伍得分。",0],["li","(3) Go over each question and ask different teams to answer.","(3) 逐题讲评，请不同的队伍回答。",0],["h3","(4) Activity Sheet 3","(4) 活动单 3",0],["p","Pass out Activity Sheet 3. Have the students draw pictures of supermarket items using the food and color vocabulary that they have learned. Then let them complete the sentences below, and ask and answer questions about their supermarket drawings.","发下活动单 3，请学生用学过的食物和颜色单词画出超市里的商品，再完成下面的句子，并针对自己画的超市互相问答。",0],["h2","5.3",null,0],["li","(1) Introduce the new phonics sound, \"x\". This is a relatively easy sound to pronounce. Ask the students to repeat.","(1) 介绍新的发音“x”，这个音相对容易发。请学生复诵。",0],["li","(2) Ask the students to come up and use the touchscreen all-in-one for this exercise.","(2) 请学生上台用触控一体机做这个练习。",0],["li","(3) Read every word out loud and ask the students to repeat.","(3) 大声念出每个字，请学生复诵。",0],["h2","5.4",null,0],["li","(1) Play the sounds from the touchscreen all-in-one and ask the students to fill out the correct answers as a team.","(1) 用触控一体机播放发音，请各队一起填写正确答案。",0],["li","(2) Check the answers of every team. If correct then more points may be given to the team. Go over the answers together and practice pronouncing the words as a class.","(2) 检查每队的答案，答对可以多得分。一起核对答案，全班一起练习念这些字。",0],["li","(3) You can also think of some other words with \"x\" to let the students practice.","(3) 也可以想一些其他有“x”的单词让学生练习。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers",null,0],["h2","Lesson 5: Tina Turtle's Box (20 mins)","第 5 课 Tina Turtle's Box 乌龟 Tina 的盒子（20 mins）",0],["li","(1) Use the monitor to introduce the new words. Ask the students to repeat after the teacher.","(1) 用屏幕介绍新单词，请学生跟着老师复诵。",0],["li","(2) First play the entire story in the touchscreen all-in-one and ask the students to listen. Play it a second time, but stop after every sentence and ask the students to practice the sentence.","(2) 先用触控一体机播放整个故事让学生听；播放第二次时，每句停下来请学生练习。",0],["li","(3) Use the translation on the touchscreen all-in-one to explain the sentence structure.","(3) 用触控一体机上的翻译说明句子结构。",0],["li","(4) Putting Things In Order:","(4) 排出顺序：",0],["li","- Write the story on a piece of paper. Then cut out each sentence to make many sentence slips. Mix the slips up and do the same thing again until you have enough sets of slips for all the teams.","- 把故事写在纸上，把每个句子剪下来做成许多句子条，打乱顺序。重复做几套，让每队都有一套。",0],["li","- Each team gets a set of slips. Give them 3-5 minutes to put the story back in its original order without looking at the book. You may play the story using the touchscreen all-in-one in the background to give them some hints.","- 每队拿一套句子条，给他们 3–5 分钟，不看课本把故事排回原来的顺序。可以在背景用触控一体机播放故事给他们一些提示。",0],["li","- When time is up ask each team to read their story. Give points when they put the sentences into the correct order.","- 时间到后，请每队念出他们排好的故事，顺序正确就给分。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Let's Check",null,0],["h3","Listening Comprehension","听力理解",0],["p","Note: For the listening exercises, the teacher needs to read the words to the students for exercise 1 (please refer to the appendix for the script) and play the MP3 to the class for exercise 2. For exercise 3, the teacher should give the instruction first and have the students do the exercise by themselves.","注意：听力练习的第 1 题，老师需要念单词给学生听（稿件请参考附录）；第 2 题播放 MP3 给全班听；第 3 题由老师先说明，再让学生自己完成。",0],["h3","(1) Listen and use \"ˇ\" or \"╳\"","(1) 听一听，打钩“ˇ”或打叉“╳”",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Quickly review the dialog that the students have learned from the previous class. The teacher can do the conversation with the students by being \"A\" and have the students to be \"B\". Do it again, switching roles.","快速复习学生上一堂课学过的对话。老师可以扮演“A”、学生扮演“B”进行对话，再交换角色练习一次。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Attract the students' attention by saying, \" Open your book to page ___ and take out your pencil.\" \"Pay careful attentions to what your teacher says and write a \"V\" or an \"X\" according to the word you hear.\"","说“Open your book to page ___ and take out your pencil.”“Pay careful attention to what your teacher says and write a \"V\" or an \"X\" according to the word you hear.”吸引学生的注意。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Read the words to the students and have them to listen to you and do the exercise. (The teacher can read the words to the class again if necessary.) Take a look around and check the correct answers with the students.","念单词给学生听，请他们边听边做练习。（必要时老师可以再念一次。）巡视教室，和学生一起核对正确答案。",0],["h3","(2) Listen and circle","(2) 听一听，圈出答案",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the monolog. Let's Check: Monolog What do you use to have your meals? Do you use a spoon, chopsticks or a fork? What can you see in the picture? Please turn to page 34,Let's Check. Listen to the words and circle.","播放独白。Let's Check 独白：What do you use to have your meals? Do you use a spoon, chopsticks or a fork? What can you see in the picture? Please turn to page 34, Let's Check. Listen to the words and circle.",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Tell the class the name of each picture and have them repeat after you.","告诉全班每张图片的名称，请他们跟着您复诵。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Explain that they have to circle the correct picture while listening to the MP3. Continue to play the MP3 to the class for the listening exercise.","说明他们要边听 MP3，边圈出正确的图片。接着继续播放 MP3 进行听力练习。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Take a look around and make sure all the students can do the exercise while playing the MP3.","播放 MP3 时巡视教室，确认所有学生都会做这个练习。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","As soon as they finish, start the correction by telling them the answers and help them to correct their mistakes. (The teacher can play the dialog again if necessary.)","学生一完成就开始订正：告诉他们答案，并帮助他们改正错误。（必要时老师可以再播放一次对话。）",0],["li","(3) Exercise: Connect the food to appropriate cutlery","(3) 练习：把食物和适当的餐具连起来",0],["li","Step 1:","步骤 1：",0],["p","Give the instruction to the class about exercise 3 by referring to the exercise heading of the lesson. Make sure your explanation is clear enough for the students to do the exercise by themselves. Take a look around while the students are doing the exercise and give help if it's necessary.","参考本课练习的标题，向全班说明第 3 题的做法，确认说明够清楚，让学生能自己完成。学生做练习时巡视教室，必要时给予协助。",0],["li","Step 2:","步骤 2：",0],["p","Check the answers with the class by eliciting answers from the students. The teacher should give more chance for the students to talk and interact with the others in class to increase learner's communicative ability.","请学生说出答案，和全班一起核对。老师应多给学生在课堂上说话、和别人互动的机会，提升学习者的沟通能力。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","1) Review today's lesson using the books.","(1) 用课本复习今天的课程。",0],["li","2) Review today's lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Write a few examples on the board so that they understand.","利用这段时间预习作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生了解。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have the students write them down in their Progress Report Book.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually. Write some comments or encouragement. This is a good time to give students reward cards according to their teams' performance.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，写一些评语或鼓励。这是依照各队表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0]],"g":[[28,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 4","Classroom Activities","Classroom Readers","Lesson 4","大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 4","Classroom Activities"]],[38,["Lesson 5","Part 1","5.1","Part 2","5.2 A","5.2 B","Part 3","5.3","Part 4","5.4"]],[60,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 4","Classroom Readers"]],[60,["Lesson 5","New Words","Learning & Playing","Translation"]],[96,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["At the Snack Bar","At the Flower Shop","Tina Turtle's Box"],"bd":"","m":110},{"z":"第 6 课","t":"Class 6","k":"class","p":[29,30],"b":[["h3","Review Day 1","复习日 1",1],["h3","Goals","目标",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","Flashcards, tape recorder, S4 listening lab tape, copy of the test","单词卡、录音机、S4 听力练习录音带、测验卷复印件",1],["h3","Classroom Readers",null,1],["p","Review Lesson 1 to Lesson 5","复习第 1 课到第 5 课",1],["h3","Classroom Activities",null,1],["p","Review lesson 1 to lesson 5","复习第 1 课到第 5 课",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["h3","vocabulary","单词",1],["p","Plate, spoon, fork, knife, bowl, jar.",null,1],["d","Do you want soup?","A",1],["d","Yes, mom.","B",1],["d","Don't drink out of the bowl","A",1],["d","Oh, no?","B",1],["d","Use your spoon, dear.","A",1],["d",":OK","B",1],["d","And don't be noisy.","A",1],["h2","Review (20 mins)","复习 Review（20 mins）",0],["li","(1) Use this time to catch up on lessons or areas some students did not have time for in the first six classes. If the students are caught up, spend time reviewing previous lessons or areas where the students seem to be having difficulty. Do this using drills, games, or any activity that will help the students. Choose activities you know the students will like.","(1) 利用这段时间补上前六堂课中，部分学生还没来得及完成的课程或部分。如果学生进度都跟上了，就用这段时间复习之前的课程，或学生似乎有困难的部分。可以通过操练、游戏或任何对学生有帮助的活动进行，选择您知道学生会喜欢的活动。",0],["li","(2) Review all the vocabulary.","(2) 复习所有单词。",0],["li","(3) Review all the sentence patterns.","(3) 复习所有句型。",0],["li","(4) Review all the phonics","(4) 复习所有发音。",0],["h2","Quiz (30 mins)","小测验 Quiz（30 mins）",0],["li","(1) Have the students put all books and unnecessary things away. Hand out the quiz and have the students take it.","1. 请学生把所有书本和不需要的东西收起来，发下考卷让学生作答。",0],["li","(2) Make sure that the students know the meaning of each item.","2. 确认学生了解每一题的意思。",0],["li","(3) Walk around the classroom and check the quiz for the students to avoid misunderstandings.","3. 在教室里走动检查考卷，避免学生误解题意。",0],["li","(4) Students must not talk or cheat during the quiz. If the students don't get good grades, the student has to make it up in the next class (the teacher may have their own grading standard).","(4) 小测验时学生不能说话或作弊。成绩不理想的学生，下次上课要补考（老师可以自定评分标准）。",0],["h2","Listening Quiz (30 mins)","听力小测验 Listening Quiz（30 mins）",0],["li","(1) Check the tape and the recorder before the students come back from the break. Prepare for the listening quiz.","(1) 在学生下课休息回来前，先检查录音带和录音机，准备听力小测验。",0],["li","(2) Turn on the tape and have the students fill in the appropriate blanks.","(2) 播放录音带，请学生在适当的空格中作答。",0],["li","(3) Since this is the first listening quiz, play the tape a few times. The students need to listen carefully.","(3) 因为这是第一次听力小测验，录音带可以多播几次。学生要仔细听。",0],["li","(4) Listening is a very important aspect of learning a new language.","(4) 听力是学习新语言非常重要的一环。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","What Can I do?","What Can I Do?",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the dialog using the MP 3 as a quick review.","用 MP3 播放对话，作为快速复习。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Explain the meaning of each topic in \"What Can I do?\" and let them check the appropriate space. Allow five minutes for the students to do the exercise and select a few students to report their self-evaluation to the class.","解释“What Can I Do?”中每个项目的意思，让学生在适当的方格打钩。给学生五分钟做这个练习，再选几位学生向全班报告自己的自我评估。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group do a mini role-play of the dialog. Each group needs to demonstrate in front of the class, and the teacher needs to make sure everyone can do the conversation with ease. Also, pay attention to the students' pronunciation and intonation.","让学生两两一组，各组进行本单元对话的小型角色扮演。每一组都要到全班面前表演，老师要确认每个人都能轻松进行对话，同时注意学生的发音和语调。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review today's lesson using the books.","(1) 用课本复习今天的课程。",0],["li","(2) Review today's lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","This is a good time to remind the students to correct mistakes they have made from all the previous homework.","这是提醒学生订正之前所有作业错误的好时机。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have the students write them down in their Progress Report Book.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually. Write some comments or encouragement in it. This is a good time to give the students reward cards according to their team's performance.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面写一些评语或鼓励。这是依照各队表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","(3) Remind the students about test # 1.","(3) 提醒学生准备测验 1。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material # 3","电话教学教材 #3",0],["li","1. What color is/are your (eyes,nose,hair)?",null,0],["li","2. What color is your ____(object)?",null,0],["li","3. Are you washing your face? Are you taking a shower?",null,0],["li","4. What is your (family member)'s name?",null,0],["li","5. What is your (family member) doing?",null,0]],"g":[[19,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 4","Classroom","Readers/Activities","Lesson 1- Lesson 5"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Review Day","m":105},{"z":"第 7 课","t":"Class 7","k":"class","p":[31],"b":[["h2","Test Day 1","测验日 1",0],["h3","Classroom Readers 4 & Classroom Activities 4A","Classroom Readers 4 和 Classroom Activities 4A",0],["p","Test- Lesson 1 to Lesson 5","测验：第 1 课到第 5 课",0],["h2","Review (15 mins)","复习 Review（15 mins）",0],["li","(1) Return the quizzes and Listening Labs to your students, after you have corrected them. Remind your students about the mistakes they have made. Help them to understand the correct answers.","(1) 把批改好的小测验和听力练习发还给学生，提醒学生犯过的错误，帮助他们了解正确答案。",0],["li","(2) Use this time to review for the test. Go over any sentence patterns or any other areas where you think that the students may need some review. Ask the students if they have any questions. Don't forget to practice for the oral test.","(2) 利用这段时间为测验做复习，复习任何您认为学生可能需要加强的句型或其他部分。问学生有没有问题。别忘了练习口语测验。",0],["h2","Test (40 mins)","测验 Test（40 mins）",0],["p","The students should take the entire class to complete the test. Answer questions about any areas that may seem unclear. If they finish early tell them to study for the oral test quietly.","学生应该会用整堂课完成测验。回答学生对任何不清楚部分的问题。如果提早写完，请他们安静地准备口语测验。",0],["h2","Break (10 mins)","休息 Break（10 mins）",0],["li","(1) Return the quizzes and Listening Labs to your students, after you have corrected them. Remind your students about the mistakes they have made. Help them to understand the correct answers.","(1) 把批改好的小测验和听力练习发还给学生，提醒学生犯过的错误，帮助他们了解正确答案。",0],["li","(2) Use this time to review for the test. Go over any sentence patterns or any other areas where you think your students may need some review. Ask the students if they have any questions. Don't forget to practice for the oral test.","(2) 利用这段时间为测验做复习，复习任何您认为学生可能需要加强的句型或其他部分。问学生有没有问题。别忘了练习口语测验。",0],["h2","Oral Test (3-5 mins per student)","口语测验 Oral Test（每位学生 3–5 分钟）",0],["p","Ask the students to take out their textbooks and review for the oral test. It's better to do the oral test outside of the classroom so students won't hear the questions. Make sure you don't go too far away from your classroom so you can still keep an eye on your students. Call the students one by one to come out and take the oral test. The oral test should account for 20% of the test's total score. However, how many points each question should be worth is up to you. You may choose to give some questions more points based on difficulty. The following sample of the oral test is for your reference. It's also a good idea to come up with your own oral test since you know the students' strengths and weaknesses.","请学生拿出课本准备口语测验。最好在教室外进行口语测验，以免其他学生听到题目；但不要离教室太远，才能随时注意学生。一个一个叫学生出来进行口语测验。口语测验占测验总分的 20%，但每题配分由您决定，可以依难易度给某些题目较高的分数。以下口语测验范例仅供参考；您最了解学生的强项和弱点，自己设计口语测验也是很好的做法。",0],["h2","The Oral Test","口语测验题目",0],["li","1. Make a question using the sentence \"They are going to the book shop\".","1. 用句子 \"They are going to the book shop.\" 改成问句。",0],["li","2. (Draw a picture of a girl going to school) Where is she going?","2.（画一个女孩去上学的图）Where is she going?",0],["li","3. (Make a gesture such as washing your face) What am I doing?","3.（做一个动作，例如洗脸）What am I doing?",0],["li","4. (Make another gesture such as reading a book) What am I doing?","4.（做另一个动作，例如看书）What am I doing?",0],["li","5. (Point to something) What color is this ...?","5.（指着某样东西）What color is this...?",0],["h2","Reinforcement","加强复习 Reinforcement",0],["h2","Progress Report Book","学习进度手册",0],["li","(1) Write the quiz and listening grades in their report books and ask them to get signatures from their parents. Also ask them to write the correct answer 5-10 times for every mistake they've made in the two quizzes.","(1) 把小测验和听力成绩写在学习进度手册上，请学生带回家给家长签名。也请学生把两次小测验中每个错误的正确答案写 5–10 次。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement in it.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。",0]],"g":[[3,["None"]],[6,["None"]],[11,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 2","Classroom Activities","Lesson 4","Playing"]],[20,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Test Day","m":65},{"z":"第 8 课","t":"Class 8","k":"class","p":[32,33],"b":[["h2","Activity Day 1","活动日 1",0],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",0],["p","English/Chinese dictionary, copies of the dictionary worksheet","英汉字典、字典练习单复印件",0],["h3","Classroom Activities &Classroom Readers","Classroom Activities 和 Classroom Readers",0],["p","Review lesson 1 to lesson 5","复习第 1 课到第 5 课",0],["h2","Test Review (20 mins)","讲评测验 Test Review（20 mins）",0],["p","After you have handed out the test, ask the students to quietly check their mistakes and try to correct those mistakes by themselves. Go over the most commonly made mistakes and explain the key grammar points again.","发下测验卷后，请学生安静地检查自己的错误，试着自己订正。讲评最常见的错误，再说明一次重要的语法重点。",0],["h2","Games and Activities (40 mins)","游戏与活动 Games and Activities（40 mins）",0],["p","After their first test, the students should get some rest and relax a bit. Do games and activities related to the materials learned by the students. Here are some games and activities for reference.","第一次测验之后，学生应该休息、放松一下。进行和学过内容相关的游戏和活动，以下是一些参考。",0],["h3","Games","游戏",0],["p","Hamburger game- Separate the class into 2 teams. First give out some blank paper and ask each team to draw hamburger buns, lettuce, hamburger meat, tomatoes, and some onions. With each part drawn, the goal is to quickly assemble the burger. Ask questions from previous lessons and when the team answers correctly they may put one hamburger part on the board. The winner is the team that can finish making a hamburger first. Jeopardy game- Play a jeopardy game with students. There can be several categories for the students to choose from: phonics, grammar, spelling, reading, Q&A, etc. Each category may have 4-5 questions. Depending on the difficulty of each question, different points will be given. Divide the class into more teams to make it challenging. Writing on back game- This is a fun game for many kids. Divide the class into 2 or 3 teams then ask each team to line up in front of the board. After everyone is facing the board, \"write\" a word on the student's back. (with your finger).They will have to write the word on the next student's back and so on until the person in front of the board has the answer. Then ask him/her to write down the answer on the board.","汉堡游戏：把全班分成 2 队，先发一些白纸，请每队画出汉堡面包、生菜、汉堡肉、番茄和洋葱。每个部分都画好后，目标是尽快组好汉堡。问之前课程的问题，答对的队伍可以把一个汉堡部分贴到黑板上，最先完成汉堡的队伍获胜。危险边缘（Jeopardy）游戏：和学生玩 Jeopardy 游戏，可以有几个类别让学生选择：发音、语法、拼写、阅读、问答等，每个类别 4–5 题，依题目难易给不同分数。分成多队会更有挑战性。背上写字游戏：这是很多孩子喜欢的游戏。把全班分成 2 或 3 队，每队在黑板前排成一排，大家都面向黑板后，用手指在最后一位学生的背上“写”一个字，他要写在下一位同学的背上，依此类推，直到站在黑板前的人知道答案，再请他把答案写在黑板上。",0],["h2","Activity Sheet- Using The Dictionary (40 mins)","活动单：使用字典（40 mins）",0],["li","(1) Devote the second hour of the class to teaching the use of the dictionary. The goal is to help your students to become familiar with looking up words in the dictionary. We'll do this by giving them practical exercises.","(1) 这堂课的第二个小时用来教如何使用字典，目标是帮助学生熟悉查字典。我们会通过实用的练习来进行。",0],["li","(2) In the first exercise there will be four words that they may or may not know. Two of the words will be related, while the other two won't. Have them circle the two words that are related to each other.","(2) 第一个练习有四个学生可能认识、也可能不认识的单词，其中两个字相关，另外两个不相关。请学生圈出彼此相关的两个字。",0],["li","(3) The second exercise will be choosing the right definition. There will be five words with three possible definitions in English. They are to choose the correct definition. This exercise might be a little difficult for them. Be sure to help them.","(3) 第二个练习是选出正确的定义。有五个单词，每个字有三个可能的英文定义，学生要选出正确的那一个。这个练习对学生可能有点难，一定要帮助他们。",0],["li","(4) Finally, the last exercise is placing the words in alphabetical order. This won't be as difficult as the other exercise, but it's still a little tricky.","(4) 最后一个练习是把单词依照字母顺序排列。这不像其他练习那么难，但还是有点小技巧。",0],["h2","Reinforcement","加强复习 Reinforcement",0],["h3","(10 mins)","（10 mins）",0],["h2","Progress Report Book","学习进度手册",0],["li","(1) Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement on it. This is a good time to give students reward cards according to their performance.","(1) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。这是依照学生表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","(2) Tell them to preview for the next lesson and listen to the tapes at home.","(2) 请学生回家预习下一课并听录音带。",0],["li","(3) Remind the students that there will be telephone teaching tonight.","(3) 提醒学生今晚有电话教学。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 4","电话教学教材 4",0],["li","1. Please take out your test paper. How do you spell \"foot\"?","1. 请拿出你的测验卷。How do you spell \"foot\"?",0],["li","2. How do you spell \"happy\"?",null,0],["li","3. Where is Peter going?",null,0],["li","4. Is Lily going to the flower shop?",null,0],["li","5. Is Miss Honey teaching English?",null,0]],"g":[[7,["None"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Activity Day","m":100},{"z":"第 9 课","t":"Class 9","k":"class","p":[34,35,36],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["p","Asking and answering questions with more action verbs","用更多动作动词问答",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["p","Extending hospitality Making or declining offers","热情款待别人；提供或婉拒好意",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","Flashcards, digital equipment","单词卡、数字教学设备",1],["h3","Classroom Activities 4A Lesson 6","Classroom Activities 4A 第 6 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Hold a basket, ride a bicycle, draw a house, read a comic book, teach English",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","What is/are _______ verb + ing?","What is/are ___ ＋ 动词 ＋ ing?",1],["h3","Phonics","自然拼读",1],["p","\"bl\", \"fl\", \"gl\", \"pl\"","“bl”“fl”“gl”“pl”",1],["h3","EEC 2 Unit 9","EEC 2 第 9 单元",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","Orange juice, salad, chicken, beef, pasta",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","Would you like more pudding?","A",1],["d","No, thank you.","B",1],["d","How about coffee?","A",1],["d","No, thanks. I'm fine.","B",1],["d","What about you?","A",1],["d","No, thank you.","B",1],["h2","Warm Up (20 mins)","热身 Warm Up（20 mins）",0],["li","(1) Review the previous classes using the digital equipment. Focus on the present progressive tense. Have the students look at the touchscreen all-in-one and repeat the sentences.","(1) 用数字教学设备复习之前的课程，着重现在进行时，请学生看触控一体机并复诵句子。",0],["li","(2) Review the vocabulary from the last classes, especially the action verbs.","(2) 复习之前课程的单词，特别是动作动词。",0],["li","(3) Do a short quiz on all the lessons that the students have learned so far, except that it won't count for any part of their grades. It'll show how much the students remember and if they've been reviewing at home.","(3) 针对学生到目前为止学过的所有课程进行一次小测验，但不计入成绩。这能看出学生记得多少，以及有没有在家复习。",0],["li","(4) Go over the quiz together and ask them to correct each other's quiz papers.","(4) 一起讲评小测验，请学生互相批改考卷。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities",null,0],["h2","Lesson 6: A Fun Weekend (50 mins)","第 6 课 A Fun Weekend 有趣的周末（50 mins）",0],["h3","6.1",null,0],["li","(1) Display the vocabulary using the touchscreen all-in-one and ask the students to listen carefully.","(1) 用触控一体机展示单词，请学生仔细听。",0],["li","(2) Introduce the vocabulary on the monitor. Ask the students to repeat.","(2) 在屏幕上介绍单词，请学生复诵。",0],["li","(3) Draw pictures on the board or use flashcards to practice the sentence patterns without looking at the monitor or the book.","(3) 在黑板上画图或使用单词卡，不看屏幕或课本练习句型。",0],["h3","6.2 A",null,0],["li","(1) First show the sentences using the monitor and ask the students to listen and then repeat the sentences.","(1) 先用屏幕展示句子，请学生听并复诵。",0],["li","(2) Ask the students to look at the picture in the book. Randomly pick some students to ask or answer the questions.","(2) 请学生看课本上的图片，随机选几位学生提问或回答。",0],["li","(3) Play the \"Guess what I'm doing\" game:","(3) 玩“猜猜我在做什么”游戏：",0],["li","- Divide the class into 2 or 3 teams. First ask each team to think of some things they did during the weekend and write them down on a piece of paper. One person from each team has to act out the sentences they have written down, pretending he/she is doing something. Then another person from each team has to ask \"What is _____ verb + ing?\" If the opposite team can answer correctly, then points will be given.","- 把全班分成 2 或 3 队，先请每队想一些周末做过的事，写在纸上。每队派一人表演写下的句子，假装正在做这件事，再由同队另一人问 \"What is ___ ＋ 动词 ＋ ing?\"，对方队伍答对就得分。",0],["h3","6.2 B",null,0],["li","(1) Use the touchscreen all-in-one to practice asking and answering questions using the target sentence pattern. First allow the students to use the touchscreen all-in-one. Then, see if they can figure it out by themselves.","(1) 用触控一体机练习用目标句型问答。先让学生使用触控一体机，再看他们能不能自己想出答案。",0],["li","(2) With the same team ask them to have a race to see who can finish writing the exercise in the book first without a mistake. Points will be given to the fastest team.","(2) 请同样的分队比赛，看哪一队最先全部答对写完课本上的练习，最快的队伍得分。",0],["li","(3) Go over each question and ask different teams to answer.","(3) 逐题讲评，请不同的队伍回答。",0],["h3","6.3",null,0],["li","(1) Introduce the new phonics sounds \"bl\", \"fl\", \"gl\", \"pl\". The blended sounds may be a little difficult for the students, so be patient and spend extra time on this.","(1) 介绍新的发音“bl”“fl”“gl”“pl”。混合音对学生来说可能有点难，要有耐心，多花一些时间练习。",0],["li","(2) Ask the students to come up and use the touchscreen all-in-one for this exercise.","(2) 请学生上台用触控一体机做这个练习。",0],["li","(3) Read every word out loud and ask the students to repeat.","(3) 大声念出每个字，请学生复诵。",0],["h3","6.4",null,0],["li","(1) Play the sounds on the touchscreen all-in-one and ask the students to fill out the correct answers as a team.","(1) 用触控一体机播放发音，请各队一起填写正确答案。",0],["li","(2) Check the answers of every team. If they are correct, then more points may be given to the team. Go over the answers together and practice pronouncing the words as a class.","(2) 检查每队的答案，答对可以多得分。一起核对答案，全班一起练习念这些字。",0],["li","(3) You can also think of some other words with \"bl\", \"fl\", \"gl\", \"pl\" and let the students practice.","(3) 也可以想一些其他有“bl”“fl”“gl”“pl”的单词让学生练习。",0],["h2","Play the Description Game (25 mins)","玩描述游戏（25 mins）",0],["li","(1) With the same teams, ask each student to write a sentence describing a classmate on a piece of paper without giving the name of the person being described. Example: She is wearing a blue shirt. She is sitting next to the door.","(1) 用同样的分队，请每位学生在纸上写一句描述某位同学的句子，但不写出名字。例如：She is wearing a blue shirt. She is sitting next to the door.",0],["li","(2) Each team takes turns reading the descriptions to the other team(s). The team with the most correct guesses is the winner.","(2) 各队轮流把描述念给其他队听，猜对最多的队伍获胜。",0],["h2","EEC",null,0],["h2","Motivation (15 mins)","导入 Motivation（15 mins）",0],["p","This is the time to warm up the class by providing the students with a general picture of the lesson that they are going to learn today. Make sure all the students have a general idea about today's lesson before going to the next part of Let's See And Say. Let's See And Say","这是让全班热身的时间，让学生对今天要学的课程有整体的概念。进入“Let's See & Say”之前，请确认所有学生对今天的课程都有大致的了解。Let's See And Say：",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Introduction:","引导：",0],["p","The teacher introduces the lesson by having the students listen to the monolog. The teacher can either read the monolog, or use the MP3. Let's See And Say: Monolog The little boy is eating dinner with his parents. Let's listen to the conversation to learn more about table manners.","老师让学生听独白介绍本课，可以自己念，或使用 MP3。Let's See And Say 独白：The little boy is eating dinner with his parents. Let's listen to the conversation to learn more about table manners.",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Have the class guess and predict about the theme and the words that relate to this lesson based on the monolog they have listened to. Encourage the students to use their imagination and give them a chance to share their ideas. Write the students' ideas on the board and add the points you also want to emphasize. Then play the dialog for the first time and have the students listen carefully.","请全班根据刚听到的独白，猜测并预测与本课相关的主题和单词。鼓励学生发挥想象力，并给他们机会分享想法。把学生的想法写在黑板上，并补充您想强调的重点。接着第一次播放对话，请学生仔细聆听。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the dialog to the class for the second time and have the students repeat after the narrator. Remind the students to listen carefully to the narrator's pronunciation and intonation while practicing each sentence of the dialog. Teachers also need to listen carefully to the students' pronunciation and intonation and give help if necessary.","第二次播放对话，请学生跟着录音复诵。提醒学生练习每一句对话时，仔细听录音的发音和语调。老师也要仔细听学生的发音和语调，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Introduce the theme of the lesson to the class again by combining the dialog that the students have practiced and the core vocabulary of this lesson. (The teacher can play or read the dialog to the class again if necessary.) Make sure all the students are familiar with the dialog and vocabulary and able to do the conversation with each other. At this stage, the teacher should also tell the students about possible situations where they can apply this type of conversation in real life.","结合学生刚练习过的对话和本课的核心单词，再次向全班介绍本课主题。（必要时老师可以再播放或念一次对话。）确认所有学生都熟悉对话和单词，并能互相进行对话。这个阶段老师也应该告诉学生，在现实生活中有哪些情境可以用到这类对话。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group practice the conversation for a comprehension check.","让学生两两一组，各组练习对话，检查理解程度。",0],["h3","Step 6","步骤 6",0],["p","Remind the students to review the lesson at home by listening to the MP3 and encourage them to practice the dialogue with their family or friends before coming to the next class.","提醒学生回家听 MP3 复习本课，并鼓励他们在下次上课前和家人或朋友练习对话。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review today's lesson using the books.","(1) 用课本复习今天的课程。",0],["li","(2) Review today's lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Write a few examples on the board so that they understand.","利用这段时间预习作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生了解。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have the students write them down in their Progress Report Book.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually. Write some comments or encouragement in it. This is a good time to give students reward cards according to their teams' performance.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面写一些评语或鼓励。这是依照各队表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0]],"g":[[23,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 4","Classroom Activities","Classroom Readers","Lesson 1-5","大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 4","Classroom Activities","Lesson 6","Part 1","6.1"]],[29,["Part 2","6.2 A","6.2 B","Part 3","6.3","Part 4","6.4"]],[51,["None"]],[71,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["A Fun Weekend"],"bd":"","m":120},{"z":"第 10 课","t":"Class 10","k":"class","p":[37,38,39,40],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["p","Using \"Is there...?\" and \"There is....\" To ask and answer questions with prepositions to identify location","能使用 \"Is there...?\" 和 \"There is...\"；能用介词问答，说出位置。",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["p","Extending hospitality Making or declining offers","热情款待别人；提供或婉拒好意",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","Flashcards, digital equipment","单词卡、数字教学设备",1],["h3","Classroom Activities 4A Lesson 7","Classroom Activities 4A 第 7 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Cake, soda, juice, ice cream, candy",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","Is there ______? There is ______?",null,1],["h3","Phonics","自然拼读",1],["p","\"y\"",null,1],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson 6","Classroom Readers 第 6 课",1],["p","New Words There, stone, water, really, so long","新单词：there, stone, water, really, so long",1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","Present continuous, There is ______.","现在进行时，There is ___.",1],["h3","EEC 2 Unit 9","EEC 2 第 9 单元",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","Orange juice, salad, chicken, beef, pasta",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["p","See And Say",null,1],["d","Would you like more pudding?","A",1],["d","No, thank you.","B",1],["d","How about coffee?","A",1],["d","No, thanks. I'm fine.","B",1],["d","What about you?","A",1],["d","No, thank you.","B",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["li","(1) Review the last class using the digital equipment. Have the students look at the touchscreen all-in-one and repeat the sentences.","(1) 用数字教学设备复习上一堂课，请学生看触控一体机并复诵句子。",0],["li","(2) Review the vocabulary from the last class.","(2) 复习上一堂课的单词。",0],["li","(3) Spelling Quiz.","(3) 拼写小测验。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (55 mins) Lesson 7: A Birthday Party","Classroom Activities（55 mins）第 7 课 A Birthday Party 生日派对",0],["h2","7.1",null,0],["li","(1) Show the vocabulary using the touchscreen all-in-one and ask the students to listen carefully.","(1) 用触控一体机展示单词，请学生仔细听。",0],["li","(2) Introduce the vocabulary using the monitor. Ask the students to repeat it.","(2) 用屏幕介绍单词，请学生复诵。",0],["li","(3) Draw pictures on the board or use flashcards and practice the sentence pattern without looking at the monitor or the book.","(3) 在黑板上画图或使用单词卡，不看屏幕或课本练习句型。",0],["h3","(4) Play Shotgun","(4) 玩“决斗”",0],["p","Separate the class into two teams. Give one set of flashcards to each team. One student from each team comes to the front. The two students stand back to back. With a flashcard in their hands, they take 3 steps away from each other, turn around and try to call out the other person's flashcard to eliminate him/her. Play until one team is completely eliminated.","把全班分成两队，每队一组单词卡。每队派一位学生到前面，两人背对背站好，手上各拿一张单词卡，各往前走 3 步，转身后试着喊出对方单词卡上的字，把对方淘汰。玩到其中一队全部被淘汰为止。",0],["h2","7.2 A",null,0],["li","(1) Show the sentences on the monitor and ask the students to listen, then repeat the sentences.","(1) 在屏幕上展示句子，请学生先听再复诵。",0],["li","(2) Ask the students to look at the picture in the book and randomly pick some students to ask or answer questions.","(2) 请学生看课本上的图片，随机选几位学生提问或回答。",0],["li","(3) Prepare some candy, juice, ice cream, etc. and pretend that it is your birthday. Tell the class that you would like to celebrate you birthday and have a small party with them in the class. Before the party starts, put the snacks in random places and tell the students that they may not get any snacks unless they ask or answer the questions using the sentence pattern.","(3) 准备一些糖果、果汁、冰淇淋等，假装今天是您的生日，告诉全班您想和他们在教室开个小派对庆祝生日。派对开始前，把点心放在教室各处，告诉学生必须用句型提问或回答，才能拿到点心。",0],["d","Is there cake in front of the whiteboard?","T",0],["d","Yes, there is. There is cake in front of the whiteboard.","S",0],["h2","7.2 B",null,0],["li","(1) Use the touchscreen all-in-one to practice asking and answering questions using the target sentence pattern. Show the questions on the monitor by clicking \"A\" and randomly pick students to answer them. Ask them to click \"B\" for the answer.","(1) 用触控一体机练习用目标句型问答。点击“A”在屏幕上显示问题，随机选学生回答，再请他们点击“B”看答案。",0],["d","(click on \"A\" and say) Is there ice cream under Randy's chair?","T",0],["d","(click on \"B\" and say) No, there isn't. There is no ice cream under Randy's chair.","S",0],["li","(2) With the same team, ask them to have a race to see who can finish writing the exercise in the book first without a mistake. A surprise will be given to the first team (it may be another type of food, such as french fries).","(2) 请同样的分队比赛，看哪一队最先全部答对写完课本上的练习，第一名的队伍会得到惊喜（可以是另一种食物，例如薯条）。",0],["li","(3) Go over each question and ask different teams to answer.","(3) 逐题讲评，请不同的队伍回答。",0],["h3","(4) Activity Sheet 4","(4) 活动单 4",0],["p","This is a fun, creative activity your students might enjoy. Have them draw pictures of the vocabulary items they have learned (like soda, juice, ice cream, etc.). Then, let them answer the questions below, and and ask and answer questions with each other. Example: Is the ice cream near Lily? (Yes, the ice cream is near Lily. / No the ice cream is near Peter.)","这是学生可能会喜欢的有趣创意活动。请学生画出学过的单词物品（例如 soda、juice、ice cream 等），再回答下面的问题，并互相问答。例如：Is the ice cream near Lily?（Yes, the ice cream is near Lily. / No, the ice cream is near Peter.）",0],["h2","7.3",null,0],["li","(1) Introduce the new phonic \"y\". This is a relatively easy sound to pronounce. Ask the students to repeat after the teacher.","(1) 介绍新的发音“y”，这个音相对容易发。请学生跟着老师复诵。",0],["li","(2) Ask the students to come up and use the touchscreen all-in-one for this exercise.","(2) 请学生上台用触控一体机做这个练习。",0],["li","(3) Read every word out loud and ask the students to repeat after the teacher.","(3) 大声念出每个字，请学生跟着老师复诵。",0],["h2","7.4",null,0],["li","(1) Play the sounds on the touchscreen all-in-one and ask the students to fill out the correct answers as a team.","(1) 用触控一体机播放发音，请各队一起填写正确答案。",0],["li","(2) Check the answers of every team, go over the answers together and practice pronouncing the words as a class.","(2) 检查每队的答案，一起核对答案，全班一起练习念这些字。",0],["li","(3) You can also think of some other words with \"y,\" and let the students practice","(3) 也可以想一些其他有“y”的单词让学生练习。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers",null,0],["h3","Lesson 6: So Long, Tina Turtle! (20 mins)","第 6 课 So Long, Tina Turtle! 再见，乌龟 Tina！（20 mins）",0],["li","(1) Use the monitor to introduce the new words. Ask the students to repeat.","(1) 用屏幕介绍新单词，请学生复诵。",0],["li","(2) First play the entire story on the touchscreen all-in-one and ask the students to listen. Play it a second time, but this time stop after every sentence and ask the students to practice the sentence.","(2) 先用触控一体机播放整个故事让学生听；播放第二次时，每句停下来请学生练习。",0],["li","(3) Use the translation on the touchscreen all-in-one to explain the sentence structure.","(3) 用触控一体机上的翻译说明句子结构。",0],["li","(4) Separate the class into teams and ask them to perform a short play. There will be 2 narrators: Tina, and Mike. Give them 5 minutes to prepare and ask them to be as creative as they can. Reward cards may be given to the team that has the best performance.","(4) 把全班分队，请他们表演一出短剧，角色有 2 位旁白、Tina 和 Mike。给他们 5 分钟准备，请他们尽量发挥创意，表现最好的队伍可以得到奖励卡。",0],["li","(5) Ask the whole class to read the story one more time.","(5) 请全班再一起念一次故事。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Let's Check",null,0],["h3","Listening Comprehension","听力理解",0],["p","Note: For the listening exercises, the teacher needs to read the words to the students for exercise 1 (please refer to the appendix for the script) and play the MP3 to the class for exercise 2. For exercise 3, the teacher should give the instruction first and have the students do the exercise by themselves.","注意：听力练习的第 1 题，老师需要念单词给学生听（稿件请参考附录）；第 2 题播放 MP3 给全班听；第 3 题由老师先说明，再让学生自己完成。",0],["li","(1) Listen to the words and write the number in the circle next to the picture.","(1) 听单词，把数字写在图片旁边的圆圈里。",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Quickly review the dialog that the students have learned from the previous class. The teacher can do the conversation with the students by being \"A\" and have the students be \"B.\" Do it again, switching roles.","快速复习学生上一堂课学过的对话。老师可以扮演“A”、学生扮演“B”进行对话，再交换角色练习一次。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Attract the students' attention by saying, \" Open your book to page ___ and take out your pencil.\" \"Pay careful attentions to what your teacher says and write the number in the circle according to the word you hear.\"","说“Open your book to page ___ and take out your pencil.”“Pay careful attention to what your teacher says and write the number in the circle according to the word you hear.”吸引学生的注意。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Read the words to the students and have them to listen to you and do the exercise. (The teacher can read the words to the class again if necessary.) Take a look around and check the correct answers with the students.","念单词给学生听，请他们边听边做练习。（必要时老师可以再念一次。）巡视教室，和学生一起核对正确答案。",0],["li","(2) Listen and match the pictures with a line","(2) 听一听，用线把图片连起来",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","As an introduction, play the Monolog. Let's Check: Monolog The family is having a wonderful meal together. You can see delicious food on the table. What's your favorite food and drink? Please turn to page 38, Let's Check. Listen and match the pictures with a line.","播放独白作为引导。Let's Check 独白：The family is having a wonderful meal together. You can see delicious food on the table. What's your favorite food and drink? Please turn to page 38, Let's Check. Listen and match the pictures with a line.",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Tell the class the name of each picture and have them repeat after you.","告诉全班每张图片的名称，请他们跟着您复诵。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Explain that they have to match the correct picture while listening to the mp3. Continue to play the MP3 to the class for the listening exercise.","说明他们要边听 MP3，边勾选正确的图片。接着继续播放 MP3 进行听力练习。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Take a look around and make sure all the students can do the exercise while playing the MP3 to the class.","播放 MP3 时巡视教室，确认所有学生都会做这个练习。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","As soon as they finish, start the correction by telling them the answers and help them to correct their mistakes. (The teacher can play the dialog again if necessary.)","学生一完成就开始订正：告诉他们答案，并帮助他们改正错误。（必要时老师可以再播放一次对话。）",0],["li","(3) Exercise: Make an \"X\" for salty food and a \"V\" for sweet food","(3) 练习：咸的食物打“X”，甜的食物打“V”",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Explain exercise 3 by referring to the exercise heading of the lesson. Make sure your explanation is clear enough for the students to do the exercise by themselves. Take a look around while the students are doing the exercise and give help if necessary.","参考本课练习的标题说明第 3 题，确认说明够清楚，让学生能自己完成。学生做练习时巡视教室，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Check the answers with the class by eliciting answers from the students. The teacher should give more chance for the students to talk and interact with the others in class to increase learner's communicative ability.","请学生说出答案，和全班一起核对。老师应多给学生在课堂上说话、和别人互动的机会，提升学习者的沟通能力。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review today's lesson using the books.","(1) 用课本复习今天的课程。",0],["li","(2) Review today's lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Use this time to preview their homework. Write a few examples on the board so that they understand.","利用这段时间预习作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生了解。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and ask the students to write them down in their progress report book.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement in it. This is a good time to give the students reward cards according to their teams' performances today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 5","电话教学教材 5",0],["p","Take out the Activity Book and turn to Lesson 6.2","拿出活动本，翻到第 6 课 6.2。",0],["li","1. What is Peter Pig doing?",null,0],["li","2. What is Judy Giraffe holding?",null,0],["li","3. Is there a cake on the table?",null,0],["li","4. Is there a ball on the table?",null,0],["li","5. Is there a soda on the table?",null,0]],"g":[[28,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 4","Classroom Activities","Lesson 6","Classroom Activities","(55 mins)","Lesson 7: A Birthday Party"]],[33,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 4","Classroom Activities","Lesson 7","Part 1","7.1","Part 2","7.2 A","7.2 B","Part 3","7.3","Part 4","7.4"]],[61,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 4","Classroom Readers"]],[61,["Lesson 6","New Words","Learning & Playing","Translation"]],[96,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["A Birthday Party","So Long, Tina Turtle!"],"bd":"","m":90},{"z":"第 11 课","t":"Class 11","k":"class","p":[41,42,43],"b":[["h3","Goal","目标",1],["p","Using \"Are there...?\" and \"There are....\" To ask and answer questions with prepositions to identify location","能使用 \"Are there...?\" 和 \"There are...\"；能用介词问答，说出位置。",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["p","Extending hospitality Making or declining offers","热情款待别人；提供或婉拒好意",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","Flashcards, digital equipment","单词卡、数字教学设备",1],["h3","Classroom Activities 4A Lesson 8","Classroom Activities 4A 第 8 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Guava, grape(s), watermelon, pineapple",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","Are there ______? There are ______?",null,1],["h3","Phonics","自然拼读",1],["p","\"st\", \"sk\", \"sp\"","“st”“sk”“sp”",1],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson 7","Classroom Readers 第 7 课",1],["p","New Words Yum, so, good morning, Mr. Bump, how, today, fine","新单词：yum, so, good morning, Mr. Bump, how, today, fine",1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","Are there _______? There are ______.",null,1],["h3","EEC 2 Unit 9","EEC 2 第 9 单元",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","Orange juice, salad, chicken, beef, pasta",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","Would you like more pudding?","A",1],["d","No, thank you.","B",1],["d","How about coffee?","A",1],["d","No, thanks. I'm fine.","B",1],["d","What about you?","A",1],["d","No, thank you.","B",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["li","(1) Review the last class using the digital equipment. Have the students look at the touchscreen all-in-one and repeat the sentences.","(1) 用数字教学设备复习上一堂课，请学生看触控一体机并复诵句子。",0],["li","(2) Review the vocabulary from the last class.","(2) 复习上一堂课的单词。",0],["li","(3) Spelling Quiz.","(3) 拼写小测验。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (55 mins) Lesson 8: At The Market","Classroom Activities（55 mins）第 8 课 At the Market 在市场",0],["h2","8.1",null,0],["li","(1) Display the vocabulary using the touchscreen all-in-one and ask the students to listen carefully.","(1) 用触控一体机展示单词，请学生仔细听。",0],["li","(2) Introduce the vocabulary on the monitor. Ask the students to repeat.","(2) 在屏幕上介绍单词，请学生复诵。",0],["li","(3) Draw pictures on the board or use flashcards and practice the sentence pattern without looking at the monitor or the book.","(3) 在黑板上画图或使用单词卡，不看屏幕或课本练习句型。",0],["h2","8.2",null,0],["li","(1) Show various fruits using the monitor, and practice the names of the fruits.","(1) 用屏幕展示各种水果，练习水果的名称。",0],["li","(2) Play the \"Memory game\":","(2) 玩“记忆游戏”：",0],["li","- Separate the class into teams and give one fruit flashcard to each student. Call the names of four fruits at once. The students with the same fruit flashcards must line up in the order they were called. If a students stand in the wrong order, he is out. Play until only one team is left.","- 把全班分队，每位学生发一张水果单词卡。一次喊出四种水果的名称，拿着这些水果单词卡的学生要依照喊出的顺序排好，排错的人出局。玩到只剩一队为止。",0],["h2","8.2 A",null,0],["li","(1) Display the sentences on the monitor and ask the students to listen, then repeat the sentences.","(1) 在屏幕上展示句子，请学生先听再复诵。",0],["li","(2) Ask the students to look at the picture in the book and randomly pick some students to ask or answer the questions.","(2) 请学生看课本上的图片，随机选几位学生提问或回答。",0],["d","Are there apples in the shop?","T",0],["d","Yes. There are apples in the shop.","S",0],["h3","(3) 8.2 A1 Activity Sheet 5","(3) 8.2 A1 活动单 5",0],["p","Let the students paste or draw pictures of various fruits in the boxes on Activity Sheet 5. Then have them write questions and answers in the spaces below. Finally, in groups or pairs, have them ask and answer questions with each other.","请学生在活动单 5 的方格中贴上或画出各种水果，再在下面的空格写出问句和答句。最后分组或两两一组互相问答。",0],["h2","8.2 B",null,0],["li","(1) Use the touchscreen all-in-one to practice asking and answering questions using the target sentence pattern. Click and ask the students to listen to the sentence and randomly ask the students to come up and write the answer.","(1) 用触控一体机练习用目标句型问答。点击播放句子请学生听，再随机请学生上台写出答案。",0],["li","(2) With the same teams ask them to have a race to see who can finish writing the exercise in the book first without a mistake. Points will be given to the first place.","(2) 请同样的分队比赛，看哪一队最先全部答对写完课本上的练习，第一名得分。",0],["li","(3) Go over each question and ask different teams to answer.","(3) 逐题讲评，请不同的队伍回答。",0],["h2","8.3",null,0],["li","(1) Introduce the new phonics sounds \"st\", \"sk\", \"sp\". These sounds are similar. The students might get confused about how to pronounce them. Ask the students to repeat.","(1) 介绍新的发音“st”“sk”“sp”。这些音很像，学生可能会搞不清楚怎么念。请学生复诵。",0],["li","(2) Ask the students to come up and use the touchscreen all-in-one for this exercise.","(2) 请学生上台用触控一体机做这个练习。",0],["li","(3) Read every word out loud and ask the students to repeat.","(3) 大声念出每个字，请学生复诵。",0],["h2","8.4",null,0],["li","(1) Play the sounds on the touchscreen all-in-one and ask the students to fill out the correct answers as a team.","(1) 用触控一体机播放发音，请各队一起填写正确答案。",0],["li","(2) Check the answers of every team and go over the answers together and practice pronouncing the words as a class.","(2) 检查每队的答案，一起核对答案，全班一起练习念这些字。",0],["li","(3) You can also think of some other words with \"st\", \"sk\", \"sp\" and let the students practice.","(3) 也可以想一些其他有“st”“sk”“sp”的单词让学生练习。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers",null,0],["h2","Lesson 7: At the Market (20 mins)","第 7 课 At the Market 在市场（20 mins）",0],["li","(1) Use the monitor to introduce the new words. Ask the students to repeat.","(1) 用屏幕介绍新单词，请学生复诵。",0],["li","(2) First play the entire story on the touchscreen all-in-one and ask the students to listen. Play it a second time, but this time stop after every sentence and ask the students to practice the sentence.","(2) 先用触控一体机播放整个故事让学生听；播放第二次时，每句停下来请学生练习。",0],["li","(3) Use the translation on the touchscreen all-in-one to explain the sentence structure.","(3) 用触控一体机上的翻译说明句子结构。",0],["li","(4) Separate the class into teams. Each team must change the story by changing all of the character names and fruit names. Give them five minutes to think of words to replace the original text. Ask each team to read their new version of the lesson out loud to see which team has the most interesting story.","(4) 把全班分队，每队要改编故事，把所有角色名字和水果名称都换掉。给他们五分钟想替换原文的字，再请每队大声念出改编版，看哪一队的故事最有趣。",0],["li","(5) Ask the whole class to read the story one more time.","(5) 请全班再一起念一次故事。",0],["h2","EEC",null,0],["h3","What Can I do? (15 mins)","What Can I Do?（15 mins）",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the dialog using the MP3 as a quick review.","用 MP3 播放对话，作为快速复习。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Explain the meaning of each topic in \"What can I do?\" and let them check the appropriate box. Allow five minutes for the students to do the exercise and select a few students to report their self-evaluation to the class.","解释“What Can I Do?”中每个项目的意思，让学生在适当的方格打钩。给学生五分钟做这个练习，再选几位学生向全班报告自己的自我评估。",0],["li","Step 3:","步骤 3：",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group do a mini role-play of the dialog. Each group needs to demonstrate in front the class, and the teacher needs to make sure everyone can do the conversation with ease. Also, pay attention to the students' pronunciation and intonation.","让学生两两一组，各组进行本单元对话的小型角色扮演。每一组都要到全班面前表演，老师要确认每个人都能轻松进行对话，同时注意学生的发音和语调。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review today's lesson using the books.","(1) 用课本复习今天的课程。",0],["li","(2) Review today's lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Write a few examples on the board so that they understand.","利用这段时间预习作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生了解。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board. Ask the students to write them down in their progress report books.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement on it. It is a good time to give the students reward cards according to their teams' performances today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0]],"g":[[27,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 4","Classroom Activities","Lesson 7"]],[40,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","Book 4","Classroom Activities","Lesson 8","Part 1","8.1","Part 2","8.2","8.2 A","8.2 B","Part 3","8.3","Part 4","8.4"]],[60,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 4","Classroom Readers","Lesson 7","New Words","Learning & Playing","Translation"]],[75,["●Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["At The Market"],"bd":"","m":95},{"z":"第 12 课","t":"Class 12","k":"class","p":[44,45,46,47],"b":[["h3","Goal","目标",1],["p","Review asking and answering questions using prepositions to identify locations","复习用介词问答，说出位置",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["p","Taking turns Making or agreeing with objections Offering turns to others","轮流；提出或同意反对意见；让别人先轮",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","Flashcards, digital equipment, a picture of a shop with all kinds of food in it","单词卡、数字教学设备、一张有各种食物的商店图片",1],["h3","Classroom Activities 4A Lesson 9","Classroom Activities 4A 第 9 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Bread, sandwiches, cookies, doughnuts",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","Is there ______? Are there ______?",null,1],["h3","Phonics","自然拼读",1],["p","\"br\", \"cr\", \"dr\", \"tr\"","“br”“cr”“dr”“tr”",1],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson 8","Classroom Readers 第 8 课",1],["p","New Words Sell, selling, fruit, proud of","新单词：sell, selling, fruit, proud of",1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","Present continuous, There are ________.","现在进行时，There are ___.",1],["h3","EEC 2 Unit 10","EEC 2 第 10 单元",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","Waste basket, shelf, piece, board game, dice",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["p","See And Say",null,1],["d","It's my turn to play.","A",1],["d","No, it's mine.","B",1],["d","Are you sure?","A",1],["d","Yes, I am after Bill.","B",1],["d","OK. You go first.","A",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["li","(1) Review the last class using digital teaching. Have the students look at the touchscreen all-in-one and repeat the sentences.","(1) 用数字教学复习上一堂课，请学生看触控一体机并复诵句子。",0],["li","(2) Review the vocabulary from the last class.","(2) 复习上一堂课的单词。",0],["li","(3) Spelling Quiz.","(3) 拼写小测验。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities",null,0],["h2","Lesson 9: The Bakery (50 mins)","第 9 课 The Bakery 面包店（50 mins）",0],["h2","9.1",null,0],["li","(1) Display the vocabulary on the touchscreen all-in-one and ask the students to listen carefully.","(1) 用触控一体机展示单词，请学生仔细听。",0],["li","(2) Introduce the vocabulary on the monitor. Ask the students to repeat.","(2) 在屏幕上介绍单词，请学生复诵。",0],["li","(3) Draw pictures on the board or use flashcards and practice the sentence pattern without looking at the monitor or the book.","(3) 在黑板上画图或使用单词卡，不看屏幕或课本练习句型。",0],["h2","9.2",null,0],["li","(1) Show the words on the monitor and ask the students to listen, then repeat the words.","(1) 在屏幕上展示单词，请学生先听再复诵。",0],["li","(2) Ask the students to look at the picture in the book and randomly pick some students to ask or answer the questions. Make sure to explain the difference between countable and uncountable again.","(2) 请学生看课本上的图片，随机选几位学生提问或回答。一定要再说明一次可数和不可数的差别。",0],["d","Is there soda in the bakery?","T",0],["d","No there isn't. There is no soda in the bakery.","S",0],["d","Are there cookies in the bakery?","T",0],["d","Yes, there are. There are cookies in the bakery.","S",0],["li","(3) Use the picture on the monitor to introduce the key sentence structure.","(3) 用屏幕上的图片介绍重点句子结构。",0],["h2","9.3 A&B",null,0],["li","(1) Use the touchscreen all-in-one to practice asking and answering questions using the target sentence pattern. Show the questions on the monitor by clicking \"A\" and randomly pick out students to answer them. Ask them to click \"B\" for the answer.","(1) 用触控一体机练习用目标句型问答。点击“A”在屏幕上显示问题，随机选学生回答，再请他们点击“B”看答案。",0],["li","(2) Separate the class into teams and tell them to ask each other questions. For every question asked or answered correctly, the team(s) may get some points.","(2) 把全班分队，请他们互相问问题，每正确提问或回答一题，该队就可以得分。",0],["li","(3) Go over each question and ask different teams to answer","(3) 逐题讲评，请不同的队伍回答。",0],["h2","9.4 A&B",null,0],["p",".",null,0],["li","(1) Ask the students to look at their own books and listen to the touchscreen all-in-one. The students should try to answer the questions by looking only at the book, not at the touchscreen all-in-one.","(1) 请学生看自己的课本并听触控一体机，只看课本、不看触控一体机试着回答问题。",0],["li","(2) Ask the same teams to write the questions and answers on a piece of paper. Compete to see which team can do all eight questions from part A & B correctly.","(2) 请同样的分队把问句和答句写在纸上，比赛看哪一队能把 A、B 部分的八题全部答对。",0],["li","(3) Go over each question on the touchscreen all-in-one and give some points to the team that did everything correctly.","(3) 在触控一体机上逐题核对，全部答对的队伍可以得分。",0],["li","(4) Play the \"making a hamburger\" game Draw different pieces of a hamburger on a paper (e.g. hamburger bread, meat, lettuce, ketchup, etc.) and cut them into pieces. With the same teams, use the picture of a shop with all kinds of food in the picture to ask them different questions. When the answer is correct, that team may get a piece of hamburger. The team that can first get all the pieces of a hamburger wins.","(4) 玩“做汉堡”游戏：在纸上画出汉堡的各个部分（例如汉堡面包、肉片、生菜、番茄酱等）并剪开。用同样的分队，用那张有各种食物的商店图片问各队不同的问题，答对的队伍可以得到一片汉堡，最先凑齐汉堡所有部分的队伍获胜。",0],["h2","9.5",null,0],["li","(1) The \"r\" sound may be a bit difficult for some of the students, so make sure to let the students repeat after you a few times.","(1) “r”的音对有些学生来说可能有点难，一定要让学生跟着您多复诵几次。",0],["li","(2) Play the sounds on the touchscreen all-in-one and practice with the students.","(2) 用触控一体机播放发音，和学生一起练习。",0],["h2","9.6",null,0],["li","(1) Play the sounds from the touchscreen all-in-one and ask the students to fill out the correct answers as a team.","(1) 用触控一体机播放发音，请各队一起填写正确答案。",0],["li","(2) Check the answers of every team. If correct then more points may be given to the team. Go over the answers together and practice pronouncing the words as a class.","(2) 检查每队的答案，答对可以多得分。一起核对答案，全班一起练习念这些字。",0],["li","(3) You can also think of some other words with \"br\", \"cr\", \"dr\", and \"tr,\" and let the students practice.","(3) 也可以想一些其他有“br”“cr”“dr”“tr”的单词让学生练习。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers",null,0],["h2","Lesson 8: Good Apples and Good Bananas (20 mins)","第 8 课 Good Apples and Good Bananas 好苹果和好香蕉（20 mins）",0],["li","(1) Use the monitor to introduce the new words. Ask the students to repeat.","(1) 用屏幕介绍新单词，请学生复诵。",0],["li","(2) First, play the entire story on the touchscreen all-in-one and ask the students to listen. Play it a second time, but this time stop after every sentence and ask the students to practice the sentence.","(2) 先用触控一体机播放整个故事让学生听；播放第二次时，每句停下来请学生练习。",0],["li","(3) Use the translation on the touchscreen all-in-one to explain the sentence structure.","(3) 用触控一体机上的翻译说明句子结构。",0],["li","(4) Acting activity:","(4) 表演活动：",0],["li","- Each team has to pick a kind of fruit and think of a few sentences to sell their fruit. Example: Team A: There are apples in my shop. My apples are good. They are red and I am proud of my apples.","- 每队选一种水果，想几个句子来推销自己的水果。例如：A 队：There are apples in my shop. My apples are good. They are red and I am proud of my apples.",0],["li","- Give 3 minutes to let the students prepare. Points will be given to the team that can sell the most fruit.","- 给学生 3 分钟准备，卖出最多水果的队伍得分。",0],["h2","EEC",null,0],["h2","Motivation (15 mins)","导入 Motivation（15 mins）",0],["p","This is the time to warm up the class up by providing the students with a general picture of the lesson that they are going to learn today. Make sure all the students have a general idea about today's lesson before going to the next part of Let's See And Say. Let's See And Say","这是让全班热身的时间，让学生对今天要学的课程有整体的概念。进入“Let's See & Say”之前，请确认所有学生对今天的课程都有大致的了解。Let's See And Say：",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Introduction:","引导：",0],["p","The teacher introduces the lesson to the class by having the students listen to the Let's See and Say monolog. You can either read the monolog, or use the MP3. Let's See & Say: Monolog What do you like to do after school? Do you like to play games with your friends? What kind of games do you like to play? Now, let's go and see what the boys are doing in the room.","老师让学生听“Let's See and Say”的独白，向全班介绍本课。可以自己念，或使用 MP3。Let's See & Say 独白：What do you like to do after school? Do you like to play games with your friends? What kind of games do you like to play? Now, let's go and see what the boys are doing in the room.",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Have the class guess and predict about the theme and the words that relate to this lesson based on the monolog they have just listened to. Encourage the students to use their imagination and give them a chance to share their ideas in class. Write the students' ideas on the board and add the points you also want to emphasize for this lesson. Then play the dialog to the class for the first time and have the students listen to the dialog carefully.","请全班根据刚听到的独白，猜测并预测与本课相关的主题和单词。鼓励学生发挥想象力，并给他们机会在课堂上分享自己的想法。把学生的想法写在黑板上，并补充您想在本课强调的重点。接着第一次播放对话，请学生仔细聆听。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the dialog to the class for the second time and have the students repeat after the narrator. Remind the students to listen carefully to the narrator's pronunciation and intonation while practicing each sentence of the dialogue. The teacher also needs to listen carefully to the students' pronunciation and intonation and give help if necessary.","第二次播放对话，请学生跟着录音复诵。提醒学生练习每一句对话时，仔细听录音的发音和语调。老师也要仔细听学生的发音和语调，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Introduce the theme of the lesson to the class again by combining the dialog that the students have just practiced and the core vocabulary of this lesson. (The teacher can play or read the dialogue to the class again if necessary.) Make sure all the students are familiar with the dialog and vocabulary and able to do the conversation with each other. At this stage, the teacher should also tell the students about the possible situations where they can apply this type of conversation in real life.","结合学生刚练习过的对话和本课的核心单词，再次向全班介绍本课主题。（必要时老师可以再播放或念一次对话。）确认所有学生都熟悉对话和单词，并能互相进行对话。这个阶段老师也应该告诉学生，在现实生活中有哪些情境可以用到这类对话。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group practice the conversation for a comprehension check.","让学生两两一组，各组练习对话，检查理解程度。",0],["h3","Step 6","步骤 6",0],["p","Remind the students to review the lesson at home by listening to the MP3 and encourage them to practice the dialogue with their family or friends before coming to the next class.","提醒学生回家听 MP3 复习本课，并鼓励他们在下次上课前和家人或朋友练习对话。",0],["h2","Reinforcement ●","加强复习 Reinforcement",0],["h3","(10 mins)","（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review today's lesson using the books.","(1) 用课本复习今天的课程。",0],["li","(2) Review today's lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Write a few examples on the board so that they understand.","利用这段时间预习作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生了解。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board. Ask the students to write them down in their progress report books.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement on it. It is a good time to give students reward cards according to their teams' performances today","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 6","电话教学教材 6",0],["li","1. Is there any soda in your house?",null,0],["li","2. Is there a dog in your house?",null,0],["li","3. Are there grapes in your house?",null,0],["li","4. Is there a cat in your house?",null,0],["li","5. Are there any pineapples in your house?",null,0]],"g":[[32,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 4","Classroom Activities","Lesson 9","Part 1","9.1"]],[37,["Part 2","9.2","Part 3","9.3 A","9.3 B","Part 4","9.4 A","9.4 B","Part 5","9.5","Part 6","9.6"]],[63,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 4","Classroom Readers","Lesson 8","New Words","Learning & Playing","Translation"]],[86,["Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["The Bakery","Good Apples and Good Bananas"],"bd":"","m":95},{"z":"第 13 课","t":"Class 13","k":"class","p":[48,49,50],"b":[["h3","Goal","目标",1],["p","Review all the grammar from lesson 6-9","复习第 6–9 课的所有语法",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["p","Taking turns Making or agreeing with objections Offering turns to others","轮流；提出或同意反对意见；让别人先轮",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","Flashcards, digital equipment","单词卡、数字教学设备",1],["h3","Classroom Activities 4A Lesson 9","Classroom Activities 4A 第 9 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Vocabulary from lessons 6-9","第 6–9 课的单词",1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","Sentence pattern from lessons 6-9","第 6–9 课的句型",1],["h3","Phonics","自然拼读",1],["p","Phonics from lessons 6-9","第 6–9 课的发音",1],["h3","EEC 2 Unit 10","EEC 2 第 10 单元",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","Wastebasket, shelf, piece, board game, dice",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["p","See And Say",null,1],["d","It's my turn to play.","A",1],["d","No, it's mine.","B",1],["d","Are you sure?","A",1],["d","Yes, I am after Bill.","B",1],["d","OK. You go first.","A",1],["h2","Warm up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["li","(1) Review the last class using digital teaching. Have the students look at the touchscreen all-in-one and repeat the sentences.","(1) 用数字教学复习上一堂课，请学生看触控一体机并复诵句子。",0],["li","(2) Review the vocabulary from the last class.","(2) 复习上一堂课的单词。",0],["li","(3) Spelling Quiz.","(3) 拼写小测验。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities Lesson 10: Around Town (50 mins)","Classroom Activities 第 10 课 Around Town 城里走走（50 mins）",0],["h2","10.1",null,0],["li","(1) Make copies of the pictures on 10.1 for each student.","(1) 把 10.1 的图片复印给每位学生。",0],["li","(2) Practice one question with the class:","(2) 和全班一起练习一题：",0],["d","Where is Miss Honey going?","T",0],["d","She's going to the flower shop.","S",0],["li","(3) Ask the class to look at the picture and try to write down all the questions and answers by themselves.","(3) 请全班看图，试着自己写出所有问句和答句。",0],["li","(4) Call on some students and ask them to read their questions and answers out loud. Go over all the questions together and open the textbook to check all the answers.","(4) 点几位学生大声念出他们的问句和答句。一起把所有题目看一遍，再打开课本核对答案。",0],["li","(5) Use the touchscreen all-in-one to review the sentence pattern.","(5) 用触控一体机复习句型。",0],["h2","10.2",null,0],["li","(1) Show the questions using the monitor and ask the students to come up and try to answer the questions.","(1) 用屏幕展示问题，请学生上台试着回答。",0],["li","(2) In groups of 3 ask them to fill out the rest of the answers.","(2) 三人一组完成其余的答案。",0],["li","(3) Give each team a piece of paper and tell them to draw a picture of someone doing something. Then the other teams have to look at the pictures and try to figure out the answers.","(3) 每队发一张纸，请他们画出某人正在做某件事，再让其他队看图试着说出答案。",0],["h2","10.3",null,0],["li","(1) Review all the sounds by listening to the touchscreen all-in-one.","(1) 听触控一体机复习所有的音。",0],["li","(2) This is a good time to check if they understand all the phonics from previous lessons.","(2) 这是检查学生是否了解之前所有发音的好时机。",0],["li","(3) Give a short pop quiz on phonics. Then ask the students to repeat all the questions in this section after you.","(3) 进行一个简短的突击发音小测验，再请学生跟着您复诵这部分的所有题目。",0],["h2","10.4",null,0],["li","(1) Play the sounds using the touchscreen all-in-one and ask the students to fill out the answers.","(1) 用触控一体机播放发音，请学生填写答案。",0],["li","(2) Ask each student to write the answer on the board and try to sound out the words.","(2) 请每位学生把答案写在黑板上，并试着念出这些字。",0],["li","(3) The students repeat after you for a final review of these phonics sounds.","(3) 请学生跟着您复诵，最后复习一次这些发音。",0],["h2","10.5",null,0],["li","(1) Quickly explain the lyrics and practice saying all the words.","(1) 快速说明歌词，练习念所有的字。",0],["li","(2) Listen to the song on the touchscreen all-in-one. Then ask the class to follow along.","(2) 用触控一体机听这首歌，再请全班跟着唱。",0],["li","(3) Divide the students into groups and have a race to see who can sing the loudest without mistakes.","(3) 把学生分组比赛，看哪一组能唱得最大声又不出错。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Let's Check",null,0],["h3","Listening Comprehension","听力理解",0],["p","Note: For the listening exercises, the teacher needs to read the words to the students for exercise 1 (please refer to the appendix for the script) and play the MP3 to the class for exercise 2. For exercise 3, the teacher should give the instruction first and have the students do the exercise by themselves.","注意：听力练习的第 1 题，老师需要念单词给学生听（稿件请参考附录）；第 2 题播放 MP3 给全班听；第 3 题由老师先说明，再让学生自己完成。",0],["li","(1) Listen to the words and write down the number in the circle next to the picture.","(1) 听单词，把数字写在图片旁边的圆圈里。",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Quickly review the dialog that the students have learned from the previous class. Teachers can do the conversation with the students by being \"A\" and have the students be \"B\". Do it again, switching roles.","快速复习学生上一堂课学过的对话。老师可以扮演“A”、学生扮演“B”进行对话，再交换角色练习一次。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Attract the students' attention by saying, \" Open your book to page ___ and take out your pencil.\" \"Pay careful attentions to what your teacher says and write the number according to the word you hear.\"","说“Open your book to page ___ and take out your pencil.”“Pay careful attention to what your teacher says and write the number according to the word you hear.”吸引学生的注意。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Read the words to the students and have them to listen to you and do the exercise. (The teacher can read the words to the class again if necessary.) Take a look around and check the correct answers with the students.","念单词给学生听，请他们边听边做练习。（必要时老师可以再念一次。）巡视教室，和学生一起核对正确答案。",0],["li","(2) Listen and match","(2) 听一听，连连看",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the monolog. Let's Check: Monolog What can you see in the classroom? Please turn to page 42, Let's Check. Listen and match. Let's practice the vocabulary together.","播放独白。Let's Check 独白：What can you see in the classroom? Please turn to page 42, Let's Check. Listen and match. Let's practice the vocabulary together.",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Tell the class the name of each picture and have them repeat after you.","告诉全班每张图片的名称，请他们跟着您复诵。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Explain that they have to match the pictures while listening to the mp3. Continue to play the MP3 to the class for the listening exercise.","说明他们要边听 MP3 边把图片配对。接着继续播放 MP3 进行听力练习。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Take a look around and make sure all the students can do the exercise while playing the MP3 to the class.","播放 MP3 时巡视教室，确认所有学生都会做这个练习。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","As soon as they finish, start the correction by telling them the answers and help them to correct their mistakes. (The teacher can play the dialog again if necessary.)","学生一完成就开始订正：告诉他们答案，并帮助他们改正错误。（必要时老师可以再播放一次对话。）",0],["li","(3) Exercise: Connect the things you have to \"Your Room\"","(3) 练习：把你拥有的东西连到“Your Room”",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Explain exercise 3 by referring to the exercise heading of the lesson. Make sure your explanation is clear enough for the students to do the exercise by themselves. Take a look around while the students are doing the exercise and give help if necessary.","参考本课练习的标题说明第 3 题，确认说明够清楚，让学生能自己完成。学生做练习时巡视教室，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Check the answers with the class by eliciting the answers from the students. The teacher should give more chance for the students to talk and interact with the others in class to increase learner's communicative ability.","请学生说出答案，和全班一起核对。老师应多给学生在课堂上说话、和别人互动的机会，提升学习者的沟通能力。",0],["h2","Reinforcement","加强复习 Reinforcement",0],["h2","1-Total Review (10 mins)","1. 总复习（10 mins）",0],["li","(1) Review the lessons using the books.","(1) 用课本复习课程。",0],["li","(2) Review the lessons using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习课程。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Write a few examples on the board so that they understand.","利用这段时间预习作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生了解。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board. Ask the students to write them down in their progress report books","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement in it. It is a good time to give the students reward cards according to their teams' performances.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0]],"g":[[23,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 4","Classroom Activities","Lesson 9"]],[28,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 4","Classroom Activities"]],[28,["Lesson 10","Part 1","10.1","Part 2","10.2","Part 3","10.3","Part 4","10.4","Part 5","10.5"]],[80,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["Around Town"],"bd":"","m":85},{"z":"第 14 课","t":"Class 14","k":"class","p":[51,52],"b":[["h2","Review Day 2","复习日 2",0],["p","Goals: Review for Test 2","目标：准备测验 2",0],["h3","EEC",null,0],["p","Taking turns Making or agreeing with objections Offering turns to others","轮流；提出或同意反对意见；让别人先轮",0],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",0],["p","Flashcards, tape recorder, S4 listening lab tape, copy of the test Classroom Readers","单词卡、录音机、S4 听力练习录音带、测验卷复印件。Classroom Readers",0],["h3","Review lesson 6 to lesson 8","复习第 6 课到第 8 课",0],["p","Classroom Activities",null,0],["h3","Review lesson 6 to lesson 10","复习第 6 课到第 10 课",0],["h3","EEC",null,0],["h3","vocabulary","单词",0],["p","Wastebasket, shelf, piece, board game, dice",null,0],["h3","dialogue","对话",0],["p","See And Say",null,0],["d","It's my turn to play.","A",0],["d","No, it's mine.","B",0],["d","Are you sure?","A",0],["d","Yes, I am after Bill.","B",0],["d","OK. You go first.","A",0],["h2","Review ( 20 mins)","复习 Review（20 mins）",0],["li","(1) Use this time to catch up on lessons or areas some of the students did not have time for in the first six classes. If the students are caught up, spend this time reviewing previous lessons or areas where students seem to be having difficulty. Do this using drills, games or any activity that you feel will help the students. Choose the activities that students were interested in during the first five classes.","(1) 利用这段时间补上之前课程中，部分学生还没来得及完成的部分。如果学生进度都跟上了，就用这段时间复习之前的课程，或学生似乎有困难的部分。可以通过操练、游戏或任何您认为对学生有帮助的活动进行，选择学生之前感兴趣的活动。",0],["li","(2) Review all the vocabulary.","(2) 复习所有单词。",0],["li","(3) Review all the sentence patterns.","(3) 复习所有句型。",0],["li","(4) Review all the phonics sounds.","(4) 复习所有发音。",0],["h2","Quiz (30 mins)","小测验 Quiz（30 mins）",0],["li","(1) Have the students put all books and unnecessary things away. Hand out the quiz and have the students do it.","1. 请学生把所有书本和不需要的东西收起来，发下考卷让学生作答。",0],["li","(2) Make sure that the students know the meaning of each item.","2. 确认学生了解每一题的意思。",0],["li","(3) Walk around the classroom and check the quiz to avoid misunderstanding.","(3) 在教室里走动检查考卷，避免学生误解题意。",0],["li","(4) The students can't talk or cheat during the quiz. If the students don't get good grades, the student has to make it up in the next class (you can have your own grading standard).","(4) 小测验时学生不能说话或作弊。成绩不理想的学生，下次上课要补考（您可以自定评分标准）。",0],["h2","Listening Quiz (30 mins)","听力小测验 Listening Quiz（30 mins）",0],["li","(1) Check the tape and the recorder before the students come back from the break, prepare for the listening quiz.","(1) 在学生下课休息回来前，先检查录音带和录音机，准备听力小测验。",0],["li","(2) Turn on the tape and have the students fill in the appropriate blanks.","(2) 播放录音带，请学生在适当的空格中作答。",0],["li","(3) Play the tape a few times. The students need to listen carefully.","(3) 录音带可以多播几次，学生要仔细听。",0],["li","(4) Listening is a very important aspect of learning a new language.","(4) 听力是学习新语言非常重要的一环。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["p","What Can I do?","What Can I Do?",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the dialog using the MP3 as a quick review.","用 MP3 播放对话，作为快速复习。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Explain the meaning of each topic in \"What Can I do?\" and let them check the appropriate box. Allow five minutes for the students to do the exercise and select a few students to report their self-evaluation to the class.","解释“What Can I Do?”中每个项目的意思，让学生在适当的方格打钩。给学生五分钟做这个练习，再选几位学生向全班报告自己的自我评估。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group do a mini role-play of the dialog. Each group needs to demonstrate in front the class, and the teacher needs to make sure everyone can do the conversation with ease. Also, pay attention to the students' pronunciation and intonation.","让学生两两一组，各组进行本单元对话的小型角色扮演。每一组都要到全班面前表演，老师要确认每个人都能轻松进行对话，同时注意学生的发音和语调。",0],["h2","Reinforcement ( 5 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（5 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review the lessons using the books.","(1) 用课本复习课程。",0],["li","(2) Review the lessons using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习课程。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","It is a good time to remind the students to correct mistakes they have made from all the previous homework.","这是提醒学生订正之前所有作业错误的好时机。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board. Ask the students to write them down in their progress report book.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement in it. It is a good time to give the students reward cards according to their team's performance.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","(3) Remind the students about test # 2.","(3) 提醒学生准备测验 2。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 7","电话教学教材 7",0],["li","1. Are there chairs in your house?",null,0],["li","2. Is there juice in your school bag?",null,0],["li","3. Is your mother holding a basket now?",null,0],["li","4. Is there cake on the table?",null,0],["li","5. What is your father doing now?",null,0]],"g":[[19,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 4","Classroom Activities","Lesson 6- Lesson 10","Book 4","Classroom Readers","Lesson 6- Lesson 8"]],[43,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Review Day","m":100},{"z":"第 15 课","t":"Class 15","k":"class","p":[53],"b":[["h2","Test Day 2","测验日 2",0],["p","Classroom Readers 4 & Classroom Activities 4A Test lesson 6 to lesson 10, Test lesson 6 to lesson 8","Classroom Readers 4 和 Classroom Activities 4A：测验第 6 课到第 10 课；测验第 6 课到第 8 课",0],["h2","Review ( 15 mins)","复习 Review（15 mins）",0],["li","(1) Return the quizzes and Listening Labs to your students, after you have corrected them. Remind your students about the mistakes they have made. Help them to understand the correct answers.","(1) 把批改好的小测验和听力练习发还给学生，提醒学生犯过的错误，帮助他们了解正确答案。",0],["li","(2) Use this time to review for the test. Go over any sentence patterns or any other areas where you think that the students may need some review. Ask the students if they have any questions that need to be answered. Don't forget to practice for the oral test.","(2) 利用这段时间为测验做复习，复习任何您认为学生可能需要加强的句型或其他部分。问学生有没有需要回答的问题。别忘了练习口语测验。",0],["h2","Test ( 40 mins)","测验 Test（40 mins）",0],["p","Students should take the entire class to complete the test. Answer any areas that may seem unclear to the students. If they finish early tell them to study for the oral test quietly.","学生应该会用整堂课完成测验。回答学生对任何不清楚部分的问题。如果提早写完，请他们安静地准备口语测验。",0],["h2","Oral Test (3-5 mins per student)","口语测验 Oral Test（每位学生 3–5 分钟）",0],["p","Ask the students to take out their textbooks and review for the oral test. It's better to do the oral test outside of the classroom so the students won't hear the questions. Make sure you don't go too far away from your classroom so you can still keep an eye on your students. Call the students one by one to come out and take the oral test with you. The oral test should account for 20% of the test's total score. However, how many points each question is worth is up to you. You may choose to give some questions more points based on the difficulty. The following is a sample of the oral test for your reference. It's also a good idea to come up with your own oral test since you know the students' strengths and weaknesses.","请学生拿出课本准备口语测验。最好在教室外进行口语测验，以免其他学生听到题目；但不要离教室太远，才能随时注意学生。一个一个叫学生出来和您进行口语测验。口语测验占测验总分的 20%，但每题配分由您决定，可以依难易度给某些题目较高的分数。以下口语测验范例仅供参考；您最了解学生的强项和弱点，自己设计口语测验也是很好的做法。",0],["h2","The Oral Test","口语测验题目",0],["li","1. Are there bananas in the classroom?",null,0],["li","2. What are you doing now?",null,0],["li","3. Is there a supermarket near your house?",null,0],["li","4. What do you like to eat?",null,0],["li","5. Are you taking a shower now?",null,0],["h2","Reinforcement","加强复习 Reinforcement",0],["h2","Progress Report Book","学习进度手册",0],["li","(1) Write down the quiz and listening grade on their report book and ask them to get signatures from their parents. Also ask them to write every mistake 5-10 times for the two quizzes.","(1) 把小测验和听力成绩写在学习进度手册上，请学生带回家给家长签名。也请学生把两次小测验中的每个错误写 5–10 次。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement in it.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。",0]],"g":[[2,["None"]],[5,["None"]],[9,["None"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Test Day","m":55},{"z":"第 16 课","t":"Class 16","k":"class","p":[54,55],"b":[["h2","Activity Day 2","活动日 2",0],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",0],["p","None Classroom Activities &Classroom Readers Review CA lesson 6 to lesson 10, review CR lesson 6 to lesson 8","无。Classroom Activities 和 Classroom Readers：复习 CA 第 6 课到第 10 课、CR 第 6 课到第 8 课",0],["h2","Test Review ( 20 mins)","讲评测验 Test Review（20 mins）",0],["p","After you have handed out the test, ask the students to quietly check their mistakes and tell them to try to correct those mistakes by themselves. Go over some of the most commonly made mistakes and explain the key grammar points again.","发下测验卷后，请学生安静地检查自己的错误，并试着自己订正。讲评一些最常见的错误，再说明一次重要的语法重点。",0],["h2","Games and Activities (30 mins)","游戏与活动 Games and Activities（30 mins）",0],["p","After their second test, the students should get some rest and relax a bit. Play games and activities for the whole class, but of course they have to be related to the materials learned by the students. The following are some games and activities for reference.","第二次测验之后，学生应该休息、放松一下。进行全班性的游戏和活动，当然要和学过的内容相关。以下是一些参考的游戏和活动。",0],["h3","Games","游戏",0],["p","Hungry man- Separate the class into 2 teams. Draw a bar with 7 sections. Draw a hamburger in the middle of the bar and two men on the two sides of the bar. Take turns to ask questions to each team and when the team answers correctly you move the burger one section closer to that team's man. The winner will be the team that can get their man to eat the burger first. Jeopardy game- Play a jeopardy game with the students. There can be several categories for the students to choose from; phonics, grammar, spelling, reading, Q&A, etc. Each category can have 4-5 questions. Depending on the difficulty of each question, different points will be given. You can divide the class into more teams to make it more challenging. Writing on back game- This is a fun game for many kids. Divide the class into 2 or 3 teams, then ask each team to line up in front of the board. After everyone is facing the board, write (with your finger) a word on a student's back. Then they will have to write the words on the next student's back and so on until the person in front of the board has the answer. Ask him to write the answer on the board.","饥饿的人：把全班分成 2 队，画一条分成 7 格的长条，汉堡画在中间，两端各画一个人。轮流问两队问题，答对的队伍就把汉堡往自己那边的人移一格，最先让自己的人吃到汉堡的队伍获胜。危险边缘（Jeopardy）游戏：和学生玩 Jeopardy 游戏，可以有几个类别让学生选择：发音、语法、拼写、阅读、问答等，每个类别 4–5 题，依题目难易给不同分数。可以分成更多队，增加挑战性。背上写字游戏：这是很多孩子喜欢的游戏。把全班分成 2 或 3 队，每队在黑板前排成一排，大家都面向黑板后，用手指在一位学生的背上写一个字，他要写在下一位同学的背上，依此类推，直到站在黑板前的人知道答案，再请他把答案写在黑板上。",0],["h2","Activity - Going to the Supermarket ( 50 mins)","活动：去超市（50 mins）",0],["li","(1) Find a supermarket that is near the school and take your students to the supermarket. It is a good place to educate the students about the many things that one can buy in a supermarket.","(1) 找一家学校附近的超市，带学生去超市。这是教学生认识超市里可以买到许多东西的好地方。",0],["li","(2) Spend some time in different areas of the supermarket and use the time to explain the names of different products.","(2) 在超市的不同区域停留一段时间，说明不同商品的名称。",0],["li","(3) Ask the students to find something they really like from the supermarket and tell them to try finding the English name for it. You can also play a game of naming a few things from the supermarket and with 2-3 teams ask them to find those things as fast as they can.","(3) 请学生在超市找一样自己很喜欢的东西，试着找出它的英文名称。也可以玩个游戏：说出几样超市里的东西，分成 2–3 队，请他们尽快找到这些东西。",0],["li","(4) To wrap up the trip you can let the students buy some snacks out of their own pocket and bring them back to class for a small picnic.","(4) 参观结束前，可以让学生自己掏钱买一些点心，带回教室开个小野餐。",0],["li","(5) After you've returned to class you can ask the students to write down the names of all the products they saw today in the supermarket. The students who can name the most may get some rewards from you.","(5) 回到教室后，请学生写下今天在超市看到的所有商品名称，写出最多的学生可以得到您的奖励。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h3","Progress Report Book","学习进度手册",0],["li","(1) Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement in it. Besides, it is a good time to give students reward cards according to their performance","(1) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","(2) Tell them to preview the next lesson and listen to the tapes at home.","(2) 请学生回家预习下一课并听录音带。",0],["li","(3) Remind the students that there will be a telephone teaching session tonight.","(3) 提醒学生今晚有电话教学。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 8","电话教学教材 8",0],["li","1. Is your mother watching TV?",null,0],["li","2. Is there fruit in your house?",null,0],["li","3. What are you doing now?",null,0],["li","4. How do you spell \"flute\"?",null,0],["li","5. How do you spell \"drink\"?",null,0]],"g":[[3,["None"]],[9,["None"]],[15,["● Follow the same steps","above"]],[20,["None"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Activity Day","m":110},{"z":"第 17 课","t":"Class 17","k":"class","p":[56,57,58,59],"b":[["h3","Goal","目标",1],["p","To tell the location of numbers from 13-19","能说出 13–19 的数字及其位置",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["p","Offering help Expressing one's difficult situation Expressing the ease of a task Expressing or responding to gratitude","主动提供帮忙；表达自己的困难；表达事情很简单；表达并回应感谢",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","Flashcards, digital equipment","单词卡、数字教学设备",1],["h3","Classroom Activities 4B Lesson 11","Classroom Activities 4B 第 11 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Thirteen, fourteen, fifteen, sixteen, seventeen, eighteen, nineteen, number",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","Describe quantity and their location","描述数量和位置",1],["h3","Phonics","自然拼读",1],["p","Long e, short e","长元音 e、短元音 e",1],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson 9","Classroom Readers 第 9 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Or, please, here, twelve, thirteen, give, giving",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","Describe quantity and their location","描述数量和位置",1],["h3","EEC 2 Unit 11","EEC 2 第 11 单元",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","Globe, white board, ruler, map, marker",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["p","See And Say",null,1],["d","Need help?","A",1],["d","Sure. I am stuck on this problem.","B",1],["d","Don't worry.","A",1],["p","Let me show you how to do it.",null,1],["d","I see. It's not that difficult. Thanks.","B",1],["d","You're welcome.","A",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["li","(1) Review the previous classes using digital teaching, especially the present progressive tense. Have the students look at the touchscreen all-in-one and repeat the sentences.","(1) 用数字教学复习之前的课程，特别是现在进行时，请学生看触控一体机并复诵句子。",0],["li","(2) Review the vocabulary from previous classes.","(2) 复习之前课程的单词。",0],["li","(3) Do a short quiz on all the lessons the students have learned so far. This quiz won't count for any part of their grade. However, this should show how much students remember and if they've been reviewing at home.","(3) 针对学生到目前为止学过的所有课程进行一次小测验，不计入成绩，但能看出学生记得多少，以及有没有在家复习。",0],["li","(4) Go over the quiz together and ask them to correct each other's quiz.","(4) 一起讲评小测验，请学生互相批改考卷。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities Lesson 11: The Big Race","Classroom Activities 第 11 课 The Big Race 大赛跑",0],["h2","11.1 (50 mins)","11.1（50 mins）",0],["li","(1) Show the vocabulary using the touchscreen all-in-one and ask the students to listen carefully.","(1) 用触控一体机展示单词，请学生仔细听。",0],["li","(2) Introduce the vocabulary on the monitor. Ask the students to repeat.","(2) 在屏幕上介绍单词，请学生复诵。",0],["li","(3) Draw numbers on the board or use flashcards and practice saying the numbers together.","(3) 在黑板上写数字或使用单词卡，一起练习说数字。",0],["li","(4) Play a quick game of Shotgun- Separate the class into two teams and ask one student from each team to come up front. The students must stand back to back and hold a number flashcard in their hands. They take three steps and turn around to see who can shout out the other person's flashcard first.","(4) 玩个快速的“决斗”：把全班分成两队，每队派一位学生到前面。两人背对背站好，手上各拿一张数字单词卡，走三步后转身，看谁先喊出对方单词卡上的数字。",0],["h2","11.2",null,0],["li","(1) Quickly review all the location prepositions.","(1) 快速复习所有表示位置的介词。",0],["li","(2) Show the monitor and go over the numbers using the monitor.","(2) 打开屏幕，用屏幕练习数字。",0],["li","(3) Ask the students to tell the teacher the location of each number.","(3) 请学生告诉老师每个数字的位置。",0],["h3","(4) Activity Sheet 6","(4) 活动单 6",0],["p","Have the students paste or draw pictures of people in the squares on Activity Sheet 6. Ask them to write answers to the questions at the bottom of the sheet, using prepositions of location. Then have them ask and answer the questions with each other.","请学生在活动单 6 的方格中贴上或画出人物，用表示位置的介词回答活动单下方的问题，再互相问答。",0],["h2","11.2 A",null,0],["li","(1) Have the touchscreen all-in-one say the sentence pattern.","(1) 让触控一体机念出句型。",0],["li","(2) Ask the students to write down the numbers they heard in the correct position.","(2) 请学生把听到的数字写在正确的位置。",0],["li","(3) Practice all the sentences with students using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(3) 用触控一体机和学生一起练习所有句子。",0],["li","(4) Play \"Guessing the numbers\" Separate the class into two teams. Write out a series of numbers on a piece of paper but don't show it to the students. (Example- 18, 13, 11, 17) Tell the location of each number and the students have to guess the numbers and their correct location. The team that can answer first gets some points. Play for a few rounds until they're familiar with the numbers and location prepositions.","(4) 玩“猜数字”：把全班分成两队。在纸上写一串数字但不给学生看（例如：18, 13, 11, 17），说出每个数字的位置，学生要猜出数字和正确位置，最先答对的队伍得分。玩几轮，直到学生熟悉数字和表示位置的介词。",0],["h2","11.2 B",null,0],["li","(1) Use the monitor to show the questions and randomly pick out some students to answer them.","(1) 用屏幕展示问题，随机选几位学生回答。",0],["li","(2) Give the students 3 minutes to do the exercise in the book. This should be an easy one for them.","(2) 给学生 3 分钟做课本上的练习，这对他们应该很简单。",0],["li","(3) Go over the answers together and do a final review of all the numbers.","(3) 一起核对答案，最后再复习一次所有数字。",0],["h2","11.3",null,0],["li","(1) Introduce new phonics sound, long \"e\".","(1) 介绍新的发音：长元音“e”。",0],["li","(2) Explain to the students when they see \"ee\" and \"ea\" in a word the sound will be \"long e\".","(2) 向学生说明：单词中看到“ee”和“ea”时，发长元音 e。",0],["li","(3) Use the monitor to play the sounds and ask the students to listen and then repeat after the touchscreen all-in-one.","(3) 用屏幕播放发音，请学生听并跟着触控一体机复诵。",0],["h2","11.4",null,0],["li","(1) Review the \"short e\" sound.","(1) 复习短元音“e”的音。",0],["li","(2) Have the touchscreen all-in-one say the sound and let the students listen and repeat.","(2) 让触控一体机念出这个音，请学生听并复诵。",0],["li","(3) Think of some other words with the long e or short e sound and ask the students to see if they can tell the difference.","(3) 想一些其他有长元音 e 或短元音 e 的单词，看学生能不能分辨。",0],["h2","11.5",null,0],["li","(1) Play the sounds in the touchscreen all-in-one and ask them to circle the correct answer.","(1) 用触控一体机播放发音，请学生圈出正确答案。",0],["li","(2) Play the sounds again, but this time asks the students to repeat after the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 再播放一次发音，这次请学生跟着触控一体机复诵。",0],["li","(3) Go over all the answers and practice sounding out the words for a final review.","(3) 核对所有答案，最后练习念出这些字作为复习。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers",null,0],["h2","Lesson 9: Apples or Bananas? (20 mins)","第 9 课 Apples or Bananas? 苹果还是香蕉？（20 mins）",0],["li","(1) Use the monitor to introduce the new words. Ask the students to repeat.","(1) 用屏幕介绍新单词，请学生复诵。",0],["li","(2) First play the entire story using the touchscreen all-in-one and ask the students to listen. Play it a second time, but this time stop after every sentence and ask the students to practice the sentence.","(2) 先用触控一体机播放整个故事让学生听；播放第二次时，每句停下来请学生练习。",0],["li","(3) Use the translation in the touchscreen all-in-one to explain the sentence structure.","(3) 用触控一体机上的翻译说明句子结构。",0],["li","(4) Separate the class into two teams and ask them to revise the story by changing all the numbers and the names of fruit they see in the story. Give them 5 minutes. Then ask each team to read their revised story out loud.","(4) 把全班分成两队，请他们改编故事，把故事中所有数字和水果名称都换掉。给他们 5 分钟，再请每队大声念出改编的故事。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Motivation","导入（Motivation）",0],["p","This is the time to warm up the class by providing the students with a general picture of the lesson that they are going to learn today. Make sure all the students have a general idea about today's lesson before going to the next part of Let's See And Say. Let's See And Say","这是让全班热身的时间，让学生对今天要学的课程有整体的概念。进入“Let's See & Say”之前，请确认所有学生对今天的课程都有大致的了解。Let's See And Say：",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["h3","Introduction","引导",0],["p","Have the students to listen to the Let's See and say monologue. Let's See & Say: Monolog The little boy is having trouble with his schoolwork. The teacher is helping him. Let's listen to their conversation.","请学生听“Let's See and Say”的独白。Let's See & Say 独白：The little boy is having trouble with his schoolwork. The teacher is helping him. Let's listen to their conversation.",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Have the class guess and predict about the theme and the words that relate to this lesson based on the monolog they have just listened to. Encourage the students to use their imagination and give them a chance to share their ideas in class. Write the students' ideas on the board and add the points you also want to emphasize for this lesson. Then play the dialog to the class for the first time and have the students listen to the dialog carefully.","请全班根据刚听到的独白，猜测并预测与本课相关的主题和单词。鼓励学生发挥想象力，并给他们机会在课堂上分享自己的想法。把学生的想法写在黑板上，并补充您想在本课强调的重点。接着第一次播放对话，请学生仔细聆听。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the dialogue to the class for the second time and have the students repeat after the narrator. Remind the students to listen carefully to the narrator's pronunciation and intonation while practicing each sentence of the dialogue. The teacher also needs to listen carefully to the students' pronunciation and intonation and give help if it's necessary.","第二次播放对话，请学生跟着录音复诵。提醒学生练习每一句对话时，仔细听录音的发音和语调。老师也要仔细听学生的发音和语调，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Introduce the theme of the lesson to the class again by combining the dialog that the students have just practiced and the core vocabulary of this lesson. (The teacher can play or read the dialog to the class again if necessary.) Make sure all the students are familiar with the dialog and vocabulary and able to do the conversation with each other. At this stage, the teacher should also tell the students about possible situations where they can apply this type of conversation in real life.","结合学生刚练习过的对话和本课的核心单词，再次向全班介绍本课主题。（必要时老师可以再播放或念一次对话。）确认所有学生都熟悉对话和单词，并能互相进行对话。这个阶段老师也应该告诉学生，在现实生活中有哪些情境可以用到这类对话。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group practice the conversation for a comprehension check.","让学生两两一组，各组练习对话，检查理解程度。",0],["li","Step 6:","步骤 6：",0],["p","Remind the students to review the lesson at home by listening to the MP3 and encourage them to practice the dialogue with their family or friends before coming to the next class.","提醒学生回家听 MP3 复习本课，并鼓励他们在下次上课前和家人或朋友练习对话。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review today's lesson using the books.","(1) 用课本复习今天的课程。",0],["li","(2) Review today's lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Write a few examples on the board so that they understand.","利用这段时间预习作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生了解。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board. Let the students write them down in their progress report book.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress report book individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement on it. Besides, it is a good time to give the students reward cards according to their teams' performance.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0]],"g":[[29,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 4","Classroom Activities","Lesson 6-10","Classroom Readers","Lesson 6-8"]],[35,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids"]],[35,["儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 4","Classroom Activities","Lesson 11","Part 1","11.1","Part 2","11.2","11.2 A","11.2 B","Part 3","11.3"]],[55,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 4","Classroom Activities","Part 4","11.4","Part 5","11.5"]],[68,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 4","Classroom Readers","Lesson 9","New Words","Learning & Playing","Translation"]],[90,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["The Big Race","Apples or Bananas?"],"bd":"","m":105},{"z":"第 18 课","t":"Class 18","k":"class","p":[60,61,62,63],"b":[["h3","Goal","目标",1],["p","To ask and answer questions about the price of a product","能问答商品的价格",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["p","Offering help Expressing one's difficulty Expressing the ease of a task Expressing or responding to gratitude","主动提供帮忙；表达自己的困难；表达事情很简单；表达并回应感谢",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","Flashcards, digital equipment","单词卡、数字教学设备",1],["h3","Classroom Activities 4B Lesson 12","Classroom Activities 4B 第 12 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Twenty, thirty, forty, fifty, twenty-one, thirty-two, forty-three, fifty-four, 20-50",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","How much is ________? How much are ________?",null,1],["h3","Phonics","自然拼读",1],["p","\"f\"",null,1],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson 10","Classroom Readers 第 10 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","How much, dollars, thirty, fifty, right, thank, again, soon",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","How much is ________? How much are ________?",null,1],["h3","EEC 2 Unit 11","EEC 2 第 11 单元",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","Globe, white board, ruler, map, marker Dialog See And Say","globe, white board, ruler, map, marker。对话：See And Say",1],["d","Need help?","A",1],["d","Sure. I am stuck on this problem.","B",1],["d","Don't worry.","A",1],["p","Let me show you how to do it.",null,1],["d","I see. It's not that difficult. Thanks.","B",1],["d","You're welcome.","A",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["li","(1) Review the previous class using digital teaching. Have the students look at the touchscreen all-in-one and repeat the sentences.","(1) 用数字教学复习上一堂课，请学生看触控一体机并复诵句子。",0],["li","(2) Review the vocabulary from the last class.","(2) 复习上一堂课的单词。",0],["li","(3) Do a vocabulary quiz on numbers.","(3) 进行数字的单词小测验。",0],["li","(4) Go over the quiz together and ask them to correct each other's quiz.","(4) 一起讲评小测验，请学生互相批改考卷。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (50 mins) Lesson 12: At the Night","Classroom Activities（50 mins）第 12 课 At the Night",0],["h2","Market","Market 在夜市",0],["h2","12.1",null,0],["li","(1) Show the vocabulary using the touchscreen all-in-one and ask the students to listen carefully.","(1) 用触控一体机展示单词，请学生仔细听。",0],["li","(2) Introduce the vocabulary on the monitor. Ask the students to repeat.","(2) 在屏幕上介绍单词，请学生复诵。",0],["li","(3) Draw pictures on the board or use flashcards and practice the sentence patterns without looking at the monitor or the book.","(3) 在黑板上画图或使用单词卡，不看屏幕或课本练习句型。",0],["h2","12.2",null,0],["li","(1) Use the pictures on the touchscreen all-in-one to practice the sentence patterns with the students.","(1) 用触控一体机上的图片和学生练习句型。",0],["d","How much are those books?","Teacher",0],["d","They are forty-eight yuan.","Students",0],["li","(2) Draw a few things such as candy, chairs, tables, etc. and label them with prices. Ask the students \"How much is/are ________?\"","(2) 画几样东西，例如糖果、椅子、桌子等，标上价格，问学生 \"How much is/are ___?\"",0],["h2","12.2 A",null,0],["li","(1) Show the sentences on the monitor and ask the students to listen. Then, repeat the sentences.","(1) 在屏幕上展示句子，请学生听并复诵。",0],["li","(2) Ask the students to look at the picture in the book and randomly pick some students to ask or answer the questions.","(2) 请学生看课本上的图片，随机选几位学生提问或回答。",0],["li","(3) Play \"Guessing the price\" game - Prepare a few things like candy, chocolate, coke, cookies, etc. Label them with price tags (you can set the price range from 10-100 in increments of 10). Divide the class into two teams and have them take turns guessing the correct price for each item. The team may get whatever item they guess correctly. You can also use the location preposition to give hints.","(3) 玩“猜价格”游戏：准备几样东西，例如糖果、巧克力、可乐、饼干等，贴上价格标签（价格范围可以设定在 10–100，以 10 为单位）。把全班分成两队，轮流猜每样东西的正确价格，猜对的队伍可以得到那样东西。也可以用表示位置的介词给提示。",0],["d","How much is this coca cola?","Teacher",0],["d","It is 30 yuan.","Team A",0],["d","Very close, the price is between 10 and 30. Guess again.","Teacher",0],["d","It is 20 yuan.","Team A",0],["h2","12.2 B",null,0],["li","(1) Use the touchscreen all-in-one to practice asking and answering the target sentence pattern.","(1) 用触控一体机练习用目标句型问答。",0],["li","(2) With the same team ask them to write the answer on the board and check the answers using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 请同样的分队把答案写在黑板上，再用触控一体机核对答案。",0],["li","(3) Go over each question and ask different teams to answer.","(3) 逐题讲评，请不同的队伍回答。",0],["li","(4) Give the class 5 minutes to write the exercise in the book and try to check individually to see if they really understood.","(4) 给全班 5 分钟写课本上的练习，并试着个别检查，看学生是否真的懂了。",0],["h2","12.3",null,0],["li","(1) Play the sounds on the touchscreen all-in-one and ask the students to listen carefully.","(1) 用触控一体机播放发音，请学生仔细听。",0],["li","(2) The \"f\" sound is easy to pronounce, but make sure the students don't pronounce \"v\" instead of \"f\".","(2) “f”的音很容易发，但要确认学生不要把“f”念成“v”。",0],["li","(3) Practice the words by repeating after the touchscreen all-in-one.","(3) 跟着触控一体机复诵练习这些单词。",0],["h2","12.4",null,0],["li","(1) Review the \"f\" sound.","(1) 复习“f”的音。",0],["li","(2) Play the touchscreen all-in-one and ask the students to listen then check the correct answers.","(2) 播放触控一体机，请学生听并勾选正确答案。",0],["li","(3) Go over all the answers and randomly pick some students to answer the questions.","(3) 核对所有答案，随机选几位学生回答问题。",0],["li","(4) Think of some other words with the \"f\" sound and let the students practice.","(4) 想一些其他有“f”音的单词让学生练习。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (20 mins)","Classroom Readers（20 mins）",0],["p","Lesson 10: Thank You, Mr. Bump","第 10 课 Thank You, Mr. Bump 谢谢你，Bump 先生",0],["li","(1) Use the monitor to introduce the new words. Ask the students to repeat after the teacher.","(1) 用屏幕介绍新单词，请学生跟着老师复诵。",0],["li","(2) First play the entire story on the touchscreen all-in-one and ask the students to listen. Play it a second time, but this time stop after every sentence and ask the students to practice the sentence.","(2) 先用触控一体机播放整个故事让学生听；播放第二次时，每句停下来请学生练习。",0],["li","(3) Use the Translation in the touchscreen all-in-one to explain the sentence structure.","(3) 用触控一体机上的翻译说明句子结构。",0],["li","(4) Speaking activity - Separate the class into two or three teams. First, ask them to read quietly. Then, ask them to add in some body language to make the reading more fun. Ask each team to read for you and the best team with both good speech and good body language may get some points.","(4) 口语活动：把全班分成两或三队，先请他们安静地读，再请他们加入一些肢体语言，让朗读更有趣。请每队念给您听，口语和肢体语言都表现好的队伍可以得分。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Let's Check",null,0],["h3","Listening Comprehension","听力理解",0],["p","Note: For the listening exercises, the teacher needs to read the words to the students for exercise 1 (please refer to the appendix for the script) and play the MP3 to the class for exercise 2. For exercise 3, the teacher should give the instruction first and have the students do the exercise by themselves.","注意：听力练习的第 1 题，老师需要念单词给学生听（稿件请参考附录）；第 2 题播放 MP3 给全班听；第 3 题由老师先说明，再让学生自己完成。",0],["li","(1) Listen and color the things with the correct color","(1) 听一听，把东西涂上正确的颜色",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Quickly review the dialog that the students have learned from the previous class. Teachers can do the conversation with the students by being \"A\" and have the students be \"B\". Do it again, switching roles.","快速复习学生上一堂课学过的对话。老师可以扮演“A”、学生扮演“B”进行对话，再交换角色练习一次。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Attract the students' attention by saying, \" Open your book to page ___ and take out your pencil.\" \"Pay careful attentions to what your teacher says and color the picture according to the word you hear.\"","说“Open your book to page ___ and take out your pencil.”“Pay careful attention to what your teacher says and color the picture according to the sentence you hear.”吸引学生的注意。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Read the words to the students and have them to listen to you and do the exercise. (The teacher can read the words to the class again if necessary.) Take a look around and check the correct answers with the students.","念单词给学生听，请他们边听边做练习。（必要时老师可以再念一次。）巡视教室，和学生一起核对正确答案。",0],["li","(2) Listen and \"V\" the correct answer","(2) 听一听，勾选“V”正确答案",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the monolog Let's Check: Monolog What can you see in the classroom? There is a map, a white board ,a globe ,a textbook, a marker, and a ruler. What can you see and do in school? Please turn to page 46,Let's check. Listen to the sentences and check the correct answer.","播放独白。Let's Check 独白：What can you see in the classroom? There is a map, a white board, a globe, a textbook, a marker, and a ruler. What can you see and do in school? Please turn to page 46, Let's check. Listen to the sentences and check the correct answer.",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Tell the class the name of each picture and have them repeat after you.","告诉全班每张图片的名称，请他们跟着您复诵。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Explain that they have to circle the correct picture while listening to the mp3. Continue to play the MP3 to the class for the listening exercise.","说明他们要边听 MP3，边圈出正确的图片。接着继续播放 MP3 进行听力练习。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Take a look around and make sure all the students can do the exercise while playing the MP3 to the class.","播放 MP3 时巡视教室，确认所有学生都会做这个练习。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","As soon as they finish, start the correction by telling them the answers and help them to correct their mistakes. (The teacher can play the dialog the class again if it's necessary.)","学生一完成就开始订正：告诉他们答案，并帮助他们改正错误。（必要时老师可以再播放一次对话。）",0],["li","(3) Exercise: Number the words in the picture below","(3) 练习：为下图中的单词标上号码",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Give the instruction to the class about exercise 3 by referring to the exercise heading of the lesson. Make sure your explanation is clear enough for the students to do the exercise by themselves. Take a look around while the students are doing the exercise and give help if it's necessary.","参考本课练习的标题，向全班说明第 3 题的做法，确认说明够清楚，让学生能自己完成。学生做练习时巡视教室，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Check the answers with the class by inviting the answers from the students. The teacher should give more chance for the students to talk and interact with the others in class to increase learner's communicative ability.","请学生说出答案，和全班一起核对。老师应多给学生在课堂上说话、和别人互动的机会，提升学习者的沟通能力。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review today's lesson using the books.","(1) 用课本复习今天的课程。",0],["li","(2) Review today's lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Write a few examples on the board so that they understand.","利用这段时间预习作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生了解。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board. Let the students write them down in their progress report book.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress report book individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement in it. Besides, it is a good time to give the students reward cards according to their teams' performance.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 9","电话教学教材 9",0],["li","6. What number is between 36-38?",null,0],["li","7. What numbers are before 10?",null,0],["li","8. How much is your bookbag?",null,0],["li","9. How much are your shoes?",null,0],["li","10. How much are your pencils?",null,0]],"g":[[27,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 4","Classroom Activities","Lesson 11","Classroom Readers","Lesson 9","大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV"]],[34,["Book 4","Classroom Activities","Lesson","Part 1","12.1","Part 2","12.2","12.2 A","12.2 B","Part 3","12.3","Part 4","12.4"]],[65,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 4","Classroom Activities"]],[65,["Part 4","12.4"]],[71,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV"]],[71,["Book 4","Classroom Readers","Lesson 10","New Words","Learning & Playing","Translation"]],[99,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["At the Night"],"bd":"","m":105},{"z":"第 19 课","t":"Class 19","k":"class","p":[64,65,66],"b":[["h3","Goal","目标",1],["p","To give and follow orders","能下指令并遵从指令",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["p","Offering help Expressing difficulties Expressing the ease of a task Expressing or responding to gratitude","主动提供帮忙；表达困难；表达事情很简单；表达并回应感谢",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","Flashcards, digital equipment","单词卡、数字教学设备",1],["h3","Classroom Activities 4B Lesson 13","Classroom Activities 4B 第 13 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Sit down, close the window, write the word, spell the word",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","imperatives","祈使句",1],["h3","Phonics","自然拼读",1],["p","\"v\"",null,1],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson 11","Classroom Readers 第 11 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Laugh, laughing, stand up, open, pick up",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","imperatives","祈使句",1],["h3","EEC 2 Unit 11","EEC 2 第 11 单元",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","Globe, white board, ruler, map, marker Dialog See And Say","globe, white board, ruler, map, marker。对话：See And Say",1],["d","Need help?","A",1],["d","Sure. I am stuck on this problem.","B",1],["d","Don't worry.","A",1],["p","Let me show you how to do it.",null,1],["d","I see. It's not that difficult. Thanks.","B",1],["d","You're welcome.","A",1],["h2","Warm Up (20 mins)","热身 Warm Up（20 mins）",0],["li","(1) Review the previous class using digital teaching. Have the students look at the touchscreen all-in-one and repeat the sentences.","(1) 用数字教学复习上一堂课，请学生看触控一体机并复诵句子。",0],["li","(2) Review the vocabulary from the last class.","(2) 复习上一堂课的单词。",0],["li","(3) Do a vocabulary quiz on numbers.","(3) 进行数字的单词小测验。",0],["li","(4) Go over the quiz together and ask them to correct each other's quiz.","(4) 一起讲评小测验，请学生互相批改考卷。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (50 mins) Lesson 13: Pay Attention","Classroom Activities（50 mins）第 13 课 Pay Attention 注意听",0],["h2","13.1",null,0],["li","(1) Show the vocabulary using the touchscreen all-in-one and ask the students to listen carefully.","(1) 用触控一体机展示单词，请学生仔细听。",0],["li","(2) Introduce the vocabulary on the monitor. Ask the students to repeat.","(2) 在屏幕上介绍单词，请学生复诵。",0],["li","(3) Draw pictures on the board or use flashcards and practice the sentence patterns without looking at the monitor or the book.","(3) 在黑板上画图或使用单词卡，不看屏幕或课本练习句型。",0],["h2","13.2",null,0],["li","(1) Use the pictures from the touchscreen all-in-one to practice the sentence patterns with students.","(1) 用触控一体机上的图片和学生练习句型。",0],["li","(2) Explain when to use these kinds of sentences.","(2) 说明什么时候使用这类句子。",0],["li","(3) Ask the class to repeat.","(3) 请全班复诵。",0],["h2","13.2 A",null,0],["li","(1) Show the sentences on the monitor and ask the students to listen then repeat the sentences.","(1) 在屏幕上展示句子，请学生先听再复诵。",0],["li","(2) Ask the students to look at the picture in the book and randomly pick some students to ask or answer the questions.","(2) 请学生看课本上的图片，随机选几位学生提问或回答。",0],["li","(3) Play \"Simon Says\" - Divide the class into two teams. When the teacher includes \"Simon says\" in the command the students must do whatever the teacher says. But when the teacher doesn't include \"Simon says\" in the command then students must stay still until the next command is given out. Play until one of the teams is out.","(3) 玩“老师说（Simon Says）”：把全班分成两队。老师的指令里有 \"Simon says\" 时，学生必须照老师说的做；没有 \"Simon says\" 时，学生要保持不动，直到下一个指令。玩到其中一队全部出局为止。",0],["d","Simon says stand up (all the students stand up)","Teacher",0],["d","Sit down (some students sit down and they're out of the game)","Teacher",0],["h2","13.2 B",null,0],["li","(1) Use the touchscreen all-in-one to practice asking and answering using the target sentence pattern.","(1) 用触控一体机练习用目标句型问答。",0],["li","(2) With the same team ask them to write out the answer on board and check the answers using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 请同样的分队把答案写在黑板上，再用触控一体机核对答案。",0],["li","(3) Go over each question and ask different teams to answer.","(3) 逐题讲评，请不同的队伍回答。",0],["li","(4) Give the class 5 minutes to write the exercise in the book and try to check individually to see if they really understood.","(4) 给全班 5 分钟写课本上的练习，并试着个别检查，看学生是否真的懂了。",0],["h2","13.3",null,0],["li","(1) Play the sound using the touchscreen all-in-one and ask students to listen carefully.","(1) 用触控一体机播放发音，请学生仔细听。",0],["li","(2) The \"v\" sound is easy to pronounce, but make sure the students don't pronounce \"f\" instead of \"v\".","(2) “v”的音很容易发，但要确认学生不要把“v”念成“f”。",0],["li","(3) Practice the words by repeating after the touchscreen all-in-one.","(3) 跟着触控一体机复诵练习这些单词。",0],["h2","13.4",null,0],["li","(1) Review the \"f\" sound.","(1) 复习“f”的音。",0],["li","(2) Play the touchscreen all-in-one and ask the students to listen then check for the correct answers.","(2) 播放触控一体机，请学生听并勾选正确答案。",0],["li","(3) Go over all the answers and randomly pick out some students to answer the questions.","(3) 核对所有答案，随机选几位学生回答问题。",0],["li","(4) Think of some other words with the \"v\" sound to let students practice.","(4) 想一些其他有“v”音的单词让学生练习。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (20 mins)","Classroom Readers（20 mins）",0],["h2","Lesson 11: Look Out, Mike!","第 11 课 Look Out, Mike! 小心，Mike！",0],["li","(1) Use the monitor to introduce the new words. Ask the students to repeat after the teacher.","(1) 用屏幕介绍新单词，请学生跟着老师复诵。",0],["li","(2) First play the entire story on the touchscreen all-in-one and ask the students to listen. Play it a second time, but this time stop after every sentence and ask the students to practice the sentence.","(2) 先用触控一体机播放整个故事让学生听；播放第二次时，每句停下来请学生练习。",0],["li","(3) Use the translation in the touchscreen all-in-one to explain the sentence structure.","(3) 用触控一体机上的翻译说明句子结构。",0],["li","(4) Role play activity - Divide the class into groups of 4. They will play the role of Peter Pig, Tina Turtle, Mike, and the narrator. Give the class 5 minutes to prepare for the act. The best-performing team may get some reward cards.","(4) 角色扮演活动：把全班分成四人一组，分别扮演 Peter Pig、Tina Turtle、Mike 和旁白。给全班 5 分钟准备，表现最好的队伍可以得到奖励卡。",0],["h2","Reinforcement","加强复习 Reinforcement",0],["h3","(10 mins)","（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review today's lesson using the books.","(1) 用课本复习今天的课程。",0],["li","(2) Review today's lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Write a few examples on the board so that they understand.","利用这段时间预习作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生了解。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board. Let the students write them down in their progress report books.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress report books individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement in it. Besides, it is a good time to give the students reward cards according to their teams' performance.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["h2","EEC",null,0],["h3","(15 mins)","（15 mins）",0],["h3","What Can I do?","What Can I Do?",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the dialog using the MP3 as a quick review.","用 MP3 播放对话，作为快速复习。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Explain the meaning of each topic in \"What Can I do?\" and let them check the appropriate box. Allow five minutes for the students to do the exercise and select a few students to report their self-evaluation to the class.","解释“What Can I Do?”中每个项目的意思，让学生在适当的方格打钩。给学生五分钟做这个练习，再选几位学生向全班报告自己的自我评估。",0],["h3","Step3","步骤 3",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group do a mini role-play of the dialog for the unit. Each group needs to demonstrate in front the class, and the teacher needs to make sure everyone can do the conversation with ease. Also, pay attention to the students' pronunciation and intonation.","让学生两两一组，各组进行本单元对话的小型角色扮演。每一组都要到全班面前表演，老师要确认每个人都能轻松进行对话，同时注意学生的发音和语调。",0]],"g":[[27,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 4","Classroom Activities","Lesson 12","Classroom Readers","Lesson 10","大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV"]],[37,["Book 4","Classroom Activities","Lesson 13","Part 1","13.1","Part 2","13.2","13.2 A","13.2 B","Part 3","13.3","Part 4","13.4"]],[62,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 4","Classroom Readers","Lesson 11","New Words"]],[62,["Learning & Playing","Translation"]],[77,["●Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["Pay Attention","Look Out, Mike!"],"bd":"","m":90},{"z":"第 20 课","t":"Class 20","k":"class","p":[67,68,69,70],"b":[["h3","Goal","目标",1],["p","To say what musical instruments one can or can not play.","能说出自己会或不会演奏哪些乐器",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["p","Expressing regret for not seeing someone Sending regards and giving blessings Making or agreeing with suggestions.","表达见不到某人的遗憾；转达问候并给予祝福；提出或同意建议",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","Flashcards, digital equipment, small ball","单词卡、数字教学设备、小球",1],["h3","Classroom Activities 4B Lesson 14","Classroom Activities 4B 第 14 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Trumpet, guitar, cymbals",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","Subject + can/can't play_________.","主语 ＋ can/can't play ___.",1],["h3","Phonics","自然拼读",1],["p","\"w\"",null,1],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson 12","Classroom Readers 第 12 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Swim, can, can't = cannot, some, mud, now, all, best",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","Subject + can/can't play_________.","主语 ＋ can/can't play ___.",1],["h3","EEC 2 Unit 12","EEC 2 第 12 单元",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","Ticket, passport, airplane, escalator, seat, airport",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["p","See And Say AB: We are going to miss you",null,1],["d","Me, too.","C",1],["p","AB: Have a good time!",null,1],["d","Thanks AB: Send us e-mail.","C",1],["d","I will, for sure.","C",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["li","(1) Review the previous class using digital teaching. Have the students watch the touchscreen all-in-one and repeat.","(1) 用数字教学复习上一堂课，请学生看触控一体机并复诵。",0],["li","(2) Review the vocabulary from the last class.","(2) 复习上一堂课的单词。",0],["li","(3) Do a vocabulary quiz.","(3) 进行单词小测验。",0],["li","(4) Go over the quiz together and ask them to correct each other's quiz.","(4) 一起讲评小测验，请学生互相批改考卷。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (50 mins) Lesson 14: The School Band","Classroom Activities（50 mins）第 14 课 The School Band 学校乐队",0],["h2","14.1",null,0],["li","(1) Show the vocabulary using the touchscreen all-in-one and ask the students to listen carefully.","(1) 用触控一体机展示单词，请学生仔细听。",0],["li","(2) Introduce the vocabulary on the monitor. Ask the students to repeat.","(2) 在屏幕上介绍单词，请学生复诵。",0],["li","(3) Draw pictures on the board or use flashcards and practice the sentence pattern without looking at the monitor or the book.","(3) 在黑板上画图或使用单词卡，不看屏幕或课本练习句型。",0],["h2","14.2",null,0],["li","(1) Use pictures on the touchscreen all-in-one to practice the sentence pattern with the students.","(1) 用触控一体机上的图片和学生练习句型。",0],["li","(2) Explain when to use these kinds of sentences","(2) 说明什么时候使用这类句子。",0],["li","(3) Ask the class to repeat.","(3) 请全班复诵。",0],["h2","14.2 A",null,0],["li","(1) Show the sentences on the monitor and ask the students to listen then repeat the sentences.","(1) 在屏幕上展示句子，请学生先听再复诵。",0],["li","(2) Ask the students to look at the picture in the book and randomly pick out some students to ask or answer the questions.","(2) 请学生看课本上的图片，随机选几位学生提问或回答。",0],["li","(3) Play \"Monkey Ball\" - Prepare a small ball. The teacher will be the ghost first. Give one student the ball and tell them to toss the ball around and the ghost must try to catch it before someone else catches it. The student who last touches the ball will be the next ghost and will have to look at the picture in 14.2 and say a target sentence.","(3) 玩“猴子抢球”：准备一颗小球，老师先当鬼。把球交给一位学生，请学生互相丢球，鬼要在别人接到之前把球抢到。最后碰到球的学生当下一个鬼，并要看 14.2 的图片说出一个目标句子。",0],["h3","(5) Activity Sheet 7","(5) 活动单 7",0],["p","Have the students draw or paste pictures of people and musical instruments in the squares on Activity Sheet 7. Then let them draw lines matching the people with the instruments that they can play. Now have them complete the sentences below.","请学生在活动单 7 的方格中画出或贴上人物和乐器的图片，再画线把人物和他们会演奏的乐器连起来，最后完成下面的句子。",0],["h2","14.2 B",null,0],["li","(1) Use the touchscreen all-in-one to practice asking and answering questions using the target sentence patterns.","(1) 用触控一体机练习用目标句型问答。",0],["li","(2) Ask the students to write the answers on board and check the answers using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 请学生把答案写在黑板上，再用触控一体机核对答案。",0],["li","(3) Go over each question and ask different students to answer.","(3) 逐题讲评，请不同的学生回答。",0],["li","(4) Give the class 5 minutes to write the exercise in the book and try to check individually to see if they really understood the exercise.","(4) 给全班 5 分钟写课本上的练习，并试着个别检查，看学生是否真的懂了这个练习。",0],["h2","14.3",null,0],["li","(1) Play the sound on the touchscreen all-in-one and ask the students to listen carefully.","(1) 用触控一体机播放发音，请学生仔细听。",0],["li","(2) The \"w\" sound should be easy to pronounce.","(2) “w”的音应该很容易发。",0],["li","(3) Practice the words by repeating after the touchscreen all-in-one.","(3) 跟着触控一体机复诵练习这些单词。",0],["h2","14.4",null,0],["li","(1) Review the \"w\" sound.","(1) 复习“w”的音。",0],["li","(2) Play the touchscreen all-in-one and ask the students to listen then check for the correct answers.","(2) 播放触控一体机，请学生听并勾选正确答案。",0],["li","(3) Go over all the answers and randomly pick out some students to answer the questions.","(3) 核对所有答案，随机选几位学生回答问题。",0],["li","(4) Think of some other words with the \"w\" sound and let the students practice.","(4) 想一些其他有“w”音的单词让学生练习。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (20 mins)","Classroom Readers（20 mins）",0],["h3","Lesson 12 Best Friends","第 12 课 Best Friends 最好的朋友",0],["li","(1) Use the monitor to introduce the new words. Ask the students to repeat after the teacher.","(1) 用屏幕介绍新单词，请学生跟着老师复诵。",0],["li","(2) First play the entire story in the touchscreen all-in-one and ask the students to listen. Play it a second time, but this time stop after every sentence and ask the students to practice the sentence.","(2) 先用触控一体机播放整个故事让学生听；播放第二次时，每句停下来请学生练习。",0],["li","(3) Use the Translation in the touchscreen all-in-one to explain the sentence structure.","(3) 用触控一体机上的翻译说明句子结构。",0],["li","(4) Twisting the story activity - After the students have read the story one time, give them 3 minutes to change all the \"can\" to \"can't\" and all the \"can't\" to \"can\". Ask the class to read again the revised story. Because the revised version won't make any sense, it might sound very funny.","(4) 故事大改造活动：学生把故事读一遍后，给他们 3 分钟把所有的 \"can\" 改成 \"can't\"，所有的 \"can't\" 改成 \"can\"，再请全班念改编后的故事。因为改编版会变得不合逻辑，听起来可能非常好笑。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Motivation","导入（Motivation）",0],["p","This is the time to warm up the class up by providing the students with a general picture of the lesson that they are going to learn today. Make sure all the students have a general idea about today's lesson before going to the next part of Let's See And Say. Let's See And Say","这是让全班热身的时间，让学生对今天要学的课程有整体的概念。进入“Let's See & Say”之前，请确认所有学生对今天的课程都有大致的了解。Let's See And Say：",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Introduction:","引导：",0],["p","The teacher introduces the lesson by having the students listen to the monolog. You can either read the monolog, or use the MP3. Let's See & Say: Monolog The little boy is going on a trip with his parents. His friends are saying good-bye to him at the airport. Let's listen to the conversation.","老师让学生听独白介绍本课，可以自己念，或使用 MP3。Let's See & Say 独白：The little boy is going on a trip with his parents. His friends are saying good-bye to him at the airport. Let's listen to the conversation.",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Have the class guess and predict about the theme and the words that relate to this lesson based on the monolog they have just listened to. Encourage the students to use their imagination and give them a chance to share their ideas. Write the students' ideas on the board and add the points you also want to emphasize for this lesson. Then play the dialog for the first time and have the students listen carefully.","请全班根据刚听到的独白，猜测并预测与本课相关的主题和单词。鼓励学生发挥想象力，并给他们机会在课堂上分享自己的想法。把学生的想法写在黑板上，并补充您想在本课强调的重点。接着第一次播放对话，请学生仔细聆听。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the dialog to the class for the second time and have the students repeat after the narrator. Remind the students to listen carefully to the narrator's pronunciation and intonation while practicing each sentence of the dialog. The teacher also needs to listen carefully to the students' pronunciation and intonation and give help if necessary.","第二次播放对话，请学生跟着录音复诵。提醒学生练习每一句对话时，仔细听录音的发音和语调。老师也要仔细听学生的发音和语调，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Introduce the theme of the lesson to the class again by combining the dialog that the students have practiced and the core vocabulary of this lesson. (The teacher can play or read the dialog to the class again if necessary.) Make sure all the students are familiar with the dialog and vocabulary and able to do the conversation with each other. At this stage, the teacher should also tell the students about possible situations where they can apply this type of conversation in real life.","结合学生刚练习过的对话和本课的核心单词，再次向全班介绍本课主题。（必要时老师可以再播放或念一次对话。）确认所有学生都熟悉对话和单词，并能互相进行对话。这个阶段老师也应该告诉学生，在现实生活中有哪些情境可以用到这类对话。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group practice the conversation for a comprehension check.","让学生两两一组，各组练习对话，检查理解程度。",0],["h3","Step 6","步骤 6",0],["p","Remind the students to review the lesson at home by listening to the MP3 and encourage them to practice the dialogue with their family or friends before coming to the next class.","提醒学生回家听 MP3 复习本课，并鼓励他们在下次上课前和家人或朋友练习对话。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review today's lesson using the books.","(1) 用课本复习今天的课程。",0],["li","(2) Review today's lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Write a few examples on the board so that they understand.","利用这段时间预习作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生了解。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board. Let the students write them down in their progress report book.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress report book individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement on it. Besides, it is a good time to give the students reward cards according to their performance.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 10","电话教学教材 10",0],["li","1. How do you spell \"trumpet\"?",null,0],["li","2. Please make a sentence using \"don't.\"","2. 请用 \"don't\" 造句。",0],["li","3. Please make a sentence using \"can.\"","3. 请用 \"can\" 造句。",0],["li","4. Please make a sentence using \"can't.\"","4. 请用 \"can't\" 造句。",0],["li","5. How do you spell \"cymbal\"?",null,0]],"g":[[27,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 4","Classroom Activities","Lesson 13","Classroom Readers","Lesson 11","大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV"]],[33,["Book 4","Classroom Activities","Lesson 14","Part 1","14.1","Part 2","14.2","14.2 A","14.2 B","Part 3","14.3","Part 4","14.4"]],[61,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 4"]],[61,["Classroom Readers","Lesson 12","New Words","Learning & Playing","Translation"]],[67,["●Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["The School Band","Best Friends"],"bd":"","m":105},{"z":"第 21 课","t":"Class 21","k":"class","p":[71,72,73,74],"b":[["h3","Goal","目标",1],["p","Review of Lesson 11-14","复习第 11–14 课",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["p","Expressing regret for not seeing someone Sending regards and giving blessings Making suggestions and expressing agreement.","表达见不到某人的遗憾；转达问候并给予祝福；提出建议并表示同意",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","Flashcards, digital equipment","单词卡、数字教学设备",1],["h3","Classroom Activities 4B Lesson 15","Classroom Activities 4B 第 15 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Review of Lesson 11-14","复习第 11–14 课",1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","Review of Lesson 11-14","复习第 11–14 课",1],["h3","Phonics","自然拼读",1],["p","Review of Lesson 11-14","复习第 11–14 课",1],["h3","EEC 2 Unit 12","EEC 2 第 12 单元",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","Ticket, passport, airplane, escalator, seat, airport",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["p","See And Say AB: We are going to miss you",null,1],["d","Me, too.","C",1],["p","AB: Have a good time!",null,1],["d","Thanks AB: Send us e-mail.","C",1],["d","I will, for sure.","C",1],["h2","Warm Up ( 25 mins)","热身 Warm Up（25 mins）",0],["li","(1) Review the previous class using digital teaching. Have the students look at the touchscreen all-in-one and repeat the sentences.","(1) 用数字教学复习上一堂课，请学生看触控一体机并复诵句子。",0],["li","(2) Review the vocabulary and the phonics sounds from previous classes.","(2) 复习之前课程的单词和发音。",0],["li","(3) Do a spelling and phonics quiz.","(3) 进行拼写和发音小测验。",0],["li","(4) Go over the quiz together and ask them to correct each other's quiz.","(4) 一起讲评小测验，请学生互相批改考卷。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (70 mins) Lesson 6: A Fun Weekend","Classroom Activities（70 mins）",0],["li","- By now all the lessons have been taught. This is a good time to review all the materials taught in the previous lessons.","- 到现在所有课程都教完了，这是复习之前所有教材的好时机。",0],["li","- Play Submarine to review the materials: Divide the class into two teams. Give each team a piece of paper and tell them to draw a 6x6 grid. Label the rows 1-6 and the column A-F. Each team gets 3 submarines. The sub size will be 4x3, and 2 grids long. Each time a team answers the questions correctly, the team may fire a torpedo by selecting a point on the grid. The game is over when all the submarines on a team have been destroyed.","- 玩“潜水艇”游戏复习教材：把全班分成两队，每队一张纸，请他们画 6×6 的格子，列标上 1–6，栏标上 A–F。每队有 3 艘潜水艇，大小为 4 格、3 格和 2 格长。每答对一题，该队就可以选格子上的一个点发射鱼雷。一队的所有潜水艇都被击沉时，游戏结束。",0],["h2","15.1",null,0],["li","(1) Show the vocabulary from the touchscreen all-in-one and ask the students to listen carefully.","(1) 用触控一体机展示单词，请学生仔细听。",0],["li","(2) Ask the students to repeat.","(2) 请学生复诵。",0],["li","(3) Ask the teams a few questions. When they answer correctly they may try to attack the other team.","(3) 问各队几个问题，答对就可以攻击另一队。",0],["li","(4) Give the students some time to finish the questions. Go over the questions together.","(4) 给学生一些时间完成题目，再一起核对。",0],["h2","15.2",null,0],["li","(1) Show the sentence using the touchscreen all-in-one and ask the students to listen carefully.","(1) 用触控一体机展示句子，请学生仔细听。",0],["li","(2) Ask the students to repeat.","(2) 请学生复诵。",0],["li","(3) Ask the teams a few questions. When they answer correctly they may try to attack the other team.","(3) 问各队几个问题，答对就可以攻击另一队。",0],["li","(4) Give the students some time to finish the questions. Go over the questions together.","(4) 给学生一些时间完成题目，再一起核对。",0],["h2","15.3",null,0],["li","(1) Show the sentence on the touchscreen all-in-one and ask the students to listen carefully.","(1) 在触控一体机上展示句子，请学生仔细听。",0],["li","(2) Ask the students to repeat after the teacher.","(2) 请学生跟着老师复诵。",0],["li","(3) Ask the teams a few questions. When they answer correctly, they may try to attack the other team.","(3) 问各队几个问题，答对就可以试着攻击另一队。",0],["li","(4) Give the students some time to finish the questions. Go over the questions together.","(4) 给学生一些时间完成题目，再一起核对。",0],["h2","15.4 A",null,0],["li","(1) Use the touchscreen all-in-one to review the phonics sounds. Explain any sounds that the students have trouble with.","(1) 用触控一体机复习发音，说明学生有困难的音。",0],["li","(2) Ask the students to repeat.","(2) 请学生复诵。",0],["li","(3) Ask the teams a few questions. When they answer correctly they may try to attack the other team.","(3) 问各队几个问题，答对就可以攻击另一队。",0],["li","(4) Give the students some time finish the questions. Go over the questions together.","(4) 给学生一些时间完成题目，再一起核对。",0],["h2","15.4 B",null,0],["li","(1) Review the \"e\" sound.","(1) 复习“e”的音。",0],["li","(2) Ask the students to repeat.","(2) 请学生复诵。",0],["li","(3) Ask the teams a few questions. When they answer correctly they may try to attack the other team.","(3) 问各队几个问题，答对就可以攻击另一队。",0],["li","(4) Give the students some time to finish the questions. Go over the questions together.","(4) 给学生一些时间完成题目，再一起核对。",0],["h2","15.5",null,0],["li","(1) First, ask the students to listen to the song.","(1) 先请学生听这首歌。",0],["li","(2) Explain any words that they don't understand.","(2) 说明学生不懂的字。",0],["li","(3) Together, sing the song and create some kind of movements or dance. Give reward cards to the people who dance the best while singing.","(3) 一起唱这首歌，并编一些动作或舞蹈，边唱边跳得最好的人可以得到奖励卡。",0],["h2","EEC",null,0],["h3","(15 mins)","（15 mins）",0],["h3","Let's Check",null,0],["h3","Listening Comprehension","听力理解",0],["p","Note: For the listening exercises, the teacher needs to read the words to the students for exercise 1 (please refer to the appendix for the script) and play the MP3 to the class for exercise 2. For exercise 3, the teacher should give the instruction first and have the students do the exercise by themselves.","注意：听力练习的第 1 题，老师需要念单词给学生听（稿件请参考附录）；第 2 题播放 MP3 给全班听；第 3 题由老师先说明，再让学生自己完成。",0],["h3","(1) Listen and draw","(1) 听一听，画出来",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Quickly review the dialog from the previous class. The teacher can do the conversation with the students by being \"A\" and have the students be \"B\". Do it again, switching roles.","快速复习上一堂课的对话。老师可以扮演“A”、学生扮演“B”进行对话，再交换角色练习一次。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Attract the students' attention by saying, \"Open your book to page ___ and take out your pencil.\" \"Pay careful attentions to what your teacher says and draw the picture according to the word you hear.\"","说“Open your book to page ___ and take out your pencil.”“Pay careful attention to what your teacher says and color the picture according to the sentence you hear.”吸引学生的注意。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Read the words and have the students listen to you and do the exercise. (The teacher can read the words to the class again if necessary.) Take a look around and check the answers with the students.","念出单词，请学生边听边做练习。（必要时老师可以再念一次。）巡视教室，和学生一起核对答案。",0],["h3","(2) Listen and check \"V\" the correct pictures","(2) 听一听，勾选“V”正确的图片",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the Let's Check monolog:","播放“Let's Check”独白：",0],["p","Let's Check: Monolog What can you see at the airport? What do you need when take an airplane to another country? Please turn to page 50 ,Let's Check. Listen and check the correct pictures.","Let's Check 独白：What can you see at the airport? What do you need when you take an airplane to another country? Please turn to page 50, Let's Check. Listen and check the correct pictures.",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Tell the class the name of the item in each picture. Have them repeat after you.","告诉全班每张图片中物品的名称，请他们跟着您复诵。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Explain that they have to check the correct picture while listening to the MP3. Continue to play the MP3 to the class for the listening exercise.","说明他们要边听 MP3，边勾选正确的图片。接着继续播放 MP3 进行听力练习。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Take a look around and make sure all the students can do the exercise while playing the MP3 to the class.","播放 MP3 时巡视教室，确认所有学生都会做这个练习。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","As soon as they finish, start the correction by telling them the answers and help them to correct their mistakes. (The teacher can play the dialog the class again if necessary.)","学生一完成就开始订正：告诉他们答案，并帮助他们改正错误。（必要时老师可以再播放一次对话。）",0],["h3","(3) Exercise: Check \"V\" the things we can see at the airport","(3) 练习：勾选“V”在机场可以看到的东西",0],["h3","Step 6","步骤 6",0],["p","Explain exercise 3 by referring to the exercise heading of the lesson. Make sure your explanation is clear enough for the students to do the exercise by themselves. Take a look around while the students are doing the exercise and give help if necessary.","参考本课练习的标题说明第 3 题，确认说明够清楚，让学生能自己完成。学生做练习时巡视教室，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 7","步骤 7",0],["p","Check the answers with the class by eliciting answers from the students. The teacher should give more chance for the students to talk and interact with the others in class to increase learner's communicative ability.","请学生说出答案，和全班一起核对。老师应多给学生在课堂上说话、和别人互动的机会，提升学习者的沟通能力。",0],["h2","Reinforcement","加强复习 Reinforcement",0],["h3","(10 mins)","（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review today's lesson using the books.","(1) 用课本复习今天的课程。",0],["li","(2) Review today's lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Write a few examples on the board so that they understand.","利用这段时间预习作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生了解。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board. Let the students write them down in their progress report books.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress report book individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement on it. Besides, it is a good time to give the students reward cards according to their teams' performance.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","(3) Remind students there will be quizzes next lesson.","(3) 提醒学生下一课有小测验。",0]],"g":[[22,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 4","Classroom Activities","Lesson 14","Classroom Readers","Lesson 12","大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 4","Classroom Activities"]],[30,["Lesson 15","Part 1","15.1","Part 2","15.2","Part 3","15.3","Part 4","15.4 A","15.4 B","Part 5","15.5"]],[59,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 4","Classroom Activities","Part 4","15.4 B","15.5"]],[90,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["A Fun Weekend"],"bd":"","m":95},{"z":"第 22 课","t":"Class 22","k":"class","p":[75,76],"b":[["h2","Review Day 3","复习日 3",0],["h3","Goals","目标",0],["p","Review for Test 3","准备测验 3",0],["h3","EEC",null,0],["p","Expressing regret for not seeing someone Sending regards and giving blessings Making suggestions and expressing agreement.","表达见不到某人的遗憾；转达问候并给予祝福；提出建议并表示同意",0],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",0],["p","flashcards, tape recorder, S4 listening lab tape, copies of the test Classroom Readers","单词卡、录音机、S4 听力练习录音带、测验卷复印件。Classroom Readers",0],["h3","Review lesson 9 to lesson 12","复习第 9 课到第 12 课",0],["p","Classroom Activities",null,0],["h3","Review lesson 11 to lesson 15","复习第 11 课到第 15 课",0],["h3","EEC",null,0],["h3","vocabulary","单词",0],["p","Ticket, passport, airplane, escalator, seat, airport",null,0],["h3","dialogue","对话",0],["p","See And Say AB: We are going to miss you",null,0],["d","Me, too.","C",0],["p","AB: Have a good time!",null,0],["d","Thanks AB: Send us e-mail.","C",0],["d","I will, for sure.","C",0],["h2","Review (20 mins)","复习 Review（20 mins）",0],["li","(1) Use this time to catch up on lessons or areas some students did not have time for in the first six classes. If the students are caught up, spend this time reviewing previous lessons or areas where the students seem to be having difficulty. You can do this with drills, games, or any activity that you think will help the students. Choose those that students are interested in the first five classes.","(1) 利用这段时间补上之前课程中，部分学生还没来得及完成的部分。如果学生进度都跟上了，就用这段时间复习之前的课程，或学生似乎有困难的部分。可以通过操练、游戏或任何您认为对学生有帮助的活动进行，选择学生之前感兴趣的活动。",0],["li","(2) Review all the vocabulary.","(2) 复习所有单词。",0],["li","(3) Review all the sentence patterns.","(3) 复习所有句型。",0],["li","(4) Review all the phonics material.","(4) 复习所有发音内容。",0],["h2","Quiz (30 mins)","小测验 Quiz（30 mins）",0],["li","(1) Have the students put all books and unnecessary things away. Hand out the quiz and have the students take it.","1. 请学生把所有书本和不需要的东西收起来，发下考卷让学生作答。",0],["li","(2) Make sure that the students know the meaning of each item.","2. 确认学生了解每一题的意思。",0],["li","(3) Walk around the classroom and give help if necessary.","(3) 在教室里走动，必要时给予协助。",0],["li","(4) Students may not talk or cheat during the quiz. If the students don't get good grades, they have to make it up in the next class (Teacher can have their own grading standard).","(4) 小测验时学生不能说话或作弊。成绩不理想的学生，下次上课要补考（老师可以自定评分标准）。",0],["h2","Listening Quiz (30 mins)","听力小测验 Listening Quiz（30 mins）",0],["li","(1) Check the tape and the recorder before the students come back from break. Prepare for the listening quiz.","(1) 在学生下课休息回来前，先检查录音带和录音机，准备听力小测验。",0],["li","(2) Turn on the tape and have the students fill in the appropriate blanks.","(2) 播放录音带，请学生在适当的空格中作答。",0],["li","(3) Play the tape a few times. The students need to listen carefully.","(3) 录音带可以多播几次，学生要仔细听。",0],["li","(4) Listening is a very important aspect of learning a new language.","(4) 听力是学习新语言非常重要的一环。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","What Can I do?","What Can I Do?",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the dialog on the MP3 as a quick review.","用 MP3 播放对话，作为快速复习。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Explain the meaning of each topic in \"What Can I do?\" and let the students check the appropriate box. Allow five minutes for the students to do the exercise and select a few students to report their self-evaluation to the class.","解释“What Can I Do?”中每个项目的意思，让学生在适当的方格打钩。给学生五分钟做这个练习，再选几位学生向全班报告自己的自我评估。",0],["h3","Step3","步骤 3",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group do a mini role-play of the dialog. Each group needs to demonstrate in front the class, and the teacher needs to make sure everyone can do the conversation with ease. Also, pay attention to the students' pronunciation and intonation.","让学生两两一组，各组进行本单元对话的小型角色扮演。每一组都要到全班面前表演，老师要确认每个人都能轻松进行对话，同时注意学生的发音和语调。",0],["h2","Reinforcement ( 5 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（5 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review today's lesson using the books.","(1) 用课本复习今天的课程。",0],["li","(2) Review today's lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Write a few examples on the board so that they understand.","利用这段时间预习作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生了解。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board. Let the students write them down in their progress report books.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress report books individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement in it. Besides, it is a good time to give the students reward cards according to their teams' performance.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","(3) Remind the students about test # 3.","(3) 提醒学生准备测验 3。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 11","电话教学教材 11",0],["li","1. What number is between 19 and 21 ?",null,0],["li","2. Can you play the piano and guitar?",null,0],["li","3. Please spell (any vocabulary from the lessons)?","3. 请拼出（课程中的任一单词）。",0],["li","4. Where is number 45?",null,0],["li","5. How much are your shoes?",null,0]],"g":[[19,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 4","Classroom Activities","Lesson 11- Lesson 15","Book 4","Classroom Readers","Lesson 9- Lesson 12"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Review Day","m":100},{"z":"第 23 课","t":"Class 23","k":"class","p":[77],"b":[["h2","Test Day 3","测验日 3",0],["p","Classroom Readers 4 & Classroom Activities 4A Test lesson 9 to lesson 12, Test lesson 11 to lesson 15","Classroom Readers 4 和 Classroom Activities 4A：测验第 9 课到第 12 课；测验第 11 课到第 15 课",0],["h2","Review (15 mins)","复习 Review（15 mins）",0],["p","1.Return the quizzes and Listening Labs, after you have corrected them. Remind your students about the mistakes they have made. Help them understand the correct answers. 2.Use this time to review for the test. Go over any sentence patterns or any other areas where you think that students may need some review. Ask the students if they have any questions. Don't forget to practice for the oral test.","1. 把批改好的小测验和听力练习发还给学生，提醒学生犯过的错误，帮助他们了解正确答案。2. 利用这段时间为测验做复习，复习任何您认为学生可能需要加强的句型或其他部分。问学生有没有问题。别忘了练习口语测验。",0],["h2","Test (40 mins)","测验 Test（40 mins）",0],["p","The students should take the entire class to complete the test. Answer any areas that may seem unclear to the students. If they finish early tell them to study for the oral test quietly.","学生应该会用整堂课完成测验。回答学生对任何不清楚部分的问题。如果提早写完，请他们安静地准备口语测验。",0],["h2","Oral Test (3-5 mins per student)","口语测验 Oral Test（每位学生 3–5 分钟）",0],["p","Ask the students to take out their text books and review for the oral test. It's better to do the oral test outside of the classroom so other students won't hear the questions. Make sure you don't go too far away from your classroom so you can still keep an eye on your students. Call the students one by one to come out and take the oral test with you. The oral test should account for 20% of the test's total score. However, how many points each questions should be worth is your decision. You may choose to give some questions more points based on the difficulty of the question. The following is a sample of an oral test for your reference. It's also a good idea to come up with your own oral test since you know the students' strengths and weaknesses. The Oral Test","请学生拿出课本准备口语测验。最好在教室外进行口语测验，以免其他学生听到题目；但不要离教室太远，才能随时注意学生。一个一个叫学生出来和您进行口语测验。口语测验占测验总分的 20%，但每题配分由您决定，可以依题目难易给某些题目较高的分数。以下口语测验范例仅供参考；您最了解学生的强项和弱点，自己设计口语测验也是很好的做法。口语测验题目：",0],["h3","1. Turn to Lesson 11 and point to runner # 11.","1. 翻到第 11 课，指着 11 号跑者。",0],["h3","Where is number 11?",null,0],["h3","2. Turn to Lesson 12 and use the picture, \"At the Night Market\"","2. 翻到第 12 课，使用“At the Night Market”的图片。",0],["h3","How much is an apple?",null,0],["h3","3. How much are the flowers?",null,0],["h3","4. Give the student an imperative and ask them to do it.","4. 给学生一个祈使句指令，请他照做。",0],["h3","Have them give you a command.","再请学生给您下一个指令。",0],["li","5. Have the student make a sentence using \"can\" and \"can't\" and the conjunction","5. 请学生用 \"can\"、\"can't\" 和连词",0],["h3","\"but\".","\"but\" 造句。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h3","1-Progress Report Book","1. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write down the quiz and listening grade in their report book and ask them to get signatures from their parents. Also ask them to write corrections 5-10 times for every mistake they've made in the two quizzes.","(1) 把小测验和听力成绩写在学习进度手册上，请学生带回家给家长签名。也请学生把两次小测验中每个错误的订正写 5–10 次。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress report book individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement in it. none","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。（无）",0]],"g":[[2,["None"]],[4,["None"]],[17,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Test Day","m":65},{"z":"第 24 课","t":"Class 24","k":"class","p":[78],"b":[["h2","Activity Day 3","活动日 3",0],["h3","Goal","目标",0],["p","To do a Field Trip To correct Test 3 To prepare for PTA Night","进行校外活动；订正测验 3；准备家长之夜",0],["h2","Test Review(20 mins)","讲评测验 Test Review（20 mins）",0],["p","After you have handed out the test, ask the students to quietly check their mistakes and tell them to try to correct those mistakes by themselves. Go over some of the most commonly made mistakes and explain the key grammar points again.","发下测验卷后，请学生安静地检查自己的错误，并试着自己订正。讲评一些最常见的错误，再说明一次重要的语法重点。",0],["h2","Outing (80 mins)","户外活动 Outing（80 mins）",0],["p","Since this is their last class of level 4 and everything is finished, the teacher can find a park nearby the school and have a picnic with games. Ask the students to bring some snacks for the picnic. Also bring some toys like frisbees, kites, etc. It's a good time to review a little bit of everything in level 4 with the food they bring and anything you see in the park. Make sure to remind the kids to \"Study as hard as you can and also play as hard as you can!\" Here is an activity the teacher can use for the outing - Play a game of \"Capture the Flag\". Prepare some handkerchiefs before going to the park. Separate the class into two teams and let the teams face each other before starting the game. The rule is easy. Each student will have a handkerchief hang out from their pocket. To win the game, the teams must try to grab all the handkerchiefs from the other team.","这是第 4 级的最后一堂课，所有内容都教完了，老师可以找一个学校附近的公园，举办野餐和游戏。请学生带一些野餐点心，也带一些玩具，例如飞盘、风筝等。这是用学生带来的食物和公园里看到的东西，稍微复习第 4 级所有内容的好时机。一定要提醒孩子：“认真读书，也要尽情玩乐！”以下是户外活动可以用的游戏：“抢旗子”。去公园前先准备一些手帕。把全班分成两队，开始前让两队面对面。规则很简单：每位学生把一条手帕挂在口袋外面，要赢得游戏，必须抢走对方所有的手帕。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h2","Progress Report Book","学习进度手册",0],["li","(1) Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement in it. Besides, it is a good time to give students reward cards according to their performances today.","(1) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","(2) Tell them to preview for the next lesson and listen to the tapes at home.","(2) 请学生回家预习下一课并听录音带。",0],["li","(3) Remind the students that there will be a telephone teaching session tonight.","(3) 提醒学生今晚有电话教学。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 12","电话教学教材 12",0],["li","1. What number is between number 22 and 24?",null,0],["li","2. Make a sentence with Don't?","2. 用 \"Don't\" 造句。",0],["li","3. Make a sentence with please?","3. 用 \"please\" 造句。",0],["li","4. How do you spell \"seventeen\"?",null,0],["li","5. How do you spell \"trumpet\"?",null,0]],"g":[[3,["None"]],[5,["None"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Activity Day","m":110},{"z":"作业本解答","t":"Homework Exercises Answers","k":"img","p":[79,80,81,82],"b":[],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0},{"z":"语法／发音总整理","t":"Grammar/Phonics Summaries","k":"img","p":[83,84],"b":[],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0},{"z":"EEC“Let's Check”解答","t":"EEC \"Let's Check\" Answers","k":"img","p":[85],"b":[],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0}];